</node>
<node id="American Diabetes Association">
  <data key="d0">American Diabetes Association</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The American Diabetes Association (ADA) is a leading professional medical organization dedicated to diabetes care, research, education, and advocacy. It plays a central role in shaping clinical practice and public understanding of diabetes through the development, publication, and regular updating of evidence-based guidelines. Its most prominent contribution is the annual "Standards of Medical Care in Diabetes," a comprehensive set of clinical practice recommendations published in the journal *Diabetes Care*. These guidelines cover the classification, diagnosis, and management of all forms of diabetes, including type 1, type 2, gestational diabetes, and rare or atypical forms. The ADA provides detailed guidance on pharmacologic therapies, insulin use—with emphasis on best practices such as site rotation to prevent complications like lipohypertrophy—and the integration of diabetes technologies such as continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion (CSII) and insulin pumps.

In addition to its flagship standards, the American Diabetes Association has issued specialized position statements and consensus reports on topics such as the management of type 1 diabetes, youth-onset type 2 diabetes, and cystic fibrosis-related diabetes (CFRD), often in collaboration with other professional societies. Notably, the ADA has published specific clinical guidelines addressing the diagnosis and treatment of type 2 diabetes in children and adolescents, reflecting its commitment to age-specific care. The organization also standardizes nomenclature and diagnostic criteria for diabetes, reinforcing its role as a key authority in unifying clinical terminology and practice.

The American Diabetes Association supports public health through tools like the ADA Diabetes Risk Test, which helps individuals assess their risk for prediabetes and type 2 diabetes. It funds research, publishes clinical resources—including books on atypical diabetes—and engages in advocacy to improve access to care. Through its educational outreach and global influence, the ADA remains a pivotal institution in advancing diabetes knowledge, shaping policy, and improving outcomes for people affected by diabetes worldwide.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Diabetes Association (ADA) is a leading organization involved in diabetes research, education, and advocacy, and co-authored a position statement on managing hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Diabetes Association co-issued a position statement on patient-centered management of type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed9228bfdd30fe45392a8a9fb8d106b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f739b5aa260687129c0a88dce08d70c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1223db4d3629243420a6e867a9ba6988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7be6907597f74116387925485497fbd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d0d8750807baddcd948055c83422234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bddc99b2e70c378921ff59ddb3b954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-862cb6f254fb8ebb4f3e1080dbf4f53c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f731774e5187eb76527ebeabefeeeb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aebc875b323050c4274610952a881b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce486bcdf26ccc2a6ad63d018a57c974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5cd98bab9909442c09e3fcd5b21fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a775efb764958cf67853f275782e2a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a862c4dc9595df3958bd7626f7145d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-836e865d51bd855e9d073bd7a5ac7657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3d27a8dbb6882ee6a732de5ac202d64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51a13b6846af5dd45aca8b13432e7fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f780163f31c33c2bd7449fb5a87b42ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f76e40d0d9b4211d8c61a53ea298d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a874190e40ad535ac9b317a469571d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb968add601368451243acd6b2322ce0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51943f25319629d0e145186a85c3b59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7841f818e5dcdd6ef3c0c2951cf8a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a109575f50250430ade32316446ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4d53f9928520ac64a197b59db6862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3628fc721a312bfbaace1de3a4d877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054</data>
