  <data key="d0">Skin Lesion</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin lesions are potential complications from improper insulin injection practices, such as failing to rotate sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin lesions are potential complications from improper insulin injection practices, such as failing to rotate sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin lesions are potential complications from improper insulin injection practices, such as failing to rotate sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin lesions are potential complications from improper insulin injection practices, such as failing to rotate sites.</data>
