<node id="Cetonas">
  <data key="d0">Cetonas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cetonas are substances produced by the body when it burns fat for energy due to insufficient glucose, often occurring in uncontrolled diabetes or illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetonas are substances produced by the body when it burns fat for energy due to insufficient glucose, often occurring in uncontrolled diabetes or illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetonas are substances produced when the body burns fat for energy due to insufficient glucose, commonly occurring in uncontrolled diabetes or illness.&lt;SEP&gt;As cetonas são substâncias metabólicas que devem ser testadas em pessoas com diabetes, especialmente em situações como glicemia elevada ou infecção.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
