  <data key="d5">1776648231</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cetoacidose Diabética">
  <data key="d0">Cetoacidose Diabética</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Cetoacidose Diabética is a serious complication of diabetes caused by high levels of ketones and requires urgent medical treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidose Diabética is a serious complication of diabetes caused by high levels of ketones and requires urgent medical treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidose diabética é uma complicação aguda do diabetes cuja ocorrência é reduzida em pacientes usando bomba de insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidose diabética é uma complicação aguda do DM1 que pode ser prevenida com início imediato da insulina após o diagnóstico.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidose diabética is a serious complication of diabetes characterized by high blood ketones (β-OHB &gt; 3 mmol/L), requiring urgent medical attention.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic ketoacidosis can occur at diagnosis in both type 1 and type 2 diabetes, particularly in multiethnic populations, and may be a presenting feature of ketosis-prone type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidose Diabética is a serious complication of diabetes caused by high ketone levels, requiring urgent medical attention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f739b5aa260687129c0a88dce08d70c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-993ef3cd53aca15e211c42cb48f1b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-820baa925065d77af22437295373f686&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe02e01a76e16ee223061696b4bcb10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467</data>
