<node id="Monitoramento De Cetonas">
  <data key="d0">Monitoramento De Cetonas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitoramento De Cetonas involves testing for ketone levels in urine or blood using specific tools like test strips or a blood ketone meter.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoramento De Cetonas involves testing for ketone levels in urine or blood using specific tools like test strips or a blood ketone meter.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoramento De Cetonas involves testing for ketones in urine or blood to prevent or detect diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467</data>
