</node>
<node id="Teste De Cetonas Na Urina">
  <data key="d0">Teste De Cetonas Na Urina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste De Cetonas Na Urina uses dipsticks to detect the presence of ketones in urine, providing an indication of metabolic state.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste De Cetonas Na Urina uses dipsticks to detect the presence of ketones in urine, providing an indication of metabolic state.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638221</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Teste De Cetonas No Sangue">
  <data key="d0">Teste De Cetonas No Sangue</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste De Cetonas No Sangue measures β-hidroxibutirato (β-OHB) in the blood using a specialized device, offering faster and more reliable results than urine tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste De Cetonas No Sangue measures β-hidroxibutirato (β-OHB) in the blood using a specialized device, offering faster and more reliable results than urine tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638221</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="β-Hidroxibutirato">
  <data key="d0">β-Hidroxibutirato</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">β-Hidroxibutirato, or β-OHB, is a primary ketone body measured in blood to assess ketone production and risk of diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;β-Hidroxibutirato, or β-OHB, is a primary ketone body measured in blood to assess ketone production and risk of diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;β-Hydroxybutyrate (β-OHB) is a ketone body measured in the blood, more effective than urinary ketones for preventing hospitalizations due to ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;β-Hidroxibutirato (β-OHB) is a primary ketone body measured in blood to assess ketosis and risk of ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;O β-hidroxibutirato (β-OHB) é uma substância medida por glicosímetros para avaliar os níveis de cetonas no sangue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126839e244bb40d6238ea2814bdda12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
