</node>
<node id="Tempo No Alvo">
  <data key="d0">Tempo No Alvo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tempo No Alvo refers to the percentage of time a person's glucose levels remain within the target range of 70–180 mg/dL, ideally at least 70% of the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Tempo No Alvo refers to the percentage of time a person's glucose levels remain within the target range of 70–180 mg/dL, ideally at least 70% of the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Tempo No Alvo refers to the percentage of time a patient's glucose levels remain within the target range of 70–180 mg/dL.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467</data>
