<node id="Glicemia Em Jejum">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia Em Jejum</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia Em Jejum is the blood glucose level measured after fasting, with target values varying by patient group.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Em Jejum is the blood glucose level measured after fasting, with target values varying by patient group.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia em jejum é o valor utilizado como referência para ajustar a dose de insulina basal.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Em Jejum is the measurement of blood glucose after a period of fasting, used as a diagnostic and monitoring parameter in diabetes.</data>
