  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia Após As Refeições refers to post-meal blood glucose levels, typically measured two hours after eating, with a target of less than 180 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Após As Refeições refers to post-meal blood glucose levels, typically measured two hours after eating, with a target of less than 180 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Após As Refeições refers to postprandial blood glucose levels, measured two hours after meals to assess glycemic control.</data>
