<node id="Traditional Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Traditional Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional glucose monitoring involves finger-prick tests using a glucometer to measure blood glucose levels at discrete intervals.&lt;SEP&gt;Traditional glucose monitoring involves finger-prick tests using a glucometer to measure blood glucose levels at discrete intervals.&lt;SEP&gt;Traditional glucose monitoring involves finger-prick blood tests using a glucometer, which CGM can reduce or replace in many cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Traditional glucose monitoring involves finger-prick blood tests using a glucometer, which CGM can reduce or replace in many cases.</data>
