<node id="Dexcom">
  <data key="d0">Dexcom</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Dexcom is a continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) system designed to measure glucose levels in real time and transmit the data directly to a mobile device, such as a smartphone, enabling users to monitor their blood sugar levels continuously without the need for traditional finger-prick tests. The system functions as a standalone device, operating independently and providing real-time glucose readings that are displayed on a connected cellular device, offering convenience and improved diabetes management.

Dexcom is approved in certain regions, including the United States, for making insulin dosing decisions without requiring confirmatory finger-prick glucose measurements, highlighting its reliability and regulatory recognition. This approval underscores its role as a medically trusted tool for individuals managing insulin therapy. However, despite its availability and regulatory clearance in some countries, Dexcom is not yet available in Brazil, limiting access for patients in that region. Multiple descriptions confirm this absence, indicating a consistent gap in market availability.

The system is consistently described as a real-time glucose sensor that continuously tracks blood glucose levels and wirelessly sends updates to a mobile phone, allowing for timely interventions and better glycemic control. Whether referred to in English or Portuguese, the core functionality remains the same: continuous monitoring, real-time data transmission, and integration with personal devices for immediate user feedback. Overall, Dexcom represents an advanced CGM solution with established use in select regions but remains inaccessible to patients in Brazil as of the provided information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a08dc7008091e5ab01812c301e0aab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c804699375feba4c866cc3a1bc00211</data>
