<node id="REPLACE-BG Study">
  <data key="d0">REPLACE-BG Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The REPLACE-BG study demonstrated that using CGM data directly for insulin dosing decisions is safe and effective in well-controlled adults with Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The REPLACE-BG study demonstrated that using CGM data directly for insulin dosing decisions is safe and effective in well-controlled adults with Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The REPLACE-BG study demonstrated that using CGM data directly for insulin dosing decisions is safe and effective for well-controlled adults with type 1 diabetes, eliminating the need for confirmatory finger-prick tests.&lt;SEP&gt;The REPLACE-BG study demonstrated that using CGM data directly for insulin dosing decisions is safe and effective for well-controlled adults with type 1 diabetes, eliminating the need for confirmatory finger-prick tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214</data>
