  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lanceta is a medical device used for pricking the skin to obtain blood samples, often used in diabetes management and requiring safe disposal with sharps.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanceta is a medical device used for pricking the skin to obtain blood samples, often used in diabetes management and requiring safe disposal with sharps.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanceta is a medical device used for pricking the skin to obtain blood samples, often used in diabetes management and requiring safe disposal with sharps.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanceta is a medical device used for pricking the skin to obtain blood samples, often used in diabetes management and requiring safe disposal with sharps.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanceta is a small needle used to puncture the skin of the finger to obtain a blood sample for glucose testing.</data>
