<node id="GMI">
  <data key="d0">GMI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GMI, or Glucose Management Indicator, is a metric calculated from continuous glucose sensor data to estimate average glucose levels and provide insight into glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;GMI, or Glucose Management Indicator, is a metric calculated from continuous glucose sensor data to estimate average glucose levels and provide insight into glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;GMI, or Glucose Management Indicator, is a metric calculated from continuous glucose sensor data to estimate average glucose levels and provide insight into glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;GMI, or Glucose Management Indicator, is a metric calculated from continuous glucose sensor data to estimate average glucose levels and provide insight into glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;GMI (Glucose Management Indicator) is a newer metric similar to HbA1c but calculated from continuous glucose sensor data, providing a more immediate and accurate estimate of average glucose levels.</data>
