<node id="Diabetes Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes treatment involves managing blood sugar levels through monitoring, medication, and lifestyle changes to prevent complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes treatment involves managing blood sugar levels through monitoring, medication, and lifestyle changes to prevent complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes treatment involves managing blood sugar levels through monitoring, medication, and lifestyle changes to prevent complications.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical regimen involving injectable therapies such as insulin and GLP-1 agonists for managing blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes treatment involves medical strategies and technologies to manage blood glucose levels, including insulin therapy and pump use.</data>
