  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Complications refer to health issues such as eye, kidney, nerve, and cardiovascular diseases that are associated with high blood sugar levels in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Complications refer to health issues such as eye, kidney, nerve, and cardiovascular diseases that are associated with high blood sugar levels in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Complications refer to health issues such as eye, kidney, nerve, and cardiovascular diseases that are associated with high blood sugar levels in diabetes.</data>
