<node id="Genetic Blood Disorders">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Blood Disorders</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Genetic blood disorders are conditions that affect hemoglobin structure or red blood cell lifespan, potentially leading to inaccurate HbA1c test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic blood disorders are conditions that affect hemoglobin structure or red blood cell lifespan, potentially leading to inaccurate HbA1c test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic blood disorders are conditions that affect hemoglobin structure or red blood cell lifespan, potentially leading to inaccurate HbA1c test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic blood disorders can lead to inaccurate HbA1c results due to abnormalities in hemoglobin structure or red blood cell turnover.</data>
