<node id="70% Alcohol">
  <data key="d0">70% Alcohol</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">70% alcohol is used for skin preparation before insulin application and must be allowed to dry completely before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;70% alcohol is used for skin preparation before insulin application and must be allowed to dry completely before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;70% alcohol is used for skin preparation before insulin application and must be allowed to dry completely before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;An antiseptic solution used to disinfect the rubber stopper of an insulin vial prior to needle insertion.</data>
