<node id="Unexplained Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Unexplained Hypoglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Unexplained hypoglycemia is a condition where blood sugar drops unexpectedly, associated with lipohypertrophy and improper insulin injection practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637661</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daily Insulin Dose">
  <data key="d0">Daily Insulin Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily insulin dose refers to the total amount of insulin administered per day, found to be higher in patients with lipohypertrophy (56 UI/day) compared to those without (41 UI/day).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637661</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multicenter Study">
  <data key="d0">Multicenter Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A multicenter study involving 430 diabetic patients in Spain assessed insulin injection techniques and prevalence of lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
