</node>
<node id="Brazilian Diabetes Society">
  <data key="d0">Brazilian Diabetes Society</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Brazilian Diabetes Society (Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes, SBD) is the leading medical authority in Brazil responsible for developing, issuing, and updating clinical guidelines and technical recommendations on diabetes classification, diagnosis, and management. It is widely recognized as the primary organization shaping diabetes care standards in the country, with its publications serving as foundational references for clinical practice, health policy, and patient education. The Society publishes the *Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes*, a comprehensive clinical practice guideline that is regularly updated—most recently in 2020—to reflect advances in diabetes care, including insulin therapy, patient education, and the integration of technologies such as insulin pumps.

The scope of the Brazilian Diabetes Society's work extends beyond diabetes to include related metabolic conditions. It has issued position statements and guidelines addressing the screening and management of metabolic dysfunction-associated steatotic liver disease (MASLD) in individuals with type 2 diabetes, prediabetes, or other metabolic risk factors. These recommendations are part of broader efforts to address the interconnected nature of metabolic disorders and improve holistic patient care. The Society’s guidelines incorporate clinical evidence alongside practical considerations such as cost, healthcare accessibility, funding constraints, and the safe disposal of medical waste associated with insulin therapy.

Through a multidisciplinary approach, the Brazilian Diabetes Society ensures its recommendations are both scientifically rigorous and adaptable to the diverse realities of the Brazilian healthcare system. By addressing technical, economic, and logistical challenges—particularly in the use of insulin and advanced treatment modalities—the Society plays a central role in improving diabetes outcomes nationwide. Its ongoing efforts support healthcare professionals, inform public health initiatives, and enhance patient care across varied clinical and socioeconomic contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brazilian Diabetes Society is a professional organization that issues clinical guidelines for diabetes care in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brazilian Diabetes Society (SBD) is the organization that recommends individualized glycemic control targets for different clinical situations in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brazilian Diabetes Society is a professional organization that issues clinical guidelines for diabetes management, including recommendations on HbA1c and blood glucose targets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brazilian Diabetes Society is the organization that published the clinical guidelines for diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b712afd345ff5f7503205905d3131f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fff9929a18d525e3805a8ed08356d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51943f25319629d0e145186a85c3b59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb7f10473b84f2de23852febe7ef317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f87c8aceb9340a61d8283da6282edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dad8318811ce10b7f639b13057d611f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcce093409f85a2fbec9a754f86c8e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e35953dbfdebbbab4bf83ec032ccfb7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f94f216119cfdc3c74eab51c88a823&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017257ae0e7fcc5a0a1be0ddc435fe8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f7252ca9147660b04b7329edbe843f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eccbaa35bd49db810bbf9c4a8d650469&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad6cd6b0bad77397aa6685ccb2cfaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02fb9dc2bae2939b212aa5df09194ee4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
