  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U100 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U100 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">U100 insulin is the concentration available in Brazil, requiring syringes graduated in international units for accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 insulin is a concentration of insulin available in Brazil, prescribed in international units and requiring appropriately calibrated syringes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637672</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="mL Syringe">
  <data key="d0">mL Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An mL syringe is not recommended for insulin administration due to high risk of dosing errors since insulin is prescribed in international units.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637672</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R2 Recommendation">
  <data key="d0">R2 Recommendation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">R2 Recommendation states that insulin pen use is recommended due to better glycated hemoglobin targets and lower hypoglycemia incidence compared to syringe use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637672</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R3 Recommendation">
  <data key="d0">R3 Recommendation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">R3 Recommendation advises using fixed-needle syringes with international unit scales to avoid dead space and increase dose accuracy for insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637672</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence Summary">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Summary</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Evidence Summary includes a systematic review of eight databases selecting 17 studies to evaluate insulin pen efficacy versus syringes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
