  <data key="d5">1776637673</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycemic Variability">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Variability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, which can be influenced by improper insulin administration techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic variability measures how much blood glucose levels fluctuate throughout the day, with lower variability indicating more stable glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, which are reduced with long-acting insulin analogs compared to NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, an important metric in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels throughout the day, which can impact diabetes outcomes and is minimized through stable glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels and is not accurately captured by HbA1c alone, requiring complementary monitoring methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic Variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, measured by the coefficient of variation, recommended to be less than 36%.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986fc7ecc813c4b7942964d7fd64d429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f7252ca9147660b04b7329edbe843f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eccbaa35bd49db810bbf9c4a8d650469</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689264</data>
