  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sharps disposal involves safely discarding used insulin needles and syringes in puncture-proof containers, as regulated by technical and legal guidelines in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sharps disposal refers to the safe discard of used needles and syringes in puncture-proof containers to prevent injury and contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Sharps disposal involves discarding used needles in a rigid container to prevent injury and contamination, never in regular household waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Sharps disposal involves discarding used needles in a rigid container to prevent injury and contamination, never in regular household waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Sharps disposal involves discarding used needles in a rigid container to prevent injury and contamination, never in regular household waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Sharps disposal involves placing used syringes and needles into a rigid plastic container, such as a fabric softener or disinfectant bottle, and returning it to the nearest health center.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
