<node id="Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes, also known internationally as the Brazilian Diabetes Society, is a leading Brazilian medical organization dedicated to advancing diabetes research, treatment, public awareness, and clinical management. Recognized as the foremost authority on diabetes care in Brazil, the organization plays a pivotal role in developing, publishing, and disseminating evidence-based clinical guidelines that shape the diagnosis, classification, and management of diabetes across the country. These guidelines are regularly updated to reflect the latest scientific advancements and clinical best practices, with comprehensive editions released in 2020 and 2023.

The clinical guidelines issued by Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes cover a wide range of diabetes-related topics, including insulin therapy, injectable treatments, and insulin application techniques, with a particular focus on type 1 diabetes. The organization also provides specialized recommendations for managing blood glucose levels in pregnant women, contributing to improved outcomes in gestational diabetes, and establishes standardized protocols for the diagnosis and screening of type 2 diabetes to ensure early and consistent detection nationwide. These protocols are widely adopted in clinical practice and serve as a reference for healthcare professionals throughout Brazil.

In addition to its authoritative guidelines, Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes produces educational materials for both healthcare providers and patients, supporting enhanced clinical knowledge and improved patient outcomes. The organization actively promotes professional training, public health initiatives, and policy development in diabetes care, integrating scientific research with practical recommendations. Through its ongoing efforts in research, education, and the dissemination of high-quality clinical guidance, Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes continues to reinforce its mission of improving diabetes management and care standards across Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is the Brazilian Diabetes Society, responsible for issuing clinical guidelines on diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a medical organization that issues clinical guidelines for diabetes treatment in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a professional organization responsible for issuing clinical guidelines and recommendations for diabetes management in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes (Brazilian Diabetes Society) publishes clinical guidelines for diabetes treatment in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bac0c0310322750fb929b2e0ccc7c0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f15567df531c98c7bb5ae57a2836b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7da978df74ee7f686dcc3c260d75577&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f4c3fffcb1c054dd2b100c36c64717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a3958ecd422660b4cd1e47e31e1b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5ba3e0460b418d02918f3b8aa380e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3c544741e57de2429f8284d89f5688f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce486bcdf26ccc2a6ad63d018a57c974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe02e01a76e16ee223061696b4bcb10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb204c2d596853e5abff6c8dd0938ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cc90e1dea7f4271dde1545434c62508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0842e3c99a8c4dc96abdcb05ee7fe0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7841f818e5dcdd6ef3c0c2951cf8a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8707947fb493803b7f3759b0105eda4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a109575f50250430ade32316446ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e72b56afa6bad1b13c937a3ff9bd13d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2977bb9a41689e74de2c536343624744&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a582234d1973113fc899208b5457f47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60b2f272c0228f3954c05180dd35ce90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0778abb680b777bec45d5985b757c743</data>
