  <data key="d0">Pen Devices For Insulin Self-Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pen devices for insulin self-administration are medical tools designed to facilitate easier and more accurate insulin delivery compared to traditional vial and syringe methods.</data>
