<node id="Needle And Vial">
  <data key="d0">Needle And Vial</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle and vial is a traditional method of insulin administration involving a syringe and glass vial, often compared with insulin pen devices in terms of efficacy and safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
