<node id="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn Cartridges">
  <data key="d0">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn Cartridges</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Neutral protamine Hagedorn cartridges are insulin delivery devices used in pen injectors, requiring proper mixing before use to ensure effective pharmacokinetics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
