</node>
<node id="In-Use Insulin Pens">
  <data key="d0">In-Use Insulin Pens</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">In-use insulin pens are insulin delivery devices currently being used by patients, whose insulin stability can be affected by environmental temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
