<node id="Needle Length Recommendations">
  <data key="d0">Needle Length Recommendations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle length recommendations are clinical guidelines developed based on studies of skin and subcutaneous adipose layer thickness to ensure safe and effective insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
