<node id="Children With Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Children With Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Children with diabetes are a patient group studied to determine appropriate injection techniques and skin thickness for insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Children with diabetes, particularly type 1, are at higher risk and should be monitored for ketone levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb</data>
