  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Exp Clin Endocrinol Diabetes is a scientific journal that published a study on insulin pen stability in September 2021.&lt;SEP&gt;Exp Clin Endocrinol Diabetes is a journal that published a 2019 article on the definition, classification, and diagnosis of diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Exp Clin Endocrinol Diabetes is a scientific journal that published an article on diabetes classification and diagnosis in 2019.</data>
