  <data key="d5">1776644001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Stability">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin stability refers to the maintenance of insulin's chemical and biological integrity under various storage conditions, including temperature variations up to 37°C.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin stability refers to the maintenance of insulin's potency and effectiveness when stored and handled according to guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639039</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Storage Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage temperature, including refrigeration (2–8°C), room temperature (~29.7°C), and elevated temperature (37°C), was evaluated for its effect on insulin stability over 28 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776637696</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Application Technique">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Application Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin application technique refers to the proper methods of insulin injection, including site selection, needle use, and training, which impact therapy safety and efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of instructions for applying insulin using pen devices, including preparation, injection, and disposal steps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
