  <data key="d2">Maria Gabriela Secco Cavicchioli is one of the authors of the article on insulin application techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Maria Gabriela Secco Cavicchioli is one of the coordinators of the capillary glucose testing guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Maria Gabriela Secco Cavicchioli is one of the coordinators of the capillary glucose testing guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Maria Gabriela Secco Cavicchioli is one of the coordinators of the capillary glucose testing guidelines.</data>
