<node id="Insulin Injection Technique">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection technique refers to the proper method of subcutaneous insulin administration, including needle length, angle, and use of skin fold to prevent intramuscular injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injection technique includes proper skin preparation, needle angle, injection speed, and post-injection needle dwell time to ensure accurate delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injection technique includes proper skin preparation, needle angle, injection speed, and post-injection needle dwell time to ensure accurate delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of procedures for preparing and administering insulin using a syringe, including steps to prevent air bubbles and ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Angle">
  <data key="d0">Injection Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection angle refers to the degree at which the needle is inserted into the skin, typically 90° or 45°, depending on needle length and patient characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;The angle at which insulin is administered, either 45 degrees for children or 90 degrees for adults, depending on needle size.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection angle depends on needle length and patient age: 45 degrees for longer needles or in children, and 90 degrees for shorter needles or in adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reuse of Syringes and Needles">
