  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metas glicêmicas are target blood glucose ranges that individuals with diabetes should aim to maintain for optimal health.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas Glicêmicas refers to glycemic targets for blood glucose levels in adults, pregnant women, and children with diabetes.</data>
