  <data key="d2">Chat is a healthcare assistant providing guidance and education to the patient on insulin use, storage, and application techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Chat is a chatbot with an empathetic, educational, and supportive personality designed to guide patients in diabetes self-care.</data>
