  <data key="d0">Açúcar</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Açúcar refers to blood glucose levels, commonly used by patients to describe their diabetes condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Açúcar is a carbohydrate source used to treat low blood sugar, typically dissolved in water.</data>
