  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Aplicativo refers to mobile software that can automatically record glucose readings and related health data if compatible with the measuring device.&lt;SEP&gt;Aplicativo is a software application used to record and track glucose measurements, along with time, meal context, and symptoms.</data>
