<node id="Hand Luggage">
  <data key="d0">Hand Luggage</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hand luggage is the recommended place to carry insulin during travel to avoid exposure to extreme temperatures in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Hand luggage is the recommended place to carry insulin during travel to avoid exposure to extreme temperatures in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Hand luggage is the recommended place to carry insulin during travel to avoid exposure to extreme temperatures in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Hand luggage is the recommended place to carry insulin during travel to maintain control over storage conditions.</data>
