  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Direct sunlight is a risk factor for insulin degradation and should be avoided during transport and storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Direct sunlight is a risk factor for insulin degradation and should be avoided during transport and storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Direct sunlight is a risk factor for insulin degradation and should be avoided during transport and storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Direct sunlight is a risk factor during insulin transport as it can degrade the medication.</data>
