  <data key="d2">The car glove compartment is an unsuitable location for insulin storage due to potential overheating.&lt;SEP&gt;The car glove compartment is an unsuitable location for insulin storage due to potential overheating.&lt;SEP&gt;The car glove compartment is an unsuitable location for insulin storage due to potential overheating.&lt;SEP&gt;The car glove compartment is an unsuitable place for insulin storage due to potential exposure to high temperatures.</data>
