  <data key="d2">The car dashboard area is a high-heat zone and should not be used for insulin storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The car dashboard area is a high-heat zone and should not be used for insulin storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The car dashboard area is a high-heat zone and should not be used for insulin storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The car dashboard or glove compartment is an unsafe place to leave insulin due to extreme temperature fluctuations.&lt;SEP&gt;The car dashboard is an inappropriate location for insulin storage as it can become excessively hot from direct sunlight.</data>
