<node id="Application Site">
  <data key="d0">Application Site</data>
  <data key="d1">bodypart</data>
  <data key="d2">An application site is a body area, such as the abdomen or thigh, where insulin is injected subcutaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;Application site is the location on the body where insulin is injected, which can experience pain or irritation if cold insulin is used directly from the refrigerator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lancet">
  <data key="d0">Lancet</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lancet refers to both a medical device and a prestigious medical journal, and the distinction between these two entities must be clarified based on context. 

As a medical device, a lancet is a small needle used to puncture the skin during a finger prick, primarily to collect a blood sample for glucose testing in individuals with diabetes. This tool is commonly used in conjunction with blood glucose meters to monitor blood sugar levels, enabling self-management of diabetes through regular testing.

As a publication, The Lancet is a leading, peer-reviewed medical journal with a long-standing reputation for publishing high-impact clinical research. It has featured numerous significant studies related to diabetes and metabolic health, including the BEGIN basal-bolus trial comparing insulin degludec and insulin glargine, and a multicentre randomized trial on closed-loop insulin delivery systems for patients with suboptimally controlled type 1 diabetes. The journal also published the OpT2mise randomized controlled trial, which evaluated the effectiveness of insulin pump therapy versus multiple daily injections in managing type 2 diabetes. Beyond diabetes, The Lancet has disseminated research on broader public health topics, such as glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency, the ADDITION-Europe study on early detection and treatment of type 2 diabetes, and a World Health Organization expert consultation on body mass index (BMI) classifications for Asian populations. Collectively, these publications underscore The Lancet’s role as a critical platform for advancing global clinical and public health knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lancet is a peer-reviewed medical journal that published a meta-analysis on diabetes and vascular disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lancet is a peer-reviewed medical journal that published a meta-analysis on diabetes and vascular disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lancet is a medical journal that published meta-analyses and clinical trial results on glucose control and cardiovascular outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e1858f15899659bc0116977a6e1e000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce5b147555a2c6ba2644e98fb3d31f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15a18ecfcb20fceb4fd80ab22186964e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050dc3a498d3027939b93706cbdb7f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a796990fe8edf70e4463124a0233c32c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3628fc721a312bfbaace1de3a4d877</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689280</data>
