</node>
<node id="Skin Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Skin Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin preparation involves cleaning the injection site with water and soap or 70% alcohol before insulin administration to prevent infection.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin preparation involves cleaning the injection site with alcohol and waiting for it to dry before insulin application to reduce infection risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin preparation involves cleaning the injection site with alcohol and waiting for it to dry before insulin application to reduce infection risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin preparation involves cleaning the injection site with alcohol and waiting for it to dry before insulin application to reduce infection risk.</data>
