  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection technique includes proper needle insertion angle, speed of injection, and duration of needle retention to ensure full insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection technique refers to the correct method of inserting the needle into the skin with a smooth motion and maintaining the skin fold until the full dose is delivered.</data>
