  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Unopened insulin must be stored in the refrigerator at a controlled temperature to maintain its potency until use.&lt;SEP&gt;Unopened insulin must be stored in the refrigerator between 2 °C and 8 °C and must never be frozen.&lt;SEP&gt;Unopened insulin must be stored in the refrigerator between 2 °C and 8 °C and must never be frozen.</data>
