</node>
<node id="Illness">
  <data key="d0">Illness</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Illness, including infection or fever, can increase the body's need for insulin temporarily due to stress-induced hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where a person feels unwell, leading to unstable blood glucose levels and the need for additional monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Illness, including infection or fever, can increase the body's need for insulin temporarily due to stress-induced hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where a person feels unwell, leading to unstable blood glucose levels and the need for additional monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
