<node id="Caregiver">
  <data key="d0">Caregiver</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A caregiver is someone who assists in the insulin administration process and is trained alongside the patient to ensure proper technique and understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;A caregiver assists in diabetes care and must understand correct insulin application techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;A caregiver assists in diabetes care and must understand correct insulin application techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;A caregiver is someone who assists in the insulin administration process and is trained alongside the patient to ensure proper technique and understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;A caregiver is someone who assists in the insulin administration process and is trained alongside the patient to ensure proper technique and understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;A caregiver is an individual who may assist a person with diabetes in safely using an insulin pump or other diabetes device.</data>
