  <data key="d2">An electronic prescription is a digital method of prescribing medication that helps prevent errors caused by illegible handwriting.&lt;SEP&gt;An electronic prescription is a digital method of prescribing medication that helps prevent errors caused by illegible handwriting.&lt;SEP&gt;An electronic prescription is a digital method of prescribing medication that helps prevent errors caused by illegible handwriting.</data>
