  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Double checking is a safety procedure in which two healthcare professionals verify insulin preparation and administration to reduce the risk of errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Double checking is a safety procedure in which two healthcare professionals verify insulin preparation and administration to reduce the risk of errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Double checking is a safety procedure in which two healthcare professionals verify insulin preparation and administration to reduce the risk of errors.</data>
