  <data key="d0">Medical Abbreviation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical abbreviations in prescriptions can lead to misinterpretation and medication errors, so clear and unambiguous writing is recommended.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical abbreviations in prescriptions can lead to misinterpretation and medication errors, so clear and unambiguous writing is recommended.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical abbreviations in prescriptions can lead to misinterpretation and medication errors, so clear and unambiguous writing is recommended.</data>
