<node id="Thermal Bag">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Bag</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A thermal bag is used to transport insulin safely, maintaining proper temperature without allowing direct contact with ice or cooling elements.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal bag is used to transport insulin safely, maintaining proper temperature without allowing direct contact with ice or cooling elements.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal bag is used to transport insulin safely, maintaining proper temperature without allowing direct contact with ice or cooling elements.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal bag with gel packs or ice is used to maintain proper temperature during insulin transport, ensuring vials do not touch ice directly.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal bag is used to maintain safe temperatures for insulin during transport, often with gel packs to preserve stability.</data>
