  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The vegetable drawer in a refrigerator is one of the recommended places to store insulin, providing a stable temperature away from freezer walls.&lt;SEP&gt;The vegetable drawer in a refrigerator is one of the recommended places to store insulin, providing a stable temperature away from freezer walls.&lt;SEP&gt;The vegetable drawer in a refrigerator is one of the recommended places to store insulin, providing a stable temperature away from freezer walls.</data>
