  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Carry-on luggage is the appropriate place to keep insulin during travel to protect it from extreme temperatures in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Carry-on luggage is the appropriate place to keep insulin during travel to protect it from extreme temperatures in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Carry-on luggage is the appropriate place to keep insulin during travel to protect it from extreme temperatures in checked baggage.</data>
