<node id="Insulin U100">
  <data key="d0">Insulin U100</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin U100 is the most common type of insulin in Brazil, measured in units (UI), and requires the use of U100 syringes for accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin U100 is the most common type of insulin in Brazil, measured in units and requiring U100 syringes for proper dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin U100 is the most common type of insulin in Brazil, measured in units and requiring U100 syringes for proper dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin U100 is the most common type of insulin in Brazil, measured in units (UI), and requires the use of U100 syringes for accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin U100 is the most common type of insulin in Brazil, measured in units (UI), and requires the use of U100 syringes for accurate dosing.</data>
