  <data key="d2">U40 insulin is a type of insulin with a different concentration, requiring special syringes calibrated for its dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;U40 insulin is a type of insulin with a different concentration, requiring special syringes calibrated for its dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;U40 insulin is a type of insulin with a different concentration, requiring special syringes calibrated for its dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;U40 insulin is a concentration of insulin used in some countries, requiring specific syringes for accurate dosing.</data>
