<node id="U100 Syringe">
  <data key="d0">U100 Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U100 syringes are specifically designed for use with U100 insulin and are marked in insulin units; they come in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities with fixed or removable needles.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 syringes are designed for use with Insulin U100, available in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities with fine gradations for accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 syringes are designed for use with Insulin U100, available in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities with fine gradations for accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 syringes are specifically designed for use with U100 insulin and are marked in insulin units; they come in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities with fixed or removable needles.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 syringes are specifically designed for use with U100 insulin and are marked in insulin units; they come in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities with fixed or removable needles.</data>
