<node id="12.7 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">12.7 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 12.7 mm needle is a longer needle option for insulin syringes, which may increase the risk of intramuscular injection if not used properly.&lt;SEP&gt;A 12.7 mm needle is a longer needle option for insulin syringes, which may increase the risk of intramuscular injection if not used properly.&lt;SEP&gt;A 12.7 mm needle is a longer needle option for insulin syringes, which may increase the risk of intramuscular injection if not used properly.</data>
