</node>
<node id="13 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">13 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 13 mm needle is associated with syringes that have removable needles and poses a higher risk of reaching muscle tissue, increasing the chance of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A 13 mm needle is associated with syringes that have removable needles and poses a higher risk of reaching muscle tissue, increasing the chance of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A 13 mm needle is associated with syringes that have removable needles and poses a higher risk of reaching muscle tissue, increasing the chance of hypoglycemia.</data>
