<node id="Skin Care">
  <data key="d0">Skin Care</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin care during insulin injection involves keeping the site clean and dry, with alcohol use recommended in public settings but not always at home.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin care during insulin injection involves keeping the site clean and dry, with alcohol use recommended in public settings but not always at home.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin care during insulin injection involves keeping the site clean and dry, with alcohol use recommended in public settings but not always at home.</data>
