</node>
<node id="Ultra-Long-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Ultra-Long-Acting Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultra-Long-Acting Insulin, such as Degludec, starts working in up to 6 hours, has no peak, and lasts up to 42 hours, offering extended basal insulin support.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra-Long-Acting Insulin, such as Degludec, starts working in up to 6 hours, has no peak, and lasts up to 42 hours, offering extended basal insulin support.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra-Long-Acting Insulin, such as Degludec, starts working in up to 6 hours, has no peak, and lasts up to 42 hours, offering extended basal insulin support.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra-long-acting insulin, such as Degludec, takes up to 6 hours to start, has no peak, and lasts up to 42 hours; used for stable basal insulin coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra-long-acting insulin, such as Degludec, takes up to 6 hours to start, has no peak, and lasts up to 42 hours; used for stable basal insulin coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra-long-acting insulin provides basal insulin coverage with duration beyond 24 hours, though specific details are not provided in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2841f77ed9254c0e5372f3c45f6d3da2</data>
