  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Syringe and Vial method is a traditional way of preparing and injecting insulin, requiring careful handling and dosage calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Syringe and Vial method is a traditional way of preparing and injecting insulin, requiring careful handling and dosage calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Syringe and Vial method is a traditional way of preparing and injecting insulin, requiring careful handling and dosage calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The syringe and vial method is a traditional way of administering insulin that requires careful preparation and accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;The syringe and vial method is a traditional way of administering insulin that requires careful preparation and accurate dosing.</data>
