<node id="Insulin Pump (CSII)">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pump (CSII)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Insulin Pump, or Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII), is a device worn on the body that delivers small, adjustable doses of insulin continuously throughout the day and night.&lt;SEP&gt;An Insulin Pump, or Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII), is a device worn on the body that delivers small, adjustable doses of insulin continuously throughout the day and night.&lt;SEP&gt;An Insulin Pump, or Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII), is a device worn on the body that delivers small, adjustable doses of insulin continuously throughout the day and night.</data>
