<node id="Body Weight">
  <data key="d0">Body Weight</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Body weight is a factor used to determine the appropriate insulin dose for an individual.&lt;SEP&gt;Body weight is a factor used to determine the appropriate insulin dose for an individual.&lt;SEP&gt;Body weight is a key factor in diabetes risk, with higher weight increasing risk and specific thresholds used in the ADA risk test.</data>
