  <data key="d0">Post-Surgical Condition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Post-surgical condition may require temporary insulin use to manage blood glucose levels during recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Post-surgical condition may require temporary insulin use to manage blood glucose levels during recovery.</data>
