<node id="Subcutaneous Administration">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous administration refers to the injection of insulin into the fat layer beneath the skin, allowing gradual absorption into the bloodstream.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous administration refers to the injection of insulin into the fat layer beneath the skin, allowing gradual absorption into the bloodstream.</data>
