<node id="Intramuscular Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intramuscular administration is the injection of insulin directly into muscle tissue, resulting in rapid absorption and used only under medical supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Intramuscular administration is the injection of insulin directly into muscle tissue, resulting in rapid absorption and used only under medical supervision.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
