</node>
<node id="Intravenous Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intravenous administration involves injecting insulin directly into a vein, used in emergencies and requiring medical oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous administration involves injecting insulin directly into a vein, used in emergencies and requiring medical oversight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
