<node id="Intradermal Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intradermal administration refers to injecting insulin into the superficial layer of the skin, which delays insulin action and may reduce effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Intradermal administration refers to injecting insulin into the superficial layer of the skin, which delays insulin action and may reduce effectiveness.</data>
