  <data key="d5">1776638090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trimestre Da Gravidez">
  <data key="d0">Trimestre Da Gravidez</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">O trimestre da gravidez define fases do desenvolvimento gestacional, influenciando as recomendações para aplicação de insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;O trimestre da gravidez define fases do desenvolvimento gestacional, influenciando as recomendações para aplicação de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guia De Papel">
  <data key="d0">Guia De Papel</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The guia de papel is a protective paper seal on the pen needle that must be removed before attaching the needle to the injector.&lt;SEP&gt;The guia de papel is a protective paper seal on the pen needle that must be removed before attaching the needle to the injector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa Protetora Interna">
  <data key="d0">Tampa Protetora Interna</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The tampa protetora interna is a colored inner cap on the pen needle that must be removed to prevent the needle from bending during use.&lt;SEP&gt;The tampa protetora interna is a colored inner cap on the pen needle that must be removed to prevent the needle from bending during use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycemia">
  <data key="d0">Glycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemia refers to the concentration of glucose in the blood, which can become unstable due to improper insulin absorption caused by poor injection practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemia refers to the concentration of glucose in the blood, which can become unstable due to improper insulin absorption caused by poor injection practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemia refers to blood glucose levels, including random plasma glucose ≥200 mg/dL or fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dL, used in diagnosing diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemia refers to blood glucose levels, including random plasma glucose ≥200 mg/dL or fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dL, used in diagnosing diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564f10440969233a515af4974c158c4b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776688999</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Injection Angle">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection angle refers to the degree at which the needle enters the skin, typically 90° for short needles and 45° for longer needles or in children, to ensure correct delivery into subcutaneous fat.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injection angle refers to the degree at which the needle enters the skin, typically 90° for short needles and 45° for longer needles or in children, to ensure correct delivery into subcutaneous fat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638114</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Quadrants">
  <data key="d0">Injection Quadrants</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection quadrants refer to the division of an injection site into smaller areas to systematically rotate insulin administration points, maintaining at least 1 cm between injections.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection quadrants refer to the division of an injection site into smaller areas to systematically rotate insulin administration points, maintaining at least 1 cm between injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638118</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="14-Day Reuse Rule">
  <data key="d0">14-Day Reuse Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 14-day reuse rule states that the same injection site should not be reused within 14 days to allow skin healing and prevent tissue damage.&lt;SEP&gt;The 14-day reuse rule states that the same injection site should not be reused within 14 days to allow skin healing and prevent tissue damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A needle used with insulin pens, available in short lengths (4, 5, or 6 mm), designed for subcutaneous injection with minimal discomfort.&lt;SEP&gt;A needle used with insulin pens, available in short lengths (4, 5, or 6 mm), designed for subcutaneous injection with minimal discomfort.&lt;SEP&gt;Agulha é usada na inserção da cânula do conjunto de infusão e deve ser descartada após o uso.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639057</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha de 4 Mm">
  <data key="d0">Agulha de 4 Mm</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 4 mm needle, the shortest available for insulin pens, recommended for children and adults, especially those with low body fat, often used with a skin fold.&lt;SEP&gt;A 4 mm needle, the shortest available for insulin pens, recommended for children and adults, especially those with low body fat, often used with a skin fold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha de Alto Fluxo">
  <data key="d0">Agulha de Alto Fluxo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A high-flow needle with thinner walls that allows insulin to pass more easily, reducing injection force and time, improving comfort and confidence in dose delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-flow needle with thinner walls that allows insulin to pass more easily, reducing injection force and time, improving comfort and confidence in dose delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aplicação de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Aplicação de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of injecting insulin using a pen device, involving steps such as handwashing, preparing materials, priming the pen, setting the dose, and injecting at the correct angle.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of injecting insulin using a pen device, involving steps such as handwashing, preparing materials, priming the pen, setting the dose, and injecting at the correct angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descarte de Agulhas">
  <data key="d0">Descarte de Agulhas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The safe disposal of used needles in a rigid container, followed by delivery to a healthcare unit for proper handling.&lt;SEP&gt;The safe disposal of used needles in a rigid container, followed by delivery to a healthcare unit for proper handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638110</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cold Compress">
  <data key="d0">Cold Compress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A cold compress can slow down insulin absorption, potentially increasing blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A cold compress can slow down insulin absorption, potentially increasing blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A cold compress slows down insulin absorption and may contribute to hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639038</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cold Bath">
  <data key="d0">Cold Bath</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Taking a cold bath may delay insulin action and lead to higher blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Taking a cold bath may delay insulin action and lead to higher blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A cold bath reduces insulin absorption rate by decreasing local blood flow, potentially leading to hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639038</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Family Member">
  <data key="d0">Family Member</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A family member supports the patient in diabetes management and should be educated on proper insulin use.&lt;SEP&gt;A family member supports the patient in diabetes management and should be educated on proper insulin use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
