<node id="Insulin Injection Site">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Site</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection site is the area on the body, such as the abdomen, arm, or leg, where insulin is administered.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injection site is the area on the body, such as the abdomen, arm, or leg, where insulin is administered.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin injection site is the body location where insulin is administered, with selection influenced by physical activity to avoid adverse effects.</data>
