</node>
<node id="Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose is the sugar in the blood that cells use for energy, regulated by insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a type of sugar that serves as the primary energy source for cells and circulates in the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a key metabolic marker in diabetes, with elevated levels indicating hyperglycemia and disease progression.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a simple sugar that serves as a primary energy source and is central to tests for diagnosing diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a simple sugar that serves as a primary energy source and is central to tests for diagnosing diabetes.</data>
