</node>
<node id="Glargine Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Glargine Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glargine insulin is a long-acting insulin that must not be mixed with any other insulin in the same syringe.&lt;SEP&gt;Glargine insulin is a long-acting insulin analog studied in relation to delivery methods and glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1319c06eac1875d14b345f09579021be</data>
