  <data key="d2">Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible for the Novolin N Flexpen product information.&lt;SEP&gt;Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible for the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible for the Novolin N Flexpen product information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f15567df531c98c7bb5ae57a2836b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
