</node>
<node id="Abdominal Wall">
  <data key="d0">Abdominal Wall</data>
  <data key="d1">anatomicallocation</data>
  <data key="d2">The abdominal wall is a recommended site for insulin injection, specifically the lateral regions three finger-widths away from the navel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638666</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Documento Sobre Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Documento Sobre Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Documento Sobre Insulina is a guide detailing proper storage, preparation, and administration of insulin using syringes, developed and revised by healthcare professionals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638666</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Mixture">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Mixture</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d2">Glargine insulin must not be mixed with any other insulin in the same syringe.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638699</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Guidelines">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Guidelines</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d2">The Brazilian Diabetes Society published clinical guidelines in 2020 for insulin use and diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776638702</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="5 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">5 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 5 mm needle is suitable for all individuals and generally does not require a skin fold, except in children under six years old, inserted at a 90-degree angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">6 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 6 mm needle requires a subcutaneous skin fold for all individuals and is inserted at a 90-degree angle for adults and 45-degree for children and adolescents to prevent intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="12 To 13 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">12 To 13 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 12 to 13 mm needle carries a high risk of intramuscular injection in all individuals, requires a skin fold, and must be inserted at a 45-degree angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Skin Fold">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Skin Fold</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The subcutaneous skin fold is a technique used during insulin injection to ensure proper subcutaneous delivery and avoid intramuscular injection, especially with longer needles or in individuals with limited subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insertion Angle">
  <data key="d0">Insertion Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The insertion angle refers to the degree at which the needle is inserted into the skin, varying by needle length and patient characteristics, typically 90° or 45°, to prevent intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High-Flow Needle">
  <data key="d0">High-Flow Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">High-flow needles have extra-thin walls that improve insulin flow, reduce injection force and time, and increase patient confidence in complete insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sistema Único de Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Sistema Único de Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sistema Único de Saúde is Brazil's public healthcare system that began dispensing disposable insulin pens in 2019, improving access to insulin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sistema Único de Saúde is Brazil's public health system that provides healthcare services and distributes medications to patients, including those with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d9cf8845dcb3d8d9a2db7f8843f0fea</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776640125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table 2">
  <data key="d0">Table 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 2 provides recommendations for appropriate use of insulin injection needles, including length, indication, skin fold use, insertion angle, and important observations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Geladeira Doméstica">
  <data key="d0">Geladeira Doméstica</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Geladeira doméstica é utilizada para armazenar insulina entre 2 e 8°C, evitando sua degradação.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Temperatura Ambiente">
  <data key="d0">Temperatura Ambiente</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Temperatura ambiente até 30°C é adequada para armazenamento de insulina em uso, especialmente para canetas recarregáveis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Frasco de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Frasco de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco de insulina é um recipiente utilizado para armazenar insulina, especialmente durante o uso, e deve ser manuseado com cuidado para evitar bolhas de ar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seringa de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Seringa de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Seringa de insulina é um dispositivo com escala graduada em unidades (U100), usado para aplicar doses precisas de insulina, com opções de agulha fixa ou removível.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Fixa">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Fixa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha fixa é parte da seringa de insulina que elimina o espaço residual, permitindo maior precisão na administração da dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Removível">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Removível</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha removível é utilizada em seringas de insulina com capacidade para 100 unidades, mas pode apresentar risco de erro de dose devido ao espaço residual.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolhas de Ar">
  <data key="d0">Bolhas de Ar</data>
  <data key="d1">phenomenon</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolhas de ar podem se formar em frascos, seringas ou canetas de insulina se a insulina for agitada vigorosamente, levando a erros na dosagem.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Erro de Dose">
  <data key="d0">Erro de Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Erro de dose ocorre quando bolhas de ar não removidas ou uso incorreto de dispositivos comprometem a quantidade exata de insulina administrada.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transporte de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Transporte de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">Transporte de insulina exige cuidados, como evitar contato direto com gelo e manter a insulina em bagagem de mão durante viagens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Embalagem Térmica">
  <data key="d0">Embalagem Térmica</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Embalagem térmica ou de isopor é usada para transporte de insulina, mas deve evitar contato direto com gelo para não danificar o medicamento.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bagagem de Mão">
  <data key="d0">Bagagem de Mão</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bagagem de mão é a recomendação para transporte de insulina durante viagens, garantindo controle da temperatura e acesso imediato.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grossi Saa">
  <data key="d0">Grossi Saa</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Grossi SAA é um dos autores da adaptação da Tabela 1 sobre conservação da insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;Grossi SAA is an author who contributed to the source material on insulin storage and handling practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639616</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pascal Pmi">
  <data key="d0">Pascal Pmi</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pascal PMI é um dos autores da adaptação da Tabela 1 sobre conservação da insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;Pascal PMI is an author who contributed to the source material on insulin storage and handling practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639617</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conservação da Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Conservação da Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Conservação da insulina envolve armazenamento sob refrigeração (2–8°C) ou à temperatura ambiente (até 30°C), conforme o tipo e uso.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Validade da Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Validade da Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Validade da insulina varia entre 2 a 3 anos para insulina lacrada e 4 a 8 semanas após abertura para insulina em uso.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refrigeration">
  <data key="d0">Refrigeration</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigeration between 2 and 8°C is required for unopened insulin to preserve its stability and potency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fixed Needle">
  <data key="d0">Fixed Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A fixed needle is attached permanently to an insulin syringe, eliminating dead space and improving dosing accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Removable Needle">
  <data key="d0">Removable Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A removable needle is used with certain insulin syringes, but may introduce dead space, increasing the risk of dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639012</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dosing Error">
  <data key="d0">Dosing Error</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A dosing error occurs when the administered insulin dose deviates from the prescribed amount, often due to air bubbles or improper device use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639012</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thermal Insulation">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Insulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermal insulation is used during insulin transport to maintain stable temperatures and protect the medication from extreme heat or cold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639012</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manufacturer Guidelines">
  <data key="d0">Manufacturer Guidelines</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Manufacturer guidelines provide specific instructions for the storage, handling, and use of insulin and related devices to ensure safety and efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639013</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose monitoring is the process of tracking blood sugar levels, which should be intensified when changing injection sites from affected to healthy tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring is the process of measuring blood glucose levels, often used in conjunction with insulin therapy for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring is a practice used in diabetes management to track blood glucose levels, including through self-monitoring and continuous systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring refers to the process of measuring blood or interstitial glucose levels to manage diabetes, which can be performed continuously via CGM or intermittently through traditional finger-prick methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring refers to the process of measuring blood or interstitial glucose levels to manage diabetes, which can be performed continuously via CGM or intermittently through traditional finger-prick methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring involves assessing blood glucose levels through blood glucose monitoring (BGM) or continuous glucose monitoring (CGM).&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring involves measuring blood sugar levels to guide diabetes treatment decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0a49a3e1aba9780862b94a266490691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643609</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Analog">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Analog</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin analog refers to modified forms of insulin such as rapid-acting types used in a pen device, where needle retention caused dosage inaccuracies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin analog refers to genetically modified forms of insulin, including rapid-acting types used in pediatric and adolescent patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin analog is a type of rapid-acting insulin commonly prescribed in small and odd doses for children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin analog refers to synthetic insulin formulations with modified pharmacokinetic properties, such as ultra-rapid-acting insulin used in insulin pumps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b266ecc39f9ba0b5277aacb36089b4db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641765</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="50-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">50-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 50-unit syringe is a medical device capable of accurately measuring odd-numbered insulin doses, suitable for pediatric use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639025</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="30-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">30-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 30-unit syringe is a medical device designed to precisely measure small and odd insulin doses for children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639025</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="100-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">100-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 100-unit syringe has a capacity of 100 insulin units, graduated in 2-unit increments, making it impossible to measure odd doses accurately.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639025</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Healthcare Professionals">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare Professionals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare professionals are responsible for insulin prescription, preparation, and administration, and require continuous training to prevent medication errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare professionals are responsible for using appropriate syringes and safety devices when administering insulin to patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639027</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lo Presti et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Lo Presti et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Lo Presti et al. study examined skin thickness in children and adolescents aged 2–17, concluding that short needles (4–6 mm) are appropriate for this group.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639030</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gibney et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Gibney et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Gibney et al. study found that adult epidermal and dermal thickness rarely exceeds 3 mm, supporting the universal use of short needles (4–8 mm).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639030</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hirsch et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Hirsch et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hirsch et al. study evaluated insulin injections using 4, 5, and 8 mm needles, contributing to evidence on safe needle length selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639030</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe Waste">
  <data key="d0">Syringe Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Syringe waste refers to the disposal of syringes after single use, a standard practice to ensure safety and prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639031</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Heparin">
  <data key="d0">Heparin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heparin is an injectable anticoagulant that should not be stored near insulin to avoid confusion and medication errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Heparin is an anticoagulant medication that, like insulin, requires specific storage conditions and is at risk of confusion due to packaging similarities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639032</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vaccine">
  <data key="d0">Vaccine</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vaccines are biological products that must be stored separately from insulin in refrigeration units to maintain safety and efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Vaccines are biological preparations that require cold chain management and proper storage, often sharing refrigeration space with insulin, which poses risks if not properly segregated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639032</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A protocol refers to standardized procedures for the safe handling, storage, and administration of insulin and vaccines, which are currently lacking or ignored in some settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639032</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Packaging Similarity">
  <data key="d0">Packaging Similarity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Packaging similarity refers to the visual resemblance between insulin, heparin, and other injectable products, increasing the risk of medication errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639033</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Professional Inexperience">
  <data key="d0">Professional Inexperience</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Professional inexperience is a factor contributing to insulin-related errors, including improper storage and administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639033</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Route">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The subcutaneous (SC) route is the standard method for insulin administration, allowing gradual absorption through capillary networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639033</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Route">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intramuscular (IM) route is occasionally used in emergencies for faster insulin absorption but carries a risk of hypoglycemia, especially in children.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639033</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intravenous Route">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intravenous (IV) route is used in intensive care units under close monitoring and is limited to rapid-acting insulin analogs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639034</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intradermal Route">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intradermal (ID) route leads to slower insulin absorption and potential loss of dose, increasing the risk of hyperglycemia when used incorrectly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639034</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Physical Exercise">
  <data key="d0">Physical Exercise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Physical exercise increases insulin absorption rate and can lead to hypoglycemia if not managed properly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639036</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Ambient Temperature">
  <data key="d0">High Ambient Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High ambient temperature accelerates insulin absorption and increases the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639037</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Bath">
  <data key="d0">Hot Bath</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A hot bath increases local blood flow and speeds up insulin absorption, potentially causing hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639037</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Compress">
  <data key="d0">Hot Compress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A hot compress applied to the injection site accelerates insulin absorption and raises the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639037</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn">
  <data key="d0">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn (NPH) is a type of intermediate-acting insulin suspension that must be properly homogenized before administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Neutral Protamine Hagedorn (NPH) is a type of insulin suspension that must be homogenized before use to ensure proper concentration and clinical effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639615</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Premixed Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Premixed Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Premixed insulin contains a combination of short- and intermediate-acting insulins and requires proper mixing before use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639038</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Expiration Date">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Expiration Date</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin expiration date indicates the period during which the medication remains effective, and tracking the start date of use is essential for safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639039</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Appearance">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Appearance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin appearance must be checked before use to detect any changes that may indicate degradation or improper storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin appearance refers to the visual characteristics such as clarity, presence of particles, or color change, which must be checked before use to ensure safety and efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safe Insulin Practices">
  <data key="d0">Safe Insulin Practices</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Safe insulin practices include proper syringe use, homogenization, timing with meals, education, and storage to prevent errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Safe insulin practices include proper preparation, labeling, storage, and administration techniques to prevent errors and ensure patient safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639039</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Patient Education">
  <data key="d0">Patient Education</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Patient education involves teaching patients, families, or caregivers about insulin preparation and administration techniques to ensure proper understanding and self-management.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient education involves training patients and caregivers on correct insulin use, including injection techniques, storage, and recognition of complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient Education emphasizes personalized instruction on insulin use and self-care, tailored to the patient's individual characteristics and social context.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient education is a critical component in insulin pump therapy, ensuring users and clinicians are trained and informed for successful treatment outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient education involves teaching individuals with diabetes how to properly use technology, ensuring safe and effective treatment outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7be6907597f74116387925485497fbd0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641749</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Healthcare Team Training">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare Team Training</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare team training includes continuous education for medical staff on insulin management protocols and error prevention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639039</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Visual Alerts">
  <data key="d0">Visual Alerts</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Visual alerts are safety measures implemented to prevent medication errors by clearly distinguishing insulin from other injectables.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639040</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Institute for Safe Medication Practices">
  <data key="d0">Institute for Safe Medication Practices</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Institute for Safe Medication Practices (ISMP) is an organization that evaluates and classifies medications, identifying insulin as a high-alert medication due to its potential risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Institute for Safe Medication Practices is an organization that provides guidelines for the safe use of medications, including insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639040</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use">
  <data key="d0">Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use is an organization that identified insulin as a high-risk medication prone to errors across prescription, preparation, and administration stages.&lt;SEP&gt;The Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use provides recommendations for the safe use of insulin and other high-risk medications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639040</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SC">
  <data key="d0">SC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SC stands for subcutaneous, the standard route for insulin administration, allowing gradual absorption through capillary networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639040</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IM">
  <data key="d0">IM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IM stands for intramuscular, a route occasionally used in emergencies for faster insulin absorption but associated with increased hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639040</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EV">
  <data key="d0">EV</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EV stands for intravenous, a route used in intensive care settings under close monitoring, limited to rapid-acting insulin analogs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639041</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ID">
  <data key="d0">ID</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ID stands for intradermal, an incorrect route for insulin administration that results in slow absorption and potential dose loss.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639041</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manufacturer's Instruction Manual">
  <data key="d0">Manufacturer's Instruction Manual</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A guide provided by the manufacturer detailing correct usage of the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639042</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Flow Test">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Flow Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A procedure to verify proper insulin delivery from the pen by expelling a small amount before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639042</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLP-1 Agonist">
  <data key="d0">GLP-1 Agonist</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A class of injectable medications used in diabetes treatment, sometimes combined with insulin in prefilled pens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639042</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proper Disposal Container">
  <data key="d0">Proper Disposal Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A designated container for safe disposal of used needles to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLP-1 Agonist Insulin Combination">
  <data key="d0">GLP-1 Agonist Insulin Combination</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of prefilled insulin pen containing both insulin and a GLP-1 agonist for combined therapy in diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Refill">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Refill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A replaceable reservoir containing insulin, used in injection devices, where backflow must be prevented after injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Reservoir">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Reservoir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A container holding insulin within an injection device, susceptible to blood reflux if the needle is withdrawn prematurely.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin reservoir is a component of the insulin pump that stores the insulin supply and must be regularly replaced to ensure proper function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182332eb7daaa8deed5e90a79db308e8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641724</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Extra-Thin Wall Needle">
  <data key="d0">Extra-Thin Wall Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of insulin injection needle with a larger internal diameter, designed to reduce resistance and minimize insulin loss during administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Insulin Dose">
  <data key="d0">High Insulin Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A large volume of insulin that may require splitting into multiple injections to reduce application site losses and improve delivery efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe Graduation Scale">
  <data key="d0">Syringe Graduation Scale</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The marked scale on a syringe that indicates dosage levels, which must match the prescribed insulin amount, whether even or odd.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The sealed top of an insulin vial that must be disinfected with 70% alcohol before needle insertion to maintain sterility.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639045</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air Injection into Vial">
  <data key="d0">Air Injection into Vial</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A step in insulin preparation where air is injected into the vial to equalize pressure and prevent vacuum formation during aspiration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639045</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vacuum Formation">
  <data key="d0">Vacuum Formation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A pressure imbalance in an insulin vial that can occur during preparation, potentially causing unintended transfer of insulin between vials when mixing types.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mixing Two Insulins">
  <data key="d0">Mixing Two Insulins</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A technique for combining two types of insulin (e.g., NPH and regular) in one syringe, requiring specific steps and a fixed-needle syringe to prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air Bubbles in Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Air Bubbles in Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Trapped air within the insulin syringe that must be removed to ensure accurate dosage delivery, as air displaces insulin volume.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Loss">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Loss</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The unintended leakage of insulin at the injection site or on the needle after administration, which can be reduced by using extra-thin wall needles and splitting high doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin R">
  <data key="d0">Insulin R</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin R is a type of regular insulin administered in a dose of 8 units, leading to hypoglycemia in the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639047</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nurse">
  <data key="d0">Nurse</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The nurse aspirated 0.68 mL of regular insulin using a 1 mL syringe and administered it, contributing to a medication error.&lt;SEP&gt;A nurse is involved in the ongoing care and monitoring of patients with lipodystrophy syndromes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0e841f6957bc713f769fbd0c5b5ee33</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776640756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="1 mL Syringe">
  <data key="d0">1 mL Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A 1 mL syringe graduated in mL, not intended for insulin preparation, was used incorrectly for measuring insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nursing Technician">
  <data key="d0">Nursing Technician</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The nursing technician administered 4 units of Insulin NPH without shaking the vial, resulting in improper dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Lispro">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Lispro</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin lispro is a rapid-acting insulin analog that must be timed with meals; incorrect timing led to severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in insulin pump therapy and is associated with improved glycemic control and patient satisfaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a rapid-acting insulin analog marketed as Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a short-acting insulin analogue studied for its potential to prevent nocturnal hypoglycaemia in young children with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182332eb7daaa8deed5e90a79db308e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bddc99b2e70c378921ff59ddb3b954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pen Needle">
  <data key="d0">Pen Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The pen needle is a double-ended needle that allows air to enter and insulin to leak if left attached after use, causing dosage errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Child">
  <data key="d0">Child</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A 6-year-old child receiving insulin analog experienced unexplained hyperglycemia due to needle retention on the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639049</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Responsible">
  <data key="d0">Responsible</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The responsible caregiver kept the pen needle attached after injection, leading to insulin leakage and poor glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639049</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Double Check">
  <data key="d0">Double Check</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Double check is a safety practice recommended for high-risk medications like insulin to prevent administration errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Homogenization">
  <data key="d0">Homogenization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Homogenization is the process of mixing insulin suspensions like NPH thoroughly before use to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meal Timing">
  <data key="d0">Meal Timing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Meal timing refers to the coordination of insulin administration with the patient's eating schedule to prevent hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forearm">
  <data key="d0">Forearm</data>
  <data key="d1">bodypart</data>
  <data key="d2">The forearm is a site where insulin application was demonstrated, though it is not a recommended location for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639053</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ISMP (Brasil)">
  <data key="d0">ISMP (Brasil)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ISMP (Brasil) is an organization that issued a 2015 bulletin highlighting risks associated with medication abbreviations and promoting safe insulin use practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639053</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Double-Check Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Double-Check Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The double-check procedure is a safety practice in healthcare, particularly in nursing, used during insulin preparation and administration to reduce errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639053</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hospital Discharge Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Hospital Discharge Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hospital discharge preparation includes initiating patient education upon admission to ensure readiness for insulin self-care after leaving the hospital.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639054</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electronic Medical System">
  <data key="d0">Electronic Medical System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">An electronic medical system is used for digital prescription of medications, including insulin, to reduce errors caused by handwriting or abbreviations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639054</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leonard Thompson">
  <data key="d0">Leonard Thompson</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Leonard Thompson was a 14-year-old boy with type 1 diabetes who became the first person to benefit from insulin treatment in 1922.&lt;SEP&gt;Leonard Thompson is a 14-year-old boy with diabetes who was the first human to receive insulin treatment, initially with limited success and later with dramatic improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Leonard Thompson is a 14-year-old boy with diabetes who was the first human to receive insulin treatment, initially with limited success and later with dramatic improvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86a3a1d4228f2b3b5e588cb46fdd3cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Discovery of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Discovery of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The discovery of insulin in 1921 marked a milestone in the history of diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639054</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pain Management in Insulin Injection">
  <data key="d0">Pain Management in Insulin Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pain management strategies during insulin injection include using shorter needles, distraction techniques, and proper injection techniques to improve comfort and adherence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639054</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nurse Educators">
  <data key="d0">Nurse Educators</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Nurse educators, also known as visiting nurses, were trained to instruct people with diabetes on insulin management, diet, and exercise in the community.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639055</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Insulin Delivery Recommendations">
  <data key="d0">New Insulin Delivery Recommendations</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Insulin Delivery Recommendations is a study published in May 2016 that provides updated guidelines for safe insulin preparation and administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639055</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Dose Splitting">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Dose Splitting</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin dose splitting is a technique used to divide high insulin doses into two separate injections to improve absorption and reduce discomfort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639055</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Individuals">
  <data key="d0">Individuals</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals refer to people receiving insulin injections, for whom application techniques and safety are important.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639055</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recommended Injection Sites">
  <data key="d0">Recommended Injection Sites</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommended injection sites for insulin include arms, buttocks, thighs, and abdomen, chosen for accessibility and safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639055</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Educator">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Educator</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes educators play a key role in teaching patients about the importance of injection site rotation and helping design practical rotation schemes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639057</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="45° Angle">
  <data key="d0">45° Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A 45° angle is recommended for insulin injection in pregnant women using 4 mm needles to ensure proper delivery into subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639057</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uterine Injury">
  <data key="d0">Uterine Injury</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Uterine injury is a potential risk during insulin injection in pregnant women if proper site and technique are not observed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639057</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protetor Externo">
  <data key="d0">Protetor Externo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Protetor externo é utilizado para remover a agulha com segurança após a aplicação.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639058</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recipiente Próprio">
  <data key="d0">Recipiente Próprio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Recipiente próprio é destinado ao descarte seguro de agulhas usadas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639058</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa Da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Tampa Da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa da caneta é recolocada após o uso para proteger a caneta descartável.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639058</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Canetas Descartáveis">
  <data key="d0">Canetas Descartáveis</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Canetas descartáveis são dispositivos pré-cheios usados para administração subcutânea de agonistas do GLP-1 e insulinas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639058</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agonistas Do GLP-1">
  <data key="d0">Agonistas Do GLP-1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agonistas do GLP-1 são medicamentos utilizados no tratamento do diabetes que mimetizam o efeito do hormônio GLP-1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639058</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulinas Associadas Com Agonistas Do GLP-1">
  <data key="d0">Insulinas Associadas Com Agonistas Do GLP-1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulinas associadas com agonistas do GLP-1 são terapias injetáveis combinadas disponíveis em canetas descartáveis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pessoas">
  <data key="d0">Pessoas</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pessoas são pacientes que realizam tratamento para diabetes com terapias injetáveis subcutâneas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local De Aplicação">
  <data key="d0">Local De Aplicação</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Local de aplicação é a região do corpo onde a injeção subcutânea é administrada, devendo ser rotacionado.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Técnica De Preparo E Aplicação">
  <data key="d0">Técnica De Preparo E Aplicação</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Técnica de preparo e aplicação refere-se ao procedimento correto para uso de canetas de insulina e descarte de agulhas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sistema De Infusão Contínua De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Sistema De Infusão Contínua De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sistema de infusão contínua de insulina é um dispositivo eletrônico que administra insulina de forma contínua e programada.&lt;SEP&gt;O Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina é um dispositivo mecânico com comando eletrônico que injeta insulina de forma contínua do reservatório para um cateter inserido no tecido subcutâneo, usado no tratamento do diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;O Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina (SICI) é uma terapia para o tratamento do diabetes que permite administração contínua de insulina, melhorando o controle glicêmico e reduzindo episódios de hipoglicemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina is a Portuguese term referring to Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion, a method for delivering insulin in diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f739b5aa260687129c0a88dce08d70c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba79a92f9b31fdbcd854ba496c498efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bddc99b2e70c378921ff59ddb3b954</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641751</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Terapia Com Bomba De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Terapia Com Bomba De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Terapia com bomba de insulina é o uso de um sistema de infusão contínua para controle glicêmico em pacientes diabéticos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Análogo De Insulina Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Análogo De Insulina Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Análogo de insulina rápida inclui tipos como lispro, asparte e glulisina, usados em bombas de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liberação Basal">
  <data key="d0">Liberação Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Liberação basal é a infusão contínua de insulina para manter níveis glicêmicos entre refeições e durante o sono.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liberação Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Liberação Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Liberação bolus é a dose adicional de insulina administrada antes das refeições ou para correção de hiperglicemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservatório De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Reservatório De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reservatório de insulina é o compartimento da bomba que armazena a insulina a ser infundida.&lt;SEP&gt;O reservatório de insulina é o compartimento da bomba que armazena a insulina e deve ser trocado quando esvaziado, dependendo da dose diária utilizada.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba79a92f9b31fdbcd854ba496c498efb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conjunto De Infusão">
  <data key="d0">Conjunto De Infusão</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Conjunto de infusão é composto por cateter e cânula, conectando o reservatório ao tecido subcutâneo.&lt;SEP&gt;O conjunto de infusão é composto pelo cateter e pela cânula, e deve ser substituído a cada 6 dias para prevenir infecções, obstruções ou reações alérgicas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba79a92f9b31fdbcd854ba496c498efb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cânula">
  <data key="d0">Cânula</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cânula é um pequeno tubo flexível inserido no tecido subcutâneo para infusão de insulina, com comprimentos variando entre 6 e 17 mm.&lt;SEP&gt;A cânula é um tubo flexível de Teflon® inserido no tecido subcutâneo para permitir a passagem de insulina do cateter ao corpo, devendo ser trocada a cada 2 a 6 dias.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba79a92f9b31fdbcd854ba496c498efb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641755</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha-Guia">
  <data key="d0">Agulha-Guia</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha-guia é usada para inserir a cânula no tecido subcutâneo e removida após a colocação.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639061</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bateria">
  <data key="d0">Bateria</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bateria é a fonte de energia das bombas de insulina, geralmente composta por pilhas alcalinas AAA.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639061</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mecânica De Inserção">
  <data key="d0">Mecânica De Inserção</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mecânica de inserção refere-se ao método utilizado para colocar o conjunto de infusão no corpo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639061</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Qualidade Do Adesivo Da Cânula">
  <data key="d0">Qualidade Do Adesivo Da Cânula</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Qualidade do adesivo da cânula é um fator importante para garantir a fixação segura do conjunto de infusão na pele.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639061</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Pinch">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Pinch</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The subcutaneous pinch is a technique used during insulin injection to reduce the risk of intramuscular injection and improve insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hemoglobin A1c Levels">
  <data key="d0">Hemoglobin A1c Levels</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Hemoglobin A1c levels are a measure of long-term blood glucose control, which can be influenced by proper insulin injection technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemoglobin A1c levels are a measure of long-term blood glucose control and are associated with the frequency of self-monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dadde3434f68ef74ebdf23be6a24ec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643652</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Hold Time">
  <data key="d0">Needle Hold Time</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle hold time refers to the practice of keeping the needle in the subcutaneous tissue for several seconds after insulin injection to ensure complete delivery and prevent reflux.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Recarregregável">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Recarregregável</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta recarregável não deve ser guardada na geladeira para evitar danos ao mecanismo interno.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Error">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Error</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d2">Inexperienced healthcare professionals are more prone to making mistakes in insulin preparation and administration.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parents">
  <data key="d0">Parents</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d2">Parents are instructed not to massage the injection site after insulin administration, a common gesture of affection in children that can accelerate absorption and cause hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639123</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Dose Accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Dose Accuracy</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d2">Air bubbles in the syringe must be removed by tapping and slow plunger pressure to ensure the full insulin dose is delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin dose accuracy is the precise measurement and delivery of insulin, critical for effective diabetes management and influenced by proper device use and handling.</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639617</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Fechada">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Fechada</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina fechada é a insulina ainda lacrada e não iniciada, que deve ser armazenada entre 2 °C e 8 °C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Já Em Uso">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Já Em Uso</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina já em uso é a insulina que foi aberta e está sendo aplicada, com requisitos diferentes de armazenamento em comparação à insulina fechada.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolsa Térmica">
  <data key="d0">Bolsa Térmica</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolsa térmica é usada para transportar insulina mantendo a temperatura adequada, especialmente durante viagens, evitando contato direto com gelo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Viagem">
  <data key="d0">Viagem</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Viagem é uma situação em que a insulina deve ser transportada com cuidado, sempre na bagagem de mão e protegida da luz solar direta e do calor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Therapy Care">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Therapy Care</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Therapy Care refers to the guidelines and practices for managing insulin treatment in patients with type 2 diabetes, including education, monitoring, and storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2) in Adults">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2) in Adults</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2) in Adults is a chronic metabolic condition requiring long-term management, including medication and lifestyle adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sealed Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Sealed Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Sealed Insulin refers to insulin that has not been opened and must be stored under refrigeration between 2°C and 8°C, with a shelf life of 2 to 3 years from manufacture.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reusable Pen Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Reusable Pen Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Reusable Pen Insulin refers to insulin contained in a refillable pen device, which should be stored at room temperature up to 30°C and used within 4 to 8 weeks after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daily Glucose Self-Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Daily Glucose Self-Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily Glucose Self-Monitoring is the practice of regularly checking blood glucose levels, especially important for patients on intensive insulin therapy, typically performed 4 to 6 times per day.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pain Reduction Strategies">
  <data key="d0">Pain Reduction Strategies</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pain Reduction Strategies are techniques used to minimize discomfort during insulin injections, contributing to better treatment adherence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Technique Review">
  <data key="d0">Application Technique Review</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Technique Review involves assessing the patient's insulin injection method during consultations to ensure proper learning and technique.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multidisciplinary Team">
  <data key="d0">Multidisciplinary Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Multidisciplinary Team is a group of healthcare professionals responsible for supporting patients in managing diabetes and insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Brazilian Diabetes Society Guidelines">
  <data key="d0">Brazilian Diabetes Society Guidelines</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Brazilian Diabetes Society Guidelines are clinical recommendations for diabetes management, adapted as a source for insulin storage and care protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brazilian Diabetes Society Guidelines provide clinical recommendations for the classification and management of diabetes, including diagnostic criteria and use of laboratory tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575f95ec5a02f7900989e00da53749f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776646957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Domestic Refrigerator Storage">
  <data key="d0">Domestic Refrigerator Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Domestic Refrigerator Storage refers to storing insulin in a household refrigerator between 2°C and 8°C, avoiding freezing and placement near cold walls or in vegetable drawers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Room Temperature Storage">
  <data key="d0">Room Temperature Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Room Temperature Storage allows in-use insulin to be kept at temperatures up to 30°C, avoiding exposure to direct sunlight or extreme heat or cold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opening Date Labeling">
  <data key="d0">Opening Date Labeling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Opening Date Labeling requires marking the date when an insulin vial or pen is first opened to track its usable lifespan of 4 to 8 weeks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="COMUNICA BR">
  <data key="d0">COMUNICA BR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">COMUNICA BR is a government communication platform providing access to information and public services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ACESSO À INFORMAÇÃO">
  <data key="d0">ACESSO À INFORMAÇÃO</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ACESSO À INFORMAÇÃO refers to the public's right to access government-held information, a principle supported by the COMUNICA BR platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PARTICIPE">
  <data key="d0">PARTICIPE</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PARTICIPE is an initiative promoting citizen participation in public policy and governance through the COMUNICA BR platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LEGISLAÇÃO">
  <data key="d0">LEGISLAÇÃO</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">LEGISLAÇÃO refers to the legal framework governing public administration and health policies, accessible via the COMUNICA BR platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ÓRGÃOS DO GOVERNO">
  <data key="d0">ÓRGÃOS DO GOVERNO</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ÓRGÃOS DO GOVERNO are government agencies responsible for implementing public policies and health guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Linhas de Cuidado">
  <data key="d0">Linhas de Cuidado</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Linhas de Cuidado are structured healthcare pathways designed to standardize and optimize patient management for specific conditions like diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Portal">
  <data key="d0">Portal</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Portal refers to the official health website hosting information on diabetes management and insulin therapy guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tratamento medicamentoso">
  <data key="d0">Tratamento medicamentoso</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Tratamento medicamentoso refers to the pharmacological management of diabetes, including insulin and other medications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia">
  <data key="d0">Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d2">The Portal hosts the 'Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia' section, offering structured care recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639412</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Measurement">
  <data key="d0">Dose Measurement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose measurement involves accurately recording insulin dosage using appropriate syringes to prevent errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639613</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe Graduated in mL">
  <data key="d0">Syringe Graduated in mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A syringe graduated in mL is not recommended for insulin due to high risk of dosing errors, as insulin is prescribed in international units.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639613</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Premix">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Premix</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin premix refers to a combination formulation of insulin that includes both short-acting and intermediate-acting components, requiring homogenization before administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639615</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Shelf Life">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Shelf Life</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin shelf life refers to the duration for which insulin remains effective, varying between 2–3 years when unopened and 4–8 weeks after opening, depending on formulation and device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639615</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Application Devices">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Application Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin application devices include syringes, pens, and other tools designed for the safe and accurate delivery of insulin doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639616</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thermal Insulated Container">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Insulated Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A thermal insulated container is used for transporting insulin safely, with precautions to prevent direct contact with ice to avoid freezing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639616</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table 1">
  <data key="d0">Table 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 1 presents guidelines for insulin storage, including temperature and shelf life for different insulin formulations and usage states.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 presents the characteristics and configurations of insulin pumps available in Brazil, based on manufacturer manuals, including details on basal rates, bolus types, and software.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 summarizes individualized glycemic control goals recommended by the Brazilian Diabetes Society for different patient groups, including HbA1c targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88336f998ca464e0ed477249555b3e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f7252ca9147660b04b7329edbe843f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe Graduation">
  <data key="d0">Syringe Graduation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Syringe graduation refers to the calibration markings on insulin syringes, available in increments of 1, 2, or 1/2 units, allowing for accurate dosing of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639617</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manual Preparo E Aplicação De Insulina Sem Mistério">
  <data key="d0">Manual Preparo E Aplicação De Insulina Sem Mistério</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A practical manual from 2015 providing guidance on insulin preparation and application, available online.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776639924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
