  <data key="d0">Diabetes Treatment Guidelines 2019-2020</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Diabetes Treatment Guidelines 2019-2020 are official recommendations published by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes, accessed on June 17, 2021.</data>
