  <data key="d0">Portaria nº 11, de 13 de marco de 2017</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This portaria makes public the decision to incorporate insulin injection pens for human NPH and regular insulin into the SUS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d9cf8845dcb3d8d9a2db7f8843f0fea</data>
