</node>
<node id="Portaria nº 10, de 21 de fevereiro de 2017">
  <data key="d0">Portaria nº 10, de 21 de fevereiro de 2017</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This portaria makes public the decision to incorporate rapid-acting insulin analog for the treatment of Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus into the SUS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d9cf8845dcb3d8d9a2db7f8843f0fea</data>
