<node id="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pump Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Pump Therapy, also known as Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII), is a method of insulin delivery used in the management of diabetes mellitus, particularly type 1 diabetes. It involves the use of a wearable infusion device that delivers rapid-acting insulin continuously through a subcutaneous catheter, providing a more precise and flexible alternative to multiple daily insulin injections. This therapy is designed to mimic the body's natural insulin secretion patterns, supporting improved metabolic control and better glycemic management.

The therapy has been evaluated in numerous clinical studies and meta-analyses, including a notable review published in 2003, to assess its efficacy and safety. It is especially beneficial for patients requiring tight glycemic control and has been studied in combination with continuous glucose monitoring systems to enhance diabetes management. Insulin Pump Therapy helps reduce glucotoxicity and lipotoxicity, which is particularly advantageous for patients with conditions such as lipodystrophy, where metabolic dysregulation is prominent.

Also referred to as SICI (though CSII is the more accurate and widely accepted term), this treatment approach delivers insulin in a continuous, adjustable manner, allowing for personalized basal rates and bolus doses. As a well-established method in diabetes care, Insulin Pump Therapy remains a key option for individuals seeking improved flexibility and control in their insulin regimen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54f4c3fffcb1c054dd2b100c36c64717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d000f0bd5254e1a2df1aba208ecc4170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182332eb7daaa8deed5e90a79db308e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b712afd345ff5f7503205905d3131f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d6904368d45b0f9532b36061a00e7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bddc99b2e70c378921ff59ddb3b954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7be6907597f74116387925485497fbd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0a49a3e1aba9780862b94a266490691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b36191c270d1cc8ff8c1fc610d7a533b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce5b147555a2c6ba2644e98fb3d31f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643616</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
