<node id="Hepatitis C">
  <data key="d0">Hepatitis C</data>
  <data key="d1">infection</data>
  <data key="d2">Hepatitis C is a viral infection that affects the liver and has been studied for its prevalence in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Hepatitis C is an infection associated with hyperglycemia and is a potential cause of secondary diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54f4c3fffcb1c054dd2b100c36c64717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02efb2a3687e39bf186d9b0146d95077</data>
