<node id="Proteinuria">
  <data key="d0">Proteinuria</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proteinuria occurs in lipodystrophy patients even without diabetes and may improve with metreleptin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteinuria is a condition characterized by excessive protein in the urine, often associated with kidney dysfunction in lipodystrophy patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8659fdffea91cf2a67039d59ea61cc65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776640771</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Sensitivity">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Sensitivity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin sensitivity refers to how responsive the body's cells are to insulin, which improves with metreleptin treatment in lipodystrophy patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin sensitivity refers to how responsive an individual's body is to insulin, affecting dosing needs and risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b266ecc39f9ba0b5277aacb36089b4db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641763</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clinical And Laboratory Data">
  <data key="d0">Clinical And Laboratory Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical and laboratory data refer to medical and biochemical information collected from patients with congenital generalized lipodystrophy for research purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
