</node>
<node id="Diabetol Metab Syndr">
  <data key="d0">Diabetol Metab Syndr</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetol Metab Syndr is a journal that published clinical and laboratory findings on a large series of patients with congenital generalized lipodystrophy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetol Metab Syndr is a journal publishing research on diabetes, metabolism, and related syndromes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetol Metab Syndr is an open-access journal that published a study on body composition in familial partial lipodystrophy in 2012.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetol Metab Syndr is a journal that published the 2024 Brazilian Diabetes Society update on MASLD management.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetol Metab Syndr is a journal that published the 2024 Brazilian Diabetes Society update on MASLD management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1319c06eac1875d14b345f09579021be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017257ae0e7fcc5a0a1be0ddc435fe8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689015</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
