<node id="Plos One">
  <data key="d0">Plos One</data>
  <data key="d1">journal</data>
  <data key="d2">PLoS One is a peer-reviewed journal that published a study on causes of death in patients with Berardinelli-Seip congenital generalized lipodystrophy.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is a peer-reviewed open-access scientific journal that published a study on youth-onset diabetes in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;PLOS One is an open-access scientific journal that published findings from the Northern Finland Birth Cohort 1966 study in 2020.&lt;SEP&gt;PLOS One is an open-access scientific journal that published findings from the Northern Finland Birth Cohort 1966 study in 2020.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c156c40ae38c1b220a3c59d658c17171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2977bb9a41689e74de2c536343624744</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776688963</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="J Clin Endocrinol Metab">
  <data key="d0">J Clin Endocrinol Metab</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing clinical research on endocrine disorders, with a significant focus on diabetes and related metabolic conditions. It has served as a key platform for disseminating studies on diabetes diagnosis, management, and emerging technologies, as well as research on rare endocrine syndromes such as lipodystrophy. The journal has published influential clinical practice guidelines, including a multi-society guideline on lipodystrophy syndromes and a comprehensive guideline on diabetes technology for adults, reflecting its role in shaping evidence-based clinical practice.

Among its notable research contributions, J Clin Endocrinol Metab published a 2011 study characterizing youth with type 2 diabetes, providing early insights into the growing prevalence of the disease in younger populations. It also featured research on the utility of glycated hemoglobin (HbA1c) in diagnosing type 2 diabetes, including analyses of racial differences in plasma glucose and HbA1c levels, which have important implications for equitable diagnostic criteria. In 2019, the journal published a study demonstrating the effectiveness of 1-hour post-oral glucose tolerance test (OGTT) glucose levels in the early prediction of type 2 diabetes, offering a potential tool for early intervention.

Additionally, J Clin Endocrinol Metab has published clinical trial data, such as the BEGIN: Flex T1 trial on insulin degludec, contributing to the understanding of advanced insulin therapies. It has also reported on the therapeutic effects of metreleptin in lipodystrophy patients, particularly its impact on reducing proteinuria, highlighting the journal’s coverage of innovative treatments for rare metabolic disorders. Through its diverse portfolio of original research and clinical guidelines, J Clin Endocrinol Metab remains a leading resource in the field of endocrinology.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a journal publishing clinical research on endocrine disorders, including diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a journal that published a study on early prediction of type 2 diabetes using 1-hour post-OGTT glucose in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a scientific journal that published a study on 1-hour post-OGTT glucose and type 2 diabetes prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c156c40ae38c1b220a3c59d658c17171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb7f10473b84f2de23852febe7ef317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050dc3a498d3027939b93706cbdb7f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017257ae0e7fcc5a0a1be0ddc435fe8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599c535216b129144d3ee7a08cfe646d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a796990fe8edf70e4463124a0233c32c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776688949</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Endocrine">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrine is a journal that published findings on the long-term effectiveness and safety of metreleptin in treating generalized lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6</data>
