</node>
<node id="J Clin Invest">
  <data key="d0">J Clin Invest</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J Clin Invest is a scientific journal that published research on metreleptin-mediated improvements in insulin sensitivity in humans with lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55c9f6328c4401f126aa9ac11be639b6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
