  <data key="d0">Departamento De Enfermagem - Sbd</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Departamento de Enfermagem - SBD is a nursing department associated with the Brazilian Diabetes Society focused on diabetes care and education.</data>
