  <data key="d0">Coletor Para Resíduos Perfurocortantes</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A coletor para resíduos perfurocortantes is a rigid, puncture-proof container used for the safe disposal of sharp medical waste such as needles and lancets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13a3958ecd422660b4cd1e47e31e1b9c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/descarte.pdf</data>
