<node id="Sunlight">
  <data key="d0">Sunlight</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sunlight is a source of heat and light that can degrade insulin, so insulin should be kept away from direct sun exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Sunlight is a source of heat and light that can degrade insulin, so insulin should be kept away from direct sun exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opened Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Opened Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Opened insulin refers to insulin that is currently in use and can be stored outside the refrigerator for up to 30 days in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.&lt;SEP&gt;Opened insulin refers to insulin that is currently in use and can be stored outside the refrigerator for up to 30 days in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Institute for Health and Care Excellence">
  <data key="d0">National Institute for Health and Care Excellence</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Institute for Health and Care Excellence (NICE) is a UK-based organization that provides clinical guidelines and recommendations for healthcare practices, including insulin therapy for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;National Institute for Health and Care Excellence is the full name of NICE, a UK agency for health and clinical guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eed9228bfdd30fe45392a8a9fb8d106b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aebc875b323050c4274610952a881b57</data>
