  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Association for the Study of Diabetes (EASD) supports consensus guidelines on diabetes care, including insulin delivery methods for pediatric and pregnant patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Association for the Study of Diabetes is a professional organization involved in diabetes research and policy, co-authoring a consensus report on digital app technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Association for the Study of Diabetes (EASD) collaborates with the American Diabetes Association on consensus reports regarding diabetes management and precision medicine.</data>
