<node id="Multiple Daily Injections">
  <data key="d0">Multiple Daily Injections</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiple Daily Injections (MDI) is a standard insulin delivery method used to manage blood glucose levels in individuals with diabetes, particularly those with Diabetes Mellitus Type 1. This regimen involves administering several insulin injections per day, typically combining both basal (long-acting) and bolus or prandial (short-acting) insulin to mimic the body's natural insulin secretion patterns. By delivering insulin in this structured manner, MDI helps regulate glucose levels throughout the day and in response to meals.

MDI is widely recognized as a conventional and effective approach to insulin therapy and is frequently used as a comparator in clinical studies evaluating alternative insulin delivery methods, especially continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion (CSII), commonly known as insulin pump therapy. It serves both as a prerequisite and an alternative to pump-based treatment, often assessed in terms of cost, efficacy, and patient outcomes. Research involving specific populations, such as pregnant women with diabetes, has also utilized MDI as a benchmark for evaluating the safety and effectiveness of other insulin delivery systems.

Overall, Multiple Daily Injections represent a well-established treatment regimen in diabetes management, providing a structured, flexible, and accessible method for insulin administration. Its widespread use in both clinical practice and research underscores its importance in diabetes care, particularly when pump therapy is not available, preferred, or indicated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eed9228bfdd30fe45392a8a9fb8d106b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-182332eb7daaa8deed5e90a79db308e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bddc99b2e70c378921ff59ddb3b954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1abe83ba7814c7afe7a123e2f79a10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e1858f15899659bc0116977a6e1e000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc6a5cedffa24f9a3134770cf1526b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b36191c270d1cc8ff8c1fc610d7a533b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f12d6a3cebf5c39bed5629c359502cae</data>
