  <data key="d0">Hybrid Closed-Loop System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A hybrid closed-loop system integrates CGM and insulin pump functions to automate basal insulin delivery while requiring manual bolus administration for meals.&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid closed-loop insulin pump system uses real-time MCG data to automatically adjust basal insulin rates to minimize hypoglycemia and hyperglycemia, but requires manual meal boluses.&lt;SEP&gt;The hybrid closed-loop system is an insulin delivery technology evaluated for efficacy and safety in various populations with type 1 diabetes, including those with gastroparesis and children.</data>
