<node id="Pediatr Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Pediatr Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Pediatr Diabetes is a medical journal dedicated to advancing research and clinical practice in pediatric diabetes. It serves as a key platform for disseminating studies and consensus guidelines related to the management, treatment, and understanding of diabetes in children and adolescents. The journal covers a broad spectrum of topics, including glycemic control, insulin therapy, and emerging technologies in diabetes care.

The journal has published significant clinical guidelines, including the ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines on glycemic control and the ISPAD 2018 guidelines on monogenic diabetes in young patients. These publications underscore its role in shaping evidence-based standards for pediatric diabetes care. Pediatr Diabetes has also featured research on insulin treatment modalities, such as insulin infusion systems and insulin pump use, with attention to their impact on quality of life in pediatric populations.

In addition to clinical guidelines and treatment studies, Pediatr Diabetes publishes original research on various forms of diabetes in youth, including cohort studies on maturity-onset diabetes of the young (MODY). It has also reported on innovative technologies, such as closed-loop insulin delivery systems, including a study evaluating the Tandem Control-IQ system during winter sports in children and adolescents. Through its focus on both foundational and cutting-edge research, Pediatr Diabetes remains a central resource for healthcare professionals and researchers in the field of pediatric endocrinology.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatr Diabetes is a medical journal that published research on progression to type 1 diabetes in children.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatr Diabetes is a medical journal focusing on pediatric diabetes, publishing research on glycemic control and hypoglycemia in children.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4e05859597c5f1693c2f9fe1ef0a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc6a5cedffa24f9a3134770cf1526b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb7f10473b84f2de23852febe7ef317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad3acc8463b5ff47461b1c16ae2559cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05070e0755e36e3375d401400cf75fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054</data>
