<node id="Sensor-Augmented Insulin-Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Sensor-Augmented Insulin-Pump Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor-augmented insulin-pump therapy is an advanced form of insulin delivery that combines continuous glucose monitoring with insulin pump systems to improve glycemic control in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Control And Complications Trial">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Control And Complications Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) is a clinical study that used insulin pumps in research during the 1970s, contributing to the understanding of diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control And Complications Trial is a major clinical study that investigated the effects of intensive diabetes treatment on complications, including hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) was a landmark study on intensive vs. conventional diabetes treatment in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial is a research study focused on diabetes interventions and outcomes in patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) is a clinical study that established standards for A1C measurement and diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) is a clinical study that established standards for A1C measurement and diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddf3203a55511f7874bc210d61b3ccfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba79a92f9b31fdbcd854ba496c498efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f731774e5187eb76527ebeabefeeeb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b36fc8288de16b0682d3530712dcb4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/ref.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647363</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accu-Chek® Solo">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek® Solo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek® Solo is a patch insulin pump developed by Roche with a structure lasting about four months and components replaced every 2 to 3 days, supporting 200 units of insulin and integrating a glucose meter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Roche">
  <data key="d0">Roche</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Roche é um fabricante de bombas de insulina avaliado em estudo sobre eficácia terapêutica.&lt;SEP&gt;Roche is the manufacturer of the Accu-Chek® Solo patch insulin pump, which is expected to arrive in Brazil soon.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f739b5aa260687129c0a88dce08d70c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
