  <data key="d2">Hanas R is a cited author who contributed to the clinical guidelines for insulin pump use.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional who researched complications such as hypoglycemia and ketoacidosis in pediatric insulin pump users.&lt;SEP&gt;Hanas R is a researcher who studied bolus calculator settings in prepubertal children using insulin pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;Hanas R is a researcher who studied insulin delivery by injection in children and adolescents with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b712afd345ff5f7503205905d3131f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d6904368d45b0f9532b36061a00e7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0a49a3e1aba9780862b94a266490691</data>
