<node id="Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A Portuguese term for Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion, referring to a method of insulin delivery used in diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b8d6904368d45b0f9532b36061a00e7c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fully Closed-Loop System">
  <data key="d0">Fully Closed-Loop System</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A fully closed-loop insulin pump system automatically modulates basal insulin based on MCG data without requiring manual meal boluses, representing an advanced form of artificial pancreas technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low-Glucose Suspend Pump">
  <data key="d0">Low-Glucose Suspend Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A low-glucose suspend insulin pump automatically stops basal insulin delivery for up to two hours when MCG values fall below a preset threshold to prevent hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predictive Low-Glucose Suspend Pump">
  <data key="d0">Predictive Low-Glucose Suspend Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A predictive low-glucose suspend pump interrupts insulin delivery when it forecasts that MCG values will drop below a preset limit, using predictive algorithms based on real-time data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Patch Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d0">Patch Insulin Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A patch insulin pump is a compact, wearable insulin delivery device adhered to the skin, integrating the infusion mechanism and cannula, often controlled via user-programmed clicks or remote systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Artificial Pancreas">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Pancreas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The artificial pancreas refers to closed-loop insulin delivery systems that automate glucose control, aiming to reduce long-term complications and improve quality of life for people with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The artificial pancreas is a technological system for automated insulin delivery, discussed in the context of do-it-yourself implementations.&lt;SEP&gt;The artificial pancreas is a technology designed to automate insulin delivery in type 1 diabetes, studied for effectiveness and safety across age groups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-862cb6f254fb8ebb4f3e1080dbf4f53c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e1858f15899659bc0116977a6e1e000</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643646</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dual Hormone Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Dual Hormone Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual hormone therapy involves the simultaneous delivery of insulin and glucagon through integrated devices to better regulate blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641794</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accu-Chek Patch Pump">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Patch Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek patch pump is a type of patch insulin pump expected to be available in Brazil, representing emerging insulin delivery technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8085de73bd4812f966c059205e5d3cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776641794</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
