  <data key="d2">Pickup JC authored a chapter titled "Is insulin pump treatment justifiable?" in the book "Difficult Diabetes" edited by Gill G, Pickup J, and Gareth WG.&lt;SEP&gt;Pickup JC is a researcher who authored a review on insulin-pump therapy for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Pickup JC is listed as an author in a meta-analysis on severe hypoglycemia and glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
