</node>
<node id="Diabetes Complications">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Complications</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45bbbee62d25d825935842af1930bb44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8bc02d862fc2c83e40dafc871482c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53f409a49620f4d40ad687bd0c0df19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4f56a727625747d95bd88ea9712defc</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergency care costs are associated with acute diabetic decompensations and are considered in economic evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes complications are adverse health outcomes that can be reduced through effective glycemic management.</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643565</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Treatment</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7be6907597f74116387925485497fbd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0522904b9c236fceb86e75d6da872d4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1961d5ebd8cd94a8e08ca46c59210d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f182d57176633ee05e1a23031d6ad2a</data>
  <data key="d2">Danne T is a co-author of the ISPAD 2018 Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines on insulin treatment in children and adolescents with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin treatment is a medical approach used in managing diabetes, particularly in children and adolescents, to regulate blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin treatment is a therapy used to manage blood glucose levels in people with diabetes, especially when other methods are inadequate.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin treatment is a medical intervention used to manage diabetes, successfully applied to both Elizabeth Hughes and Elsie Needham in 1922.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin treatment is a medical intervention used to manage diabetes, successfully applied to both Elizabeth Hughes and Elsie Needham in 1922.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin treatment is a therapeutic intervention used for pregnant individuals with significant glucose abnormalities, especially when lifestyle changes are insufficient.</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647282</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
