  <data key="d0">Illness or Infection</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738</data>
  <data key="d2">During illness or infection, the body may require higher insulin doses temporarily due to increased metabolic stress.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Degludeca">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Degludeca</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Degludeca is a long-acting insulin analog used in diabetes management, shown to reduce rates of symptomatic, nocturnal, and severe hypoglycemia compared to other insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642232</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Glargina U100">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Glargina U100</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Glargina U100 is a long-acting insulin analog used in the treatment of diabetes, used as a comparator in studies assessing hypoglycemia incidence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642232</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Glargina U300">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Glargina U300</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Glargina U300 is a concentrated form of long-acting insulin analog, not yet tested for flexible dosing in DM1 populations according to the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642232</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Noturna">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Noturna</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia noturna é uma condição de baixa glicemia durante a noite, cujo risco foi reduzido com o uso de insulina lispro em crianças pequenas.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia Noturna refers to nocturnal hypoglycemia, occurring during sleep, and shown to be significantly reduced by insulin degludeca and rapid analogs.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia noturna é um risco reduzido com o uso de análogos de insulina de ação longa em comparação com a insulina NPH.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia noturna é uma condição em que os níveis de glicose caem perigosamente durante o sono, detectável por meio de sensores de glicose contínua.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b0164438dcfad197945cf23b924fe86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-993ef3cd53aca15e211c42cb48f1b4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c804699375feba4c866cc3a1bc00211</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1776644595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Assintomática">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Assintomática</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia Assintomática refers to hypoglycemia without symptoms, which was an exclusion criterion in some studies mentioned.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642232</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estudo SWITCH 1">
  <data key="d0">Estudo SWITCH 1</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo SWITCH 1 is a clinical trial comparing insulin degludeca and glargina U100 in terms of hypoglycemia incidence in people with DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estudo BEGIN Flex T1">
  <data key="d0">Estudo BEGIN Flex T1</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo BEGIN Flex T1 is an open-label, treat-to-target clinical trial assessing the safety and efficacy of flexible dosing of insulin degludeca in people with DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Análogos de Insulina de Ação Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Análogos de Insulina de Ação Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Análogos de Insulina de Ação Rápida include lispro, aspart, and glulisine, used in basal-bolus regimens to reduce hypoglycemia risk in DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Análogos de Insulina de Ação Ultrarrápida">
  <data key="d0">Análogos de Insulina de Ação Ultrarrápida</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Análogos de Insulina de Ação Ultrarrápida include ultra-rapid aspart and inhaled technosphere insulin, used to improve prandial glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Lispro">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Lispro</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina lispro é um análogo de insulina de ação rápida que reduziu o risco de hipoglicemia noturna em crianças pequenas em comparação com a insulina humana regular.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Lispro is a rapid-acting insulin analog that reduces the risk of nocturnal hypoglycemia, especially in young children.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b0164438dcfad197945cf23b924fe86</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Asparte">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Asparte</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Asparte is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in basal-bolus therapy for DM1 patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642235</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Glulisina">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Glulisina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Glulisina is a rapid-acting insulin analog used to manage postprandial glucose levels in DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Inalável Tecnosfera">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Inalável Tecnosfera</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina inalável tecnosfera é uma insulina de ação ultrarrápida administrada por via oral inalatória, que aumenta o tempo no alvo glicêmico, reduz a hipoglicemia e tem menor duração de efeito, mas pode causar tosse como efeito adverso.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina inalável tecnosfera é uma forma de insulina indicada apenas para adultos a partir de 18 anos.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Inalável Tecnosfera is an ultra-rapid inhaled insulin formulation used as a prandial insulin in DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b0164438dcfad197945cf23b924fe86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733697cf2994b8b4b5add361db11a43</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Terapia Basal-Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Terapia Basal-Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Terapia Basal-Bolus is a treatment regimen for DM1 involving long-acting basal insulin and rapid- or ultra-rapid-acting bolus insulin to control glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metanálise">
  <data key="d0">Metanálise</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Metanálise refers to a statistical synthesis of data from multiple clinical trials, used to assess the effectiveness of insulin analogs in reducing hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Metanálise refers to a statistical synthesis of multiple studies evaluating the accuracy of HbA1c and fasting glucose for diagnosing diabetes mellitus using TTGO-2h as the gold standard.&lt;SEP&gt;Metanálise refers to a statistical synthesis of multiple studies evaluating the accuracy of HbA1c and fasting glucose for diagnosing diabetes mellitus using TTGO-2h as the gold standard.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd2d58abc8f20df1ff7ae241f4cfee7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776688945</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Revisão Sistemática">
  <data key="d0">Revisão Sistemática</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Revisão Sistemática is a comprehensive review method used to analyze randomized clinical trials on insulin analogs and hypoglycemia incidence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Asparte Ultrarrápida">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Asparte Ultrarrápida</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina asparte ultrarrápida é um análogo de insulina que demonstrou superioridade no controle da glicemia pós-prandial quando aplicado antes da refeição e não-inferioridade quando aplicado até 20 minutos após o início da refeição.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Asparte Ultrarrápida is an ultra-rapid-acting insulin analog used in prandial glucose control for individuals with DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a45688326f1b9dbe3fc7ae4ba51043a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b0164438dcfad197945cf23b924fe86</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prandial Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Prandial Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Prandial insulin refers to rapid- or ultra-rapid-acting insulin analogs administered before meals to control postprandial glucose levels in Diabetes Mellitus Type 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Prandial insulin is a rapid-acting insulin administered before meals to manage postprandial blood glucose spikes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1abe83ba7814c7afe7a123e2f79a10a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642237</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Control and Complications Trial">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Control and Complications Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial was a landmark clinical study comparing intensive versus conventional insulin therapy in type 1 diabetes, demonstrating significant reductions in microvascular complications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) was a major clinical study that identified hypoglycemia as a major adverse effect of intensified insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) is a clinical study that established a reference for A1C testing in diabetes diagnosis and management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) established the basis for HbA1c standardization and its use in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) established the basis for HbA1c standardization and its use in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) is a clinical study that demonstrated the benefits of intensive glucose control in reducing microvascular complications in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f357ebc59eb6ed3dd2035a13da0df52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5fc9e82121669cb9d4aff08c8c9019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564f10440969233a515af4974c158c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad6cd6b0bad77397aa6685ccb2cfaef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689298</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Epidemiology of Diabetes Interventions and Complications">
  <data key="d0">Epidemiology of Diabetes Interventions and Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Epidemiology of Diabetes Interventions and Complications is an observational follow-up study to the DCCT, tracking long-term outcomes in participants after transition to intensive therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642238</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microvascular Complications">
  <data key="d0">Microvascular Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Microvascular complications are long-term effects of diabetes affecting small blood vessels, including retinopathy, neuropathy, and diabetic kidney disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are long-term consequences of diabetes affecting small blood vessels, with risk in pancreatic diabetes similar to other diabetes types.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are health conditions such as retinopathy and nephropathy associated with prolonged high blood glucose in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are health conditions such as retinopathy and nephropathy associated with prolonged high blood glucose in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are diabetes-related conditions affecting small blood vessels, including retinopathy, microalbuminuria, and neuropathy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa8638b27cbd181b507c81fea49c6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a796990fe8edf70e4463124a0233c32c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad6cd6b0bad77397aa6685ccb2cfaef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689298</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Macrovascular Complications">
  <data key="d0">Macrovascular Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Macrovascular complications are cardiovascular conditions associated with diabetes, such as heart disease and stroke, influenced by long-term glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642238</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Long-Acting Insulin Analogs">
  <data key="d0">Long-Acting Insulin Analogs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Long-acting insulin analogs, such as glargine U100 and detemir, are recombinant insulin formulations with more predictable pharmacokinetics and reduced risk of nocturnal hypoglycemia compared to NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-acting insulin analogs are modified forms of insulin designed to provide a prolonged and more predictable action, associated with a lower risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157fbe972c55a9a0df76dbef85b43e63</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642238</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbohydrate Counting">
  <data key="d0">Carbohydrate Counting</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbohydrate counting is a dietary management technique used by individuals with diabetes to calculate insulin dosage based on carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohydrate counting is a dietary management strategy used in type 1 diabetes to calculate insulin dosage based on carbohydrate intake.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Sensitivity Factor">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Sensitivity Factor</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin sensitivity factor is a value that indicates how much one unit of insulin lowers blood glucose, used in insulin dose calculations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin to Carbohydrate Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Insulin to Carbohydrate Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin to carbohydrate ratio is a measure used to determine the amount of insulin needed to cover a specific quantity of carbohydrates in a meal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a49920639f738eae3de220d132cbc081</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642240</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
