</node>
<node id="Basal-Bolus Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Basal-Bolus Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal-bolus therapy is the recommended insulin treatment strategy for Diabetes Mellitus Type 1, involving basal insulin for background control and bolus insulin for mealtime coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal-bolus therapy is an insulin treatment regimen combining long-acting basal insulin with short-acting bolus insulin, used in type 1 diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1abe83ba7814c7afe7a123e2f79a10a</data>
