  <data key="d5">1776642263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prandial Timing">
  <data key="d0">Prandial Timing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Prandial timing refers to the scheduling of bolus insulin relative to meals, reviewed for optimal diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clinical Trial">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A clinical trial is a research study to evaluate medical interventions, such as the EDITION 4 and BEGIN trials on insulin therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial is a research study assessing the effectiveness of medical approaches, including the use of CGM in hospital settings.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial is a research study testing interventions to delay or prevent type 1 diabetes in individuals with evidence of islet autoimmunity.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial is a research study testing interventions to delay or prevent type 1 diabetes in individuals with evidence of islet autoimmunity.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial involving teplizumab was conducted as a double-blind, randomized phase 2 study with 76 participants at high risk for Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial involving teplizumab was conducted as a double-blind, randomized phase 2 study with 76 participants at high risk for Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac7fb8feaa2febe2b5f8525b93f3080f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13cc105f4fbcaf9606f9a0faa1e2d31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-309ce40527b1cc8f260e96e195742001</data>
