  <data key="d2">Endocr Pract is a journal that published a study comparing once-daily insulin glargine with twice-daily NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocr Pract is a journal that published studies on insulin pump therapy, C-peptide testing, and treatment outcomes in diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocr Pract is a journal publishing practical clinical research in endocrinology.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocr Pract is the official journal of the American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists, publishing clinical guidelines and practice statements.</data>
