<node id="Fast-Acting Insulin Aspart">
  <data key="d0">Fast-Acting Insulin Aspart</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast-acting insulin aspart is an advanced form of insulin aspart that improves glycemic control in patients with type 1 diabetes using basal-bolus treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast-acting insulin aspart is a rapid-onset insulin analog used to improve glycemic control in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3</data>
