<node id="Bolus Calculator">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Calculator</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A bolus calculator is a tool used in insulin pump therapy to determine insulin dosage, particularly characterized by low insulin-to-carbohydrate ratios in prepubertal children.&lt;SEP&gt;A bolus calculator is a system designed to aid insulin dosing decisions, often requiring FDA approval for safety and efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
