<node id="Official Guideline on Insulin Therapy for Type 1 Diabetes (2023)">
  <data key="d0">Official Guideline on Insulin Therapy for Type 1 Diabetes (2023)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Official Guideline on Insulin Therapy for Type 1 Diabetes (2023) is a medical directive published by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes, authored by Silva Júnior WS, Gabbay M, Lamounier R, and Bertoluci M.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5647e96fec802433abcc8922a33d23b8</data>
