<node id="Diabetes Technol Ther">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Technol Ther</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Technol Ther, also known as Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics, is a medical journal dedicated to publishing research on technological advancements and therapeutic innovations in diabetes care. The journal serves as a platform for clinical studies and scientific inquiry into diabetes technologies, with a focus on improving glycemic control and patient outcomes through innovative tools and systems.

The journal has published a wide range of studies on diabetes management technologies, including research on insulin pump therapy, glucose monitoring systems, and closed-loop insulin delivery systems. It has featured clinical trials evaluating the accuracy and safety of next-generation continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) devices such as the Eversense and Dexcom G7. Additionally, Diabetes Technol Ther has contributed to the understanding of optimal insulin administration practices, including a 2010 study on insulin bolus timing for glycemic control.

Diabetes Technol Ther also emphasizes real-world applications of diabetes technology, as demonstrated by its publication of real-life CGM data from Polish patients in 2021. The journal covers emerging digital health solutions, including virtual clinics and other digital platforms that support remote diabetes management. Overall, it remains a key resource for research on insulin delivery devices, glucose monitoring technologies, and integrated systems aimed at advancing diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technol Ther is a journal that published research on the relationship between Hemoglobin A1C and time-in-range in diabetes patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4e05859597c5f1693c2f9fe1ef0a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-755e9677a7018e4cc382b7d903590786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e1858f15899659bc0116977a6e1e000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc6a5cedffa24f9a3134770cf1526b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-862cb6f254fb8ebb4f3e1080dbf4f53c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1319c06eac1875d14b345f09579021be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1af4e8af9934463f38c5951016d9664b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054</data>
