<node id="Intensive Treatment Of Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Intensive Treatment Of Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intensive treatment of diabetes involves tight glycemic control to reduce the risk of long-term complications in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive treatment of diabetes refers to a therapeutic approach aimed at tightly controlling blood glucose to reduce complications in insulin-dependent diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dadde3434f68ef74ebdf23be6a24ec</data>
