<node id="Glucose Variability">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Variability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, reduced with glargine compared to NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, with research aiming to define thresholds between low and high variability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6764f5f0af1c9855a1901ea1bef131d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f731774e5187eb76527ebeabefeeeb5</data>
