  <data key="d0">70% NPH/30% R (Humulin 70/30)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">70% NPH/30% R (Humulin 70/30) is a premixed insulin with intermediate and short-acting components, used for convenience in diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fed992e01da83317a2c9f0adf751f53f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642312</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
