  <data key="d0">50% NPL/50% Lispro (Humalog Mix 50)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">50% NPL/50% Lispro (Humalog Mix 50) is a premixed insulin with higher prandial insulin content for greater post-meal glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fed992e01da83317a2c9f0adf751f53f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776642312</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
