  <data key="d0">70% NPA/30% Aspart (NovoMix 70/30)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">70% NPA/30% Aspart (NovoMix 70/30) is a premixed insulin with rapid onset and intermediate duration, used for dual glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fed992e01da83317a2c9f0adf751f53f</data>
