  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The U of T Board of Governors is the governing body of the University of Toronto that formalized the collaboration with Eli Lilly through an indenture agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;The U of T Board of Governors is the governing body of the University of Toronto that formalized the collaboration with Eli Lilly through an indenture agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;The U of T Board of Governors is the governing body of the University of Toronto that formalized the collaboration with Eli Lilly through an indenture agreement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-69124f1cc2248b019af52b9d2e71c12e</data>
