</node>
<node id="Indianapolis">
  <data key="d0">Indianapolis</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Indianapolis is the location of Eli Lilly's operations and part of the collaborative effort in insulin development.&lt;SEP&gt;Indianapolis is the location of Eli Lilly's operations and part of the collaborative effort in insulin development.&lt;SEP&gt;Indianapolis is the location of Eli Lilly's operations and part of the collaborative effort in insulin development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-69124f1cc2248b019af52b9d2e71c12e</data>
