<node id="Charlotte Clarke">
  <data key="d0">Charlotte Clarke</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Charlotte Clarke was a 57-year-old diabetic patient admitted to Toronto General Hospital in July 1922, whose critical condition prompted an experimental insulin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlotte Clarke was a 57-year-old diabetic patient admitted to Toronto General Hospital in July 1922, whose critical condition prompted an experimental insulin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlotte Clarke was a 57-year-old diabetic patient admitted to Toronto General Hospital in July 1922, whose critical condition prompted an experimental insulin treatment.</data>
