<node id="Insulin100">
  <data key="d0">Insulin100</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin100 is a commemorative initiative established to mark the 100th anniversary of the discovery and development of insulin, a breakthrough medical achievement that transformed the treatment of diabetes. Organized by Defining Moments Canada, Insulin100 serves as both a historical documentation project and a nationwide observance, highlighting the scientific milestones and societal impact associated with insulin’s discovery. The initiative emphasizes the significance of this medical advancement, celebrating the researchers, institutions, and patient communities involved in its development and application over the past century.

Through various educational and public engagement activities, Insulin100 documents the history and key milestones of insulin’s journey from laboratory discovery to life-saving therapy. It aims to preserve and disseminate the legacy of this medical breakthrough, ensuring that future generations understand its profound impact on global health. By focusing on both historical context and ongoing relevance, Insulin100 underscores the importance of scientific innovation and collaboration in addressing chronic disease.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1e08a876cbf5eb18e5ec55068b1a54d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030fb051231df38c20ff2e1c1e73153d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eaeeaa0051cb78248f45d6af3009e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-039feb72dc6f2619a95a3b925679cc65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572090790565a204f99a705ed03cf526</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
