<node id="Pancreatectomy">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatectomy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatectomy is a surgical procedure performed by Banting and Best on dogs to remove the pancreas as part of their insulin research.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatectomy is a surgical procedure performed by Banting and Best on dogs to remove the pancreas as part of their insulin research.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatectomy is a surgical procedure performed by Banting and Best on dogs to remove the pancreas as part of their insulin research.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatectomy is a surgical procedure that can lead to insulin deficiency and the need for insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatectomy is a surgical procedure performed by Banting and Best on dogs to remove the pancreas as part of their insulin research.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatectomy is the surgical removal of the pancreas, which can lead to pancreatic diabetes and may be followed by islet autotransplantation.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1d6cf513719b7859327bdb2f78fee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df233d11f0547c43f4dc4cad909d392b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa8638b27cbd181b507c81fea49c6f0</data>
