  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Dog #391 is a dog from which Banting and Best removed a degenerated pancreas on 30 July 1921 to prepare their first pancreatic extract.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #391 is a dog from which Banting and Best removed a degenerated pancreas on 30 July 1921 to prepare their first pancreatic extract.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #391 is a dog from which Banting and Best removed a degenerated pancreas on 30 July 1921 to prepare their first pancreatic extract.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #391 is a dog from which Banting and Best removed a degenerated pancreas on 30 July 1921 to prepare their first pancreatic extract.</data>
