  <data key="d2">On 30 July 1921, Banting and Best removed the degenerated pancreas from Dog #391 and prepared their first pancreatic extract, which was injected into Dog #410 the same day.&lt;SEP&gt;On 30 July 1921, Banting and Best removed the degenerated pancreas from Dog #391 and prepared their first pancreatic extract, which was injected into Dog #410 the same day.&lt;SEP&gt;On 30 July 1921, Banting and Best removed the degenerated pancreas from Dog #391 and prepared their first pancreatic extract, which was injected into Dog #410 the same day.&lt;SEP&gt;On 30 July 1921, Banting and Best removed the degenerated pancreas from Dog #391 and prepared their first pancreatic extract, which was injected into Dog #410 the same day.</data>
