  <data key="d2">The Pharmacology Department at the University of Toronto hosted Banting and Best’s laboratory and supported their insulin experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pharmacology Department at the University of Toronto provided Banting with a lecturer position and laboratory space.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pharmacology Department at the University of Toronto hosted Banting and Best’s laboratory and supported their insulin experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pharmacology Department at the University of Toronto provided Banting with a lecturer position and laboratory space.</data>
