</node>
<node id="Insulin Research Experiment">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Research Experiment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin research experiment refers to the series of tests conducted by Banting and Best on diabetic dogs to develop and validate pancreatic extracts for blood sugar control.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin research experiment refers to the series of tests conducted by Banting and Best on diabetic dogs to develop and validate pancreatic extracts for blood sugar control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-842c04d944f188525956166c3081e7e4</data>
