  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Pancreatic Duct Ligation Procedure was an experimental surgical technique attempted by Banting and Best on a calf to isolate internal secretions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pancreatic Duct Ligation Procedure was an experimental surgical technique attempted by Banting and Best on a calf to isolate internal secretions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
