</node>
<node id="Alcohol Method">
  <data key="d0">Alcohol Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Alcohol Method was a technique used to improve the purity of the pancreatic extract, first applied on December 7, 1921.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alcohol Method was a technique used to improve the purity of the pancreatic extract, first applied on December 7, 1921.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
