</node>
<node id="Dog #27">
  <data key="d0">Dog #27</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Dog #27 was a diabetic dog used in experiments; after receiving pancreatic extract, its blood sugar dropped and urine became sugar-free.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #27 was a diabetic dog used in experiments; after receiving pancreatic extract, its blood sugar dropped and urine became sugar-free.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
