</node>
<node id="4 October 1921">
  <data key="d0">4 October 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 4 October 1921, Banting and Best attempted a pancreatic duct ligation on a calf, which died due to anesthesia complications.&lt;SEP&gt;On 4 October 1921, Banting and Best attempted a pancreatic duct ligation on a calf, which died due to anesthesia complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
