</node>
<node id="14 November 1921">
  <data key="d0">14 November 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 14 November 1921, Banting’s 30th birthday, he and Best presented their work to the Department of Physiology Journal Club, receiving a key suggestion from Dr. N.B. Taylor.&lt;SEP&gt;On 14 November 1921, Banting’s 30th birthday, he and Best presented their work to the Department of Physiology Journal Club, receiving a key suggestion from Dr. N.B. Taylor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
