  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="16 November 1921">
  <data key="d0">16 November 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 16 November 1921, Banting had a breakthrough idea inspired by farm experience, leading to the use of foetal calf pancreases for extract preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;On 16 November 1921, Banting had a breakthrough idea inspired by farm experience, leading to the use of foetal calf pancreases for extract preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643971</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="17 November 1921">
  <data key="d0">17 November 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 17 November 1921, Banting and Best removed the pancreas from Dog #33, Marjorie, to induce diabetes for experimental treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;On 17 November 1921, Banting and Best removed the pancreas from Dog #33, Marjorie, to induce diabetes for experimental treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf43b932b33f125e5a5e679dcb50d79</data>
