  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The University Farm was established in collaboration with the University of Toronto to support research activities at the Connaught Laboratories.&lt;SEP&gt;The University Farm was established in collaboration with the University of Toronto to support research activities at the Connaught Laboratories.</data>
