  <data key="d0">University Of Toronto</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The University of Toronto is a Canadian university that collaborated in the establishment of the Connaught Antitoxin Laboratories and supported research into insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Toronto is the academic institution where the discovery and early development of insulin took place.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Toronto played a central role in the discovery, development, and purification of insulin and formed the Insulin Committee to manage its production and distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Toronto is a Canadian university that collaborated in the establishment of the Connaught Antitoxin Laboratories and supported research into insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Toronto is the academic institution where the discovery and early development of insulin took place.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Toronto played a central role in the discovery, development, and purification of insulin and formed the Insulin Committee to manage its production and distribution.</data>
