  <data key="d2">An abscess formed at one of Leonard Thompson's injection sites after the first insulin treatment, indicating a negative reaction to the impure extract.&lt;SEP&gt;An abscess formed at one of Leonard Thompson's injection sites after the first insulin treatment, indicating a negative reaction to the impure extract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e86a3a1d4228f2b3b5e588cb46fdd3cc</data>
