</node>
<node id="Alcohol Concentration">
  <data key="d0">Alcohol Concentration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Collip discovered that maintaining alcohol concentration slightly over 90% allowed for the purification of insulin in its purest form.&lt;SEP&gt;Collip discovered that maintaining alcohol concentration slightly over 90% allowed for the purification of insulin in its purest form.</data>
