  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Albert E. Gooderham is the chairman of the University of Toronto’s Connaught Committee and signed the research agreement with the insulin team.&lt;SEP&gt;Albert E. Gooderham is the chairman of the University of Toronto’s Connaught Committee and signed the research agreement with the insulin team.</data>
