  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Press coverage began on January 14, 1922, with a Toronto Star article announcing progress in diabetes treatment and the first human trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Press coverage began on January 14, 1922, with a Toronto Star article announcing progress in diabetes treatment and the first human trial.</data>
