  <data key="d0">Research And Development Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A formal agreement signed on January 25, 1922, between Connaught and the insulin research team, outlining conditions for collaboration and prohibiting patents during the initial development phase.&lt;SEP&gt;A formal agreement signed on January 25, 1922, between Connaught and the insulin research team, outlining conditions for collaboration and prohibiting patents during the initial development phase.</data>
