<node id="Multiple Daily Insulin Injections">
  <data key="d0">Multiple Daily Insulin Injections</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiple daily insulin injections refer to a diabetes treatment regimen involving several insulin doses per day, where CGM can assist in optimizing glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple daily insulin injections refer to a diabetes treatment regimen involving several insulin doses per day, where CGM can assist in optimizing glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple daily insulin injections are a treatment regimen for type 2 diabetes compared with continuous glucose monitoring in the DIAMOND study.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple daily insulin injections are a conventional method of insulin delivery compared with pump therapy in diabetes management studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1af4e8af9934463f38c5951016d9664b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc6a5cedffa24f9a3134770cf1526b</data>
