<node id="Glucose Trend Arrows">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Trend Arrows</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose trend arrows are visual indicators (up, flat, down) provided by CGM systems that show the direction and rate of glucose change, helping users anticipate and respond to fluctuations.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose trend arrows are visual indicators (up, flat, down) provided by CGM systems that show the direction and rate of glucose change, helping users anticipate and respond to fluctuations.</data>
