<node id="Dexcom G6">
  <data key="d0">Dexcom G6</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418c63d7f8a7a0408d9107e40d9251db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126839e244bb40d6238ea2814bdda12a</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dexcom G6 system is approved for use in insulin dosing decisions without confirmatory finger-prick tests, as demonstrated by the REPLACE-BG study.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom G6 is a specific real-time CGM device designated as integrated CGM by the FDA and approved for use with automated insulin delivery systems; it has no generic form available.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom G6 is a real-time continuous glucose monitoring system affected by substances like acetaminophen and hydroxyurea.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom G6 is a continuous glucose monitoring device that may be affected by certain interfering substances.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dexcom G6 is a specific model of continuous glucose monitor evaluated for accuracy in non-critically ill hospitalized patients with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom G6® is a continuous glucose monitoring system approved by the FDA for use in making insulin therapy decisions without capillary glucose verification.</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/cgm.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776644088</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="People With Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">People With Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">People with diabetes are individuals managing their condition using various technologies and monitoring methods as prescribed.&lt;SEP&gt;People with diabetes are individuals managing their condition through monitoring, medication, and lifestyle adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;People with diabetes require glucose monitoring to evaluate therapy response and manage glycemic targets safely.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c03aef84b96134fc1f0a2a4d8466e0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8bc02d862fc2c83e40dafc871482c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d</data>
