<node id="Counterfeit Strips">
  <data key="d0">Counterfeit Strips</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Counterfeit strips are unauthorized or reused test strips that may produce inaccurate blood glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Counterfeit strips are unauthorized test strips that should not be used for blood glucose testing due to potential inaccuracy.</data>
