</node>
<node id="Lancing Devices">
  <data key="d0">Lancing Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lancing devices are tools used to obtain blood samples for glucose testing, with some designs aiming to reduce pain.</data>
