  <data key="d0">Table 7.1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 7.1 presents a comparison of blood glucose meter accuracy standards between ISO 15197:2013 and the FDA for home and hospital use.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 7.1 compares the current ISO and FDA standards for blood glucose meter accuracy.</data>
