  <data key="d2">Diabetes Res Clin Pract is a medical journal that published a study on flash glucose monitoring in the Netherlands in 2021.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Res Clin Pract is a journal that published research on the use of continuous glucose monitoring as a motivational tool in poorly controlled type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Research and Clinical Practice is a journal that published studies on the incidence of type 1 diabetes in young adults and clinical diagnostic models for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Res Clin Pract is a journal that published findings from the Israel Study of Glucose Intolerance, Obesity and Hypertension.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Res Clin Pract is a journal that published findings from the Israel Study of Glucose Intolerance, Obesity and Hypertension.</data>
