<node id="FDA News Release">
  <data key="d0">FDA News Release</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The FDA News Release announced the expansion of the indication for a continuous glucose monitoring system, allowing it to replace traditional fingerstick testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-755e9677a7018e4cc382b7d903590786</data>
