</node>
<node id="U-80 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U-80 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">U-80 insulin is an older concentration of insulin used in some regions and with specific syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;U-80 insulin is an older insulin concentration for which specialized syringes are still available in some regions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0</data>
