  <data key="d2">Patient preferences reflect individual choices regarding insulin delivery methods based on usability, convenience, and lifestyle.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient preferences refer to individual choices regarding insulin delivery methods, such as pens versus vials and syringes.</data>
