  <data key="d2">Pediatric Diabetes Consortium is a research group conducting studies on type 1 diabetes in children, including the NeOn study.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pediatric Diabetes Consortium is a research network studying treatment patterns and outcomes in youth with type 1 diabetes.</data>
