<node id="T1D Exchange Clinic Network">
  <data key="d0">T1D Exchange Clinic Network</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The T1D Exchange Clinic Network is a research group that collected data on type 1 diabetes patients and their monitoring practices.&lt;SEP&gt;T1D Exchange Clinic Network is a research consortium that maintains a clinic registry for type 1 diabetes and conducted a study on pump discontinuation.&lt;SEP&gt;The T1D Exchange Clinic Network is a collaborative research group focused on type 1 diabetes management and outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The T1D Exchange Clinic Network is a registry for data on type 1 diabetes patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0a49a3e1aba9780862b94a266490691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc6a5cedffa24f9a3134770cf1526b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dadde3434f68ef74ebdf23be6a24ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b</data>
