  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuous Glucose Monitors">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Glucose Monitors</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous glucose monitors are medical devices used for tracking blood glucose levels in real time, particularly in hospital settings and during the COVID-19 pandemic.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643623</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Insulin Dosing Systems">
  <data key="d0">Automated Insulin Dosing Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated insulin dosing systems are technologies that deliver insulin based on glucose readings, often integrated with continuous glucose monitors for in-hospital diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643623</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hospital Consensus Guideline">
  <data key="d0">Hospital Consensus Guideline</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The hospital consensus guideline refers to standardized recommendations for managing diabetes in hospitalized patients using advanced technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643625</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Can J Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Can J Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Can J Diabetes is a peer-reviewed journal that publishes clinical guidelines and research related to diabetes care, including insulin pump therapy management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643625</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Enforcement Policy for Non-Invasive Remote Monitoring Devices">
  <data key="d0">Enforcement Policy for Non-Invasive Remote Monitoring Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This policy outlines the FDA's regulatory approach for remote monitoring devices used during the COVID-19 pandemic to support patient care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643625</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Remote Continuous Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Remote Continuous Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Remote continuous glucose monitoring allows healthcare providers to track patients' glucose levels from a distance, especially in critical care and pandemic settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643626</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Computerized Insulin Infusion Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Computerized Insulin Infusion Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A computerized insulin infusion protocol is a digital system used to regulate insulin delivery in critically ill patients based on glucose data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643626</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Critically Ill Patients">
  <data key="d0">Critically Ill Patients</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Critically ill patients are individuals in intensive care units who require close monitoring and specialized treatment, including glycemic control during the COVID-19 pandemic.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643626</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="COVID-19 Medical ICU">
  <data key="d0">COVID-19 Medical ICU</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The COVID-19 medical ICU is a specialized intensive care unit for treating patients with severe coronavirus disease, where remote glucose monitoring has been trialed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643626</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Endocrine Society">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine Society</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Endocrine Society is a professional organization that collaborates with Choosing Wisely to promote evidence-based practices in endocrinology.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society is a professional organization that developed a clinical practice guideline for managing hyperglycemia in hospitalized adult patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society co-authored a scientific statement on staging presymptomatic type 1 diabetes with JDRF and the American Diabetes Association.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society published a clinical practice guideline on the treatment of diabetes in older adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dadde3434f68ef74ebdf23be6a24ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f76e40d0d9b4211d8c61a53ea298d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3628fc721a312bfbaace1de3a4d877</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689280</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Management of Hyperglycemia in Hospitalized Adult Patients in Non-Critical Care Settings">
  <data key="d0">Management of Hyperglycemia in Hospitalized Adult Patients in Non-Critical Care Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This clinical practice guideline by the Endocrine Society provides evidence-based recommendations for blood glucose control in non-critical hospital settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Am J Health Syst Pharm">
  <data key="d0">Am J Health Syst Pharm</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Am J Health Syst Pharm is a journal publishing research on pharmaceutical care, including practical implementation strategies for remote glucose monitoring in hospitals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Monitoring Blood Glucose Test Systems">
  <data key="d0">Self-Monitoring Blood Glucose Test Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">These are over-the-counter devices allowing patients to manually check their blood glucose levels, regulated by the FDA.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Glucose Monitoring Test Systems">
  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Monitoring Test Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical devices used for measuring blood glucose levels at the point of care, specifically designed for prescription use.&lt;SEP&gt;Prescription point-of-care blood glucose monitoring systems are medical devices used in clinical settings to measure blood glucose levels accurately.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-498e4bb45447ec837c66b8fa72136a1b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Critically Ill Hospitalized Patients">
  <data key="d0">Non-Critically Ill Hospitalized Patients</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-critically ill hospitalized patients are individuals admitted to general medical units who require glucose monitoring and diabetes management but are not in intensive care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b4ef00b7799130b85ed6433c381dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Insulin Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Automated Insulin Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated insulin delivery (AID) systems are advanced diabetes technologies that automatically adjust insulin delivery based on glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Connected Insulin Pens">
  <data key="d0">Connected Insulin Pens</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Connected insulin pens are smart devices that record insulin dosing and integrate with digital health platforms for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Connected insulin pens are smart insulin delivery devices that support diabetes management through data tracking and integration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Medical Management Plan">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Medical Management Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The diabetes medical management plan (DMMP) outlines medical instructions for diabetes care at school, including device use and emergency procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes.org/safeatschool">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes.org/safeatschool</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes.org/safeatschool is an online resource providing training materials and a DMMP template to support diabetes care in school settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90452c5625b363eb503added0caf901d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
