  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">BGM (blood glucose monitoring) is a traditional method of measuring blood glucose through fingerstick tests, used as a comparator in diabetes technology studies.&lt;SEP&gt;BGM stands for blood glucose monitoring, a traditional method of measuring glucose levels through fingerstick tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdddb31a1876a8809b8555564982acd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84</data>
