  <data key="d0">isCGM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">isCGM (intermittently scanned continuous glucose monitoring) is a glucose monitoring system that requires user-initiated scanning to retrieve data, widely used in observational studies.&lt;SEP&gt;isCGM stands for intermittently scanned continuous glucose monitoring, a device that allows users to scan to obtain glucose data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdddb31a1876a8809b8555564982acd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84</data>
