<node id="Randomized Controlled Trial">
  <data key="d0">Randomized Controlled Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A randomized controlled trial (RCT) is a study design used to evaluate the effectiveness of interventions, such as iCGM versus BGM in adults with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A randomized controlled trial is a clinical research design that assigns participants randomly to intervention or control groups to evaluate treatment efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;A randomized controlled trial is a study design used to evaluate the efficacy and safety of medical interventions, such as insulin delivery systems in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdddb31a1876a8809b8555564982acd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07c7e3d6615d1076ae20653358419ff4</data>
