</node>
<node id="Retrospective Study">
  <data key="d0">Retrospective Study</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A retrospective study analyzes past data to evaluate outcomes, such as the impact of rtCGM on A1C and hospitalizations in insulin-treated patients.</data>
