  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The ambulatory glucose profile is a data visualization tool created from continuous glucose monitoring data to aid in assessing glycemic control and achieving treatment targets.&lt;SEP&gt;An ambulatory glucose profile is a standardized report generated from CGM data to visualize glucose patterns over time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdddb31a1876a8809b8555564982acd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84</data>
