  <data key="d0">Multicentre Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A multicentre trial is a clinical study conducted across multiple locations, such as the 12-week closed-loop insulin delivery trial in suboptimally controlled type 1 diabetes.</data>
