<node id="Glycemic Outcomes">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Outcomes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic outcomes refer to measures of blood glucose control, such as A1C and time in range, which can be improved with insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic outcomes refer to measures of blood glucose control in patients with type 1 diabetes, evaluated in studies comparing different insulin delivery methods such as CLC and PLGS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f357ebc59eb6ed3dd2035a13da0df52f</data>
