<node id="PLGS">
  <data key="d0">PLGS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PLGS, or predictive low-glucose suspend, is an insulin delivery system used as a comparator to closed-loop control in clinical trials for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1eea5927c2474e7c5774b94980fc8b78</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
