  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The one-year study refers to a long-term clinical evaluation of hybrid closed-loop systems in individuals with type 1 diabetes, conducted by Lal RA, Basina M, Maahs DM, Hood K, Buckingham B, and Wilson DM.</data>
