  <data key="d0">Glucose Oxidase Monitors</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose Oxidase Monitors are a type of glucose meter that uses the enzyme glucose oxidase in the measurement process and is sensitive to oxygen levels.</data>
