  <data key="d0">Glucose Dehydrogenase Monitors</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose dehydrogenase monitors are a type of glucose monitoring system that may be affected by interfering substances.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Dehydrogenase Monitors are glucose meters that use the enzyme glucose dehydrogenase and are not affected by oxygen levels.</data>
