  <data key="d2">Supplement 1 is an additional issue of Diabetes Care Volume 46 containing specialized content on diabetes technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Supplement 1 of Diabetes Care Volume 46 contains the Standards of Care in Diabetes-2023.&lt;SEP&gt;Supplement 1 of Diabetes Care Volume 46 contains the Standards of Care in Diabetes-2023.</data>
