  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 7.2 lists systems that interact only with glucose oxidase-based monitoring devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 7.2 lists interfering substances that affect glucose meter readings, particularly for glucose oxidase-based systems.</data>
