<node id="Medtronic Guardian">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Guardian</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Guardian is a CGM system that can be affected by acetaminophen, alcohol, and hydroxyurea.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Guardian is a continuous glucose monitoring device susceptible to interference from specific medications or substances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f5c2bbe2ca0e80b85850ca2f9a5c84</data>
