</node>
<node id="Insulin Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin delivery includes administration via syringe, pen, or pump, including continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin delivery encompasses various methods including syringes, pens, pumps, and inhaled insulin for administering insulin to people with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
