<node id="Automated Insulin Delivery Systems">
  <data key="d0">Automated Insulin Delivery Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated insulin delivery systems integrate continuous glucose monitors and insulin pumps to automatically adjust insulin delivery based on glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Automated insulin delivery (AID) systems integrate insulin pumps, continuous glucose monitors, and algorithms to adjust insulin delivery based on glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8651ec88cb5333f03b8af01fee4d3cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f357ebc59eb6ed3dd2035a13da0df52f</data>
