  <data key="d0">Lancet Diabetes Endocrinol</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lancet Diabetes Endocrinol is a journal that published an international consensus statement on open-source automated insulin delivery in 2022.&lt;SEP&gt;Lancet Diabetes Endocrinol is a medical journal that published a modeling study on the global incidence, prevalence, and mortality of type 1 diabetes.</data>
