<node id="100m Sprint Record">
  <data key="d0">100m Sprint Record</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 100m Sprint Record is a performance benchmark in athletics, widely recognized as a measurable standard for evaluating speed and athletic excellence in the 100-meter sprint event. It serves as a key indicator of human performance in track and field, reflecting the pinnacle of sprinting achievement at elite competitions.

This record was recently broken by Noah Carter during the World Athletics Championship, marking a significant milestone in the sport. His accomplishment has been consistently described across multiple sources as a breakthrough moment, underscoring the importance of the event and the athlete’s impact on the discipline. The achievement highlights both the competitive nature of international athletics and the ongoing progression of performance standards at the highest level.

No conflicting information is present among the descriptions; all uniformly attribute the breaking of the 100m sprint record to Noah Carter, with the World Athletics Championship cited as the event where the record was set. Minor variations in phrasing—such as "measurable performance benchmark" versus "performance standard"—do not introduce discrepancies but rather reinforce the record’s role as a quantifiable and prestigious athletic milestone. Collectively, the descriptions affirm the record’s significance and Noah Carter’s role in redefining its limits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-862cb6f254fb8ebb4f3e1080dbf4f53c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc0c65f0481b400f36e5caa3f51fabe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f5ebd46f8491409b5f07f5c83542afd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd2e74b5f8450784b7c60acd6751ae14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15a18ecfcb20fceb4fd80ab22186964e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050dc3a498d3027939b93706cbdb7f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05070e0755e36e3375d401400cf75fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb968add601368451243acd6b2322ce0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647269</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
