<node id="Diabetes Care Volume 46">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Care Volume 46</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Care Volume 46 is a volume of the peer-reviewed medical journal *Diabetes Care*, published in January 2023, that compiles research, clinical studies, and expert guidelines focused on diabetes care and management. It serves as a key resource for healthcare professionals, offering evidence-based insights into the classification, diagnosis, and treatment of diabetes. The volume includes a range of scholarly articles contributing to the evolving understanding of diabetes pathophysiology and clinical practice.

A central component of Diabetes Care Volume 46 is Supplement 1, released in January 2023, which features the official "Standards of Care in Diabetes" for that year. This supplement provides comprehensive clinical recommendations on diabetes screening, diagnosis, and management, including updated diagnostic criteria for various forms of diabetes such as type 1, type 2, gestational diabetes, and other subtypes. It is developed by expert panels, often under the auspices of the American Diabetes Association, and is widely adopted in clinical settings to standardize and improve patient outcomes.

The supplement is particularly notable for consolidating annual updates to treatment guidelines, reflecting the latest scientific evidence and consensus in diabetes care. Together, Diabetes Care Volume 46 and its Supplement 1 form an authoritative reference that integrates research findings with practical clinical guidance, supporting healthcare providers in delivering high-quality, standardized care to individuals with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1319c06eac1875d14b345f09579021be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5cd98bab9909442c09e3fcd5b21fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa8638b27cbd181b507c81fea49c6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3bdf442194477639404123cea5d5974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47356c03c704ef89b9f41bbd939bc8a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
