<node id="Diabetes Self-Management">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Self-Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes self-management involves lifestyle modifications, glucose monitoring, and therapy adjustments supported by education and technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643698</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Device Education and Training">
  <data key="d0">Device Education and Training</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Device education and training refers to the initial and ongoing instruction provided to individuals with diabetes and caregivers on the proper use of diabetes devices and data utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643698</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Care Volume 46 Supplement 1">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Care Volume 46 Supplement 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1 is a specific issue of the journal published in January 2023 that contains the Standards of Care in Diabetes-2023, focusing on diabetes technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643698</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recommendation 7.1">
  <data key="d0">Recommendation 7.1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommendation 7.1 advises that device selection for diabetes management should be individualized based on the person's needs, preferences, and skill level, including consideration of caregiver input when applicable.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643699</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recommendation 7.2">
  <data key="d0">Recommendation 7.2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommendation 7.2 states that individuals with diabetes and caregivers must receive initial and ongoing education, training, and evaluation in the use of diabetes devices and data utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0524115c9e0c2a0ed35c413e50c658e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776643699</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
