</node>
<node id="Glicemia De Jejum">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia De Jejum</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia de jejum refers to fasting blood glucose levels, with normal values between 70 mg/dL and 100 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de Jejum is a fasting blood glucose test used to diagnose Diabetes Mellitus and prediabetes, requiring 8-12 hours of fasting.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de Jejum, or fasting blood glucose, is a diagnostic test for Diabetes Mellitus, with a threshold of ≥126 mg/dL indicating diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de Jejum is a fasting blood glucose test used to diagnose Diabetes Mellitus and prediabetes, requiring 8-12 hours of fasting.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de Jejum, or fasting blood glucose, is a diagnostic test for Diabetes Mellitus, with a threshold of ≥126 mg/dL indicating diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5acf61a3a7ae9c09040830d5a662f612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0842e3c99a8c4dc96abdcb05ee7fe0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/HIPO_HIPER.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776688957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hiper">
  <data key="d0">Hiper</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hiper refers to hyperglycemia, a condition where blood glucose levels exceed 100 mg/dL or go above the detection limit of the device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5acf61a3a7ae9c09040830d5a662f612</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/HIPO_HIPER.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776644861</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Google">
  <data key="d0">Google</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google is a technology company whose images were used in the informational brochure about hyperglycemia and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5acf61a3a7ae9c09040830d5a662f612</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/HIPO_HIPER.pdf</data>
