  <data key="d2">Fingers with sugar-containing food residue can lead to falsely elevated blood glucose readings if not cleaned before testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with sugar-containing food residue can lead to falsely elevated blood glucose readings if not cleaned before testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with sugar-containing food residue can lead to falsely elevated blood glucose readings if not cleaned before testing.</data>
