  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fingers with alcohol residue, either liquid or gel, may affect the accuracy of blood glucose test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with alcohol residue, either liquid or gel, may affect the accuracy of blood glucose test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with alcohol residue, either liquid or gel, may affect the accuracy of blood glucose test results.</data>
