  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fingers with moisturizing cream can contaminate the blood sample and compromise the reliability of glucose testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with moisturizing cream can contaminate the blood sample and compromise the reliability of glucose testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingers with moisturizing cream can contaminate the blood sample and compromise the reliability of glucose testing.</data>
