  <data key="d2">Deteriorated test strips are compromised in quality and may produce inaccurate blood glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Deteriorated test strips are compromised in quality and may produce inaccurate blood glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Deteriorated test strips are compromised in quality and may produce inaccurate blood glucose readings.</data>
