  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An incorrect or improper test strip code can lead to errors in blood glucose measurement due to device misconfiguration.&lt;SEP&gt;An incorrect or improper test strip code can lead to errors in blood glucose measurement due to device misconfiguration.&lt;SEP&gt;An incorrect or improper test strip code can lead to errors in blood glucose measurement due to device misconfiguration.</data>
