  <data key="d2">Environmental conditions include factors such as altitude, temperature, and oxygen levels that may influence glucose test accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental conditions include factors such as altitude, temperature, and oxygen levels that may influence glucose test accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental conditions include factors such as altitude, temperature, and oxygen levels that may influence glucose test accuracy.</data>
