  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High partial pressure of oxygen may interfere with certain types of glucose monitoring devices.&lt;SEP&gt;High partial pressure of oxygen may interfere with certain types of glucose monitoring devices.&lt;SEP&gt;High partial pressure of oxygen may interfere with certain types of glucose monitoring devices.</data>
