  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low partial pressure of oxygen can affect tissue oxygenation and glucose readings, especially in specific device technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Low partial pressure of oxygen can affect tissue oxygenation and glucose readings, especially in specific device technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Low partial pressure of oxygen can affect tissue oxygenation and glucose readings, especially in specific device technologies.</data>
