  <data key="d0">Temperature Extremes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extreme temperatures, both high and low, can damage test strips and affect the performance of glucose meters.&lt;SEP&gt;Extreme temperatures, both high and low, can damage test strips and affect the performance of glucose meters.&lt;SEP&gt;Extreme temperatures, both high and low, can damage test strips and affect the performance of glucose meters.</data>
