  <data key="d0">Low Temperatures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low temperatures (&lt;10°C) can impair the chemical reactions on test strips, leading to inaccurate glucose results.&lt;SEP&gt;Low temperatures (&lt;10°C) can impair the chemical reactions on test strips, leading to inaccurate glucose results.&lt;SEP&gt;Low temperatures (&lt;10°C) can impair the chemical reactions on test strips, leading to inaccurate glucose results.</data>
