  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A sudden rise in ambient temperature can affect the stability of test strips and glucose meter operation.&lt;SEP&gt;A sudden rise in ambient temperature can affect the stability of test strips and glucose meter operation.&lt;SEP&gt;A sudden rise in ambient temperature can affect the stability of test strips and glucose meter operation.</data>
