  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High temperatures (&gt;39°C) can degrade test strips and compromise the accuracy of blood glucose testing.&lt;SEP&gt;High temperatures (&gt;39°C) can degrade test strips and compromise the accuracy of blood glucose testing.&lt;SEP&gt;High temperatures (&gt;39°C) can degrade test strips and compromise the accuracy of blood glucose testing.</data>
