  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Physiological and medication conditions encompass various health and drug-related factors that may influence glucose test outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Physiological and medication conditions encompass various health and drug-related factors that may influence glucose test outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Physiological and medication conditions encompass various health and drug-related factors that may influence glucose test outcomes.</data>
