  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Laboratory values such as hematocrit and lipid levels can impact the accuracy of blood glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory values such as hematocrit and lipid levels can impact the accuracy of blood glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory values such as hematocrit and lipid levels can impact the accuracy of blood glucose measurements.</data>
