  <data key="d0">High Hematocrit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High hematocrit (&gt;45%) may lead to altered glucose readings due to changes in blood viscosity and oxygen transport.&lt;SEP&gt;High hematocrit (&gt;45%) may lead to altered glucose readings due to changes in blood viscosity and oxygen transport.&lt;SEP&gt;High hematocrit (&gt;45%) may lead to altered glucose readings due to changes in blood viscosity and oxygen transport.</data>
