  <data key="d0">Low Hematocrit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low hematocrit (&lt;35%) may affect glucose measurement accuracy, particularly in devices sensitive to blood composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Low hematocrit (&lt;35%) may affect glucose measurement accuracy, particularly in devices sensitive to blood composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Low hematocrit (&lt;35%) may affect glucose measurement accuracy, particularly in devices sensitive to blood composition.</data>
