  <data key="d0">Poor Perfusion At Test Site</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Poor perfusion at the test site reduces blood flow and may lead to inaccurate or delayed glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Poor perfusion at the test site reduces blood flow and may lead to inaccurate or delayed glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Poor perfusion at the test site reduces blood flow and may lead to inaccurate or delayed glucose readings.</data>
