  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medications such as ascorbic acid and paracetamol can interfere with glucose test results depending on the device technology used.&lt;SEP&gt;Medications such as ascorbic acid and paracetamol can interfere with glucose test results depending on the device technology used.&lt;SEP&gt;Medications such as ascorbic acid and paracetamol can interfere with glucose test results depending on the device technology used.</data>
