  <data key="d0">Paracetamol</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Paracetamol (acetaminophen) may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Paracetamol (acetaminophen) may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Paracetamol (acetaminophen) may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme technologies.</data>
