  <data key="d0">Maltose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Maltose can interfere with glucose readings in devices based on GDH-PQQ enzyme technology, causing falsely elevated results.&lt;SEP&gt;Maltose can interfere with glucose readings in devices based on GDH-PQQ enzyme technology, causing falsely elevated results.&lt;SEP&gt;Maltose can interfere with glucose readings in devices based on GDH-PQQ enzyme technology, causing falsely elevated results.</data>
