  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose oxidase-based devices are a type of glucose meter technology that is not affected by maltose interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase-based devices are a type of glucose meter technology that is not affected by maltose interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase-based devices are a type of glucose meter technology that is not affected by maltose interference.</data>
