  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The LO message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels below 20–10 mg/dL, depending on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;The LO message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels below 20–10 mg/dL, depending on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;The LO message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels below 20–10 mg/dL, depending on the device.</data>
