  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The HI message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels above 500–600 mg/dL, depending on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;The HI message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels above 500–600 mg/dL, depending on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;The HI message on a glucometer indicates blood glucose levels above 500–600 mg/dL, depending on the device.</data>
