  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Error messages on a glucometer require consultation of the instruction manual for proper interpretation and resolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Error messages on a glucometer require consultation of the instruction manual for proper interpretation and resolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Error messages on a glucometer require consultation of the instruction manual for proper interpretation and resolution.</data>
