  <data key="d0">Support Network</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The support network includes family and caregivers who assist the person with diabetes in managing their condition.&lt;SEP&gt;The support network includes family and caregivers who assist the person with diabetes in managing their condition.&lt;SEP&gt;The support network includes family and caregivers who assist the person with diabetes in managing their condition.</data>
