  <data key="d0">Collection Point</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A collection point is a designated facility, such as a health unit or pharmacy, where filled sharps containers are safely disposed of.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection point is a designated facility, such as a health unit or pharmacy, where filled sharps containers are safely disposed of.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection point is a designated facility, such as a health unit or pharmacy, where filled sharps containers are safely disposed of.</data>
