<node id="Storage Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Storage Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage conditions include keeping the glucometer and test strips in a dry place, away from dust, moisture, and temperature extremes.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage conditions include keeping the glucometer and test strips in a dry place, away from dust, moisture, and temperature extremes.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage conditions include keeping the glucometer and test strips in a dry place, away from dust, moisture, and temperature extremes.</data>
