<node id="Cleaning">
  <data key="d0">Cleaning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cleaning of the glucometer should be done with a slightly damp cloth or cotton swab using cold water, as per the instruction manual.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning of the glucometer should be done with a slightly damp cloth or cotton swab using cold water, as per the instruction manual.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning of the glucometer should be done with a slightly damp cloth or cotton swab using cold water, as per the instruction manual.</data>
