</node>
<node id="GDH-PQQ Devices">
  <data key="d0">GDH-PQQ Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GDH-PQQ devices are glucose monitoring systems based on the glucose dehydrogenase-PQQ enzyme technology, which can be interfered with by substances like maltose.&lt;SEP&gt;GDH-PQQ devices are glucose monitoring systems based on the glucose dehydrogenase-PQQ enzyme technology, which can be interfered with by substances like maltose.&lt;SEP&gt;GDH-PQQ devices are glucose monitoring systems based on the glucose dehydrogenase-PQQ enzyme technology, which can be interfered with by substances like maltose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f2616cb245736f951a3dcbf261b3b9b</data>
