<node id="Point-Of-Care Glucometer Configuration">
  <data key="d0">Point-Of-Care Glucometer Configuration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Point-of-care glucometer configuration refers to the setup and calibration of glucose meters at the site of patient care to reduce treatment errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Point-of-care glucometer configuration refers to the setup and calibration of glucose meters at the site of patient care to reduce treatment errors.</data>
