<node id="Glucose Biosensors">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Biosensors</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose biosensors are devices used to detect glucose levels in clinical practice, providing real-time monitoring for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose biosensors are devices used to detect glucose levels in clinical practice, providing real-time monitoring for diabetes management.</data>
