  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection safety refers to the set of guidelines and practices designed to ensure safe administration of injections, as recommended by the WISE Consensus Group.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection safety refers to the set of guidelines and practices designed to ensure safe administration of injections, as recommended by the WISE Consensus Group.</data>
