</node>
<node id="Cardiovascular Risk Factors">
  <data key="d0">Cardiovascular Risk Factors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cardiovascular risk factors include hypertension, dyslipidemia, and obesity, and should be screened for in individuals with prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cardiovascular risk factors are conditions such as hypertension and dyslipidemia that increase the risk of cardiovascular disease, often managed alongside diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cardiovascular risk factors include hypertension, dyslipidemia, and obesity, and should be screened for in individuals with prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cardiovascular risk factors are conditions such as hypertension and dyslipidemia that increase the risk of cardiovascular disease, often managed alongside diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cc7d59e52d23bbcf0d499f8423581f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8317327cb2c248762b2dc3852c662000</data>
