</node>
<node id="Overweight">
  <data key="d0">Overweight</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Overweight in children is defined as BMI at or above the 85th percentile, and is a risk factor for type 2 diabetes when combined with other factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight is a weight category that contributes to insulin resistance and is a risk factor for type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight is a condition of excess body weight, often associated with insulin resistance and increased risk of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight in children is defined as BMI at or above the 85th percentile, and is a risk factor for type 2 diabetes when combined with other factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight is a weight category that contributes to insulin resistance and is a risk factor for type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight is a condition of excess body weight, often associated with insulin resistance and increased risk of type 2 diabetes.</data>
