<node id="Small-For-Gestational-Age Birth Weight">
  <data key="d0">Small-For-Gestational-Age Birth Weight</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Small-for-gestational-age birth weight is a condition associated with insulin resistance and increased risk for type 2 diabetes later in life.&lt;SEP&gt;Small-for-gestational-age birth weight is a condition associated with insulin resistance and increased risk for type 2 diabetes later in life.</data>
