</node>
<node id="Beta-Cell Insulin Secretion">
  <data key="d0">Beta-Cell Insulin Secretion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Beta-cell insulin secretion is a physiological process that is impaired in type 2 diabetes and central to the pathophysiology of the disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta-cell insulin secretion is a physiological process that is impaired in type 2 diabetes and central to the pathophysiology of the disease.</data>
