<node id="Metabolic Genetics">
  <data key="d0">Metabolic Genetics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolic genetics refers to genetic factors influencing metabolism and are implicated in the development of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic genetics refers to genetic factors influencing metabolism and are implicated in the development of type 2 diabetes.</data>
