<node id="Diagnostic Tests For Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Diagnostic Tests For Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Diagnostic tests for diabetes include fasting plasma glucose, 2-hour plasma glucose during oral glucose tolerance test, and A1C criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic tests for diabetes include fasting plasma glucose, 2-hour plasma glucose during oral glucose tolerance test, and A1C criteria.</data>
