</node>
<node id="Racial And Ethnic Disparities">
  <data key="d0">Racial And Ethnic Disparities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Racial and ethnic disparities exist in the prevalence of undiagnosed diabetes, highlighting the importance of early screening to identify and address inequities in health outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Racial and ethnic disparities exist in the prevalence of undiagnosed diabetes, highlighting the importance of early screening to identify and address inequities in health outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6b2f90b1ec83426a0df84d7693bc26d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
