  <data key="d2">Forkhead box protein 3 is a regulatory protein involved in immune system function, encoded by the FOXP3 gene.&lt;SEP&gt;Forkhead box protein 3 is a regulatory protein involved in immune system function, encoded by the FOXP3 gene.</data>
