<node id="AIRE Gene">
  <data key="d0">AIRE Gene</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The AIRE gene is associated with autoimmune regulation, and its mutation can lead to autoimmune disorders.&lt;SEP&gt;The AIRE gene, when mutated, causes autoimmune polyendocrinopathy and is linked to type 1 diabetes and other autoimmune conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The AIRE gene is associated with autoimmune regulation, and its mutation can lead to autoimmune disorders.&lt;SEP&gt;The AIRE gene, when mutated, causes autoimmune polyendocrinopathy and is linked to type 1 diabetes and other autoimmune conditions.</data>
