  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Idiopathic type 1 diabetes is a form of type 1 diabetes with permanent insulin deficiency but no evidence of beta-cell autoimmunity.&lt;SEP&gt;Idiopathic type 1 diabetes is a form of type 1 diabetes with permanent insulin deficiency but no evidence of beta-cell autoimmunity.</data>
