  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ketosis-prone diabetes is a variant seen in individuals of African or Asian ancestry, characterized by episodic DKA and variable insulin deficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketosis-prone diabetes is a variant seen in individuals of African or Asian ancestry, characterized by episodic DKA and variable insulin deficiency.</data>
