  <data key="d2">Insulin replacement therapy is required for individuals with type 1 diabetes, though it may be intermittent in idiopathic cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin replacement therapy is required for individuals with type 1 diabetes, though it may be intermittent in idiopathic cases.</data>
