<node id="Post-Transplantation Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Post-Transplantation Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Post-transplantation diabetes mellitus is a metabolic complication that can occur after organ transplantation, particularly in renal transplant recipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Post-transplantation diabetes mellitus is a metabolic complication that can occur after organ transplantation, particularly in renal transplant recipients.</data>
