  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Allograft rejection is an immune response against a transplanted organ, which may be influenced by early peri-operative glycaemic control in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Allograft rejection is an immune response against a transplanted organ, which may be influenced by early peri-operative glycaemic control in diabetic patients.</data>
