</node>
<node id="Glutamic Acid Decarboxylase">
  <data key="d0">Glutamic Acid Decarboxylase</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glutamic acid decarboxylase (GAD) is a pancreatic enzyme targeted by autoantibodies in type 1 diabetes, serving as an autoimmune marker.&lt;SEP&gt;Glutamic acid decarboxylase (GAD) is a pancreatic enzyme targeted by autoantibodies in type 1 diabetes, serving as an autoimmune marker.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e</data>
