<node id="Islet Antigen 2">
  <data key="d0">Islet Antigen 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Islet antigen 2 (IA-2) is a tyrosine phosphatase targeted by autoantibodies and used as a marker for autoimmune diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet antigen 2 (IA-2) is a tyrosine phosphatase targeted by autoantibodies and used as a marker for autoimmune diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e</data>
