</node>
<node id="Zinc Transporter 8">
  <data key="d0">Zinc Transporter 8</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Zinc transporter 8 is a protein in pancreatic beta cells that is targeted by autoantibodies and serves as a biomarker for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Zinc transporter 8 is a protein in pancreatic beta cells that is targeted by autoantibodies and serves as a biomarker for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647374</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pancreatic Beta Cells">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic Beta Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic beta cells are destroyed in type 1 diabetes due to autoimmune processes, leading to insulin deficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic beta cells are responsible for insulin secretion, and their residual function can be assessed via C-peptide levels in diabetes classification.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic beta cells are destroyed in type 1 diabetes due to autoimmune processes, leading to insulin deficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f87c8aceb9340a61d8283da6282edc</data>
