  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Immune dysregulation refers to malfunctioning immune responses seen in syndromes like IPEX and AIRE-related disorders associated with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune dysregulation refers to malfunctioning immune responses seen in syndromes like IPEX and AIRE-related disorders associated with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-620e2d1316d6093170f1c9991caabc7e</data>
