  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hashimoto thyroiditis is an autoimmune disorder commonly associated with type 1 diabetes, affecting the thyroid gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Hashimoto thyroiditis is an autoimmune disorder commonly associated with type 1 diabetes, affecting the thyroid gland.</data>
