  <data key="d0">Graves Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Graves disease is an autoimmune condition linked to type 1 diabetes, characterized by hyperthyroidism.&lt;SEP&gt;Graves disease is an autoimmune condition linked to type 1 diabetes, characterized by hyperthyroidism.</data>
