<node id="Addison Disease">
  <data key="d0">Addison Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Addison disease is an autoimmune adrenal insufficiency disorder that can co-occur with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Addison disease is an autoimmune adrenal insufficiency disorder that can co-occur with type 1 diabetes.</data>
