  <data key="d0">Autoimmune Hepatitis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoimmune hepatitis is a liver disorder linked to type 1 diabetes, involving immune-mediated liver inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune hepatitis is a liver disorder linked to type 1 diabetes, involving immune-mediated liver inflammation.</data>
