  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Myasthenia gravis is a neuromuscular autoimmune disorder associated with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Myasthenia gravis is a neuromuscular autoimmune disorder associated with type 1 diabetes.</data>
