  <data key="d0">Pernicious Anemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pernicious anemia is an autoimmune condition affecting vitamin B12 absorption and linked to type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Pernicious anemia is an autoimmune condition affecting vitamin B12 absorption and linked to type 1 diabetes.</data>
