  <data key="d0">Immunotherapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Immunotherapy refers to treatments that modulate the immune system, including checkpoint inhibitors, being studied in autoimmune diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy refers to treatments that modulate the immune system, including checkpoint inhibitors, being studied in autoimmune diabetes.</data>
