  <data key="d0">Plasma C-Peptide</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Plasma C-peptide levels are used to assess residual beta-cell function, with low or undetectable levels indicating advanced type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasma C-peptide levels are used to assess residual beta-cell function, with low or undetectable levels indicating advanced type 1 diabetes.</data>
