  <data key="d0">Care Journal</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Care Journal is a publication that features clinical recommendations and research on diabetes, including type 1 diabetes screening and management.&lt;SEP&gt;Care Journal is a publication that features clinical recommendations and research on diabetes, including type 1 diabetes screening and management.</data>
