<node id="Fructosamine">
  <data key="d0">Fructosamine</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Fructosamine is a glycated protein that reflects average blood glucose levels over a shorter period than A1C and may be used as an alternative marker in certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fructosamine is a glycated protein used to assess intermediate-term glycemic control and may be elevated in African American individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Fructosamine is a glycated protein that reflects average blood glucose levels over a shorter period than A1C and may be used as an alternative marker in certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fructosamine is a glycated protein used to assess intermediate-term glycemic control and may be elevated in African American individuals.</data>
