  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycated Albumin">
  <data key="d0">Glycated Albumin</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycated albumin is a measure of glucose-bound albumin in the blood, used as an alternative glycemic marker, particularly when A1C is unreliable.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycated albumin is a marker of short- to intermediate-term blood glucose levels and may be higher in African American individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycated albumin is a measure of glucose-bound albumin in the blood, used as an alternative glycemic marker, particularly when A1C is unreliable.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycated albumin is a marker of short- to intermediate-term blood glucose levels and may be higher in African American individuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146b6bf0e9a99df13de25f5e1318178a</data>
