  <data key="d0">Afro-Caribbean People</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Afro-Caribbean people are a population group in which a recent report showed lower A1C levels than predicted by glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Afro-Caribbean people are a population group in which a recent report showed lower A1C levels than predicted by glucose levels.</data>
