<node id="African American">
  <data key="d0">African American</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">African American individuals may exhibit higher levels of certain glycemic markers and potentially higher postprandial glycemic burden.&lt;SEP&gt;African American individuals may exhibit higher levels of certain glycemic markers and potentially higher postprandial glycemic burden.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86</data>
