  <data key="d0">Non-Hispanic White</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-Hispanic White populations are referenced in studies comparing A1C associations with diabetes complications to African American populations.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Hispanic White populations are referenced in studies comparing A1C associations with diabetes complications to African American populations.</data>
