  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose-6-Phosphate Dehydrogenase Deficiency">
  <data key="d0">Glucose-6-Phosphate Dehydrogenase Deficiency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a genetic condition that may alter the relationship between A1C and glycemia, affecting test reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a condition causing increased red blood cell turnover, affecting A1C accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a genetic disorder that affects red blood cells and may influence HbA1c accuracy in diabetes diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a genetic condition that may alter the relationship between A1C and glycemia, affecting test reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a condition causing increased red blood cell turnover, affecting A1C accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is a genetic disorder that affects red blood cells and may influence HbA1c accuracy in diabetes diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5fc9e82121669cb9d4aff08c8c9019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050dc3a498d3027939b93706cbdb7f07</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647312</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hemodialysis">
  <data key="d0">Hemodialysis</data>
  <data key="d1">procedure</data>
  <data key="d2">Hemodialysis is a medical procedure that can affect hemoglobin glycation independently of blood glucose levels, potentially impacting A1C accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemodialysis is a medical treatment that can affect red blood cell turnover and interfere with A1C test interpretation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemodialysis is a treatment that alters red blood cell lifespan and thus affects the relationship between A1C and glycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemodialysis is a medical procedure that can affect hemoglobin glycation independently of blood glucose levels, potentially impacting A1C accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemodialysis is a medical treatment that can affect red blood cell turnover and interfere with A1C test interpretation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemodialysis is a treatment that alters red blood cell lifespan and thus affects the relationship between A1C and glycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5fc9e82121669cb9d4aff08c8c9019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146b6bf0e9a99df13de25f5e1318178a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647312</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Loss">
  <data key="d0">Blood Loss</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Recent blood loss affects red blood cell turnover and compromises the reliability of A1C as a diagnostic tool.&lt;SEP&gt;Recent blood loss affects red blood cell turnover and compromises the reliability of A1C as a diagnostic tool.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647419</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Transfusion">
  <data key="d0">Blood Transfusion</data>
  <data key="d1">procedure</data>
  <data key="d2">Recent blood loss or transfusion can alter A1C results due to changes in red blood cell age and lifespan, necessitating alternative diagnostic methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Recent blood transfusion alters red blood cell composition and invalidates A1C as a reliable glycemic indicator.&lt;SEP&gt;Recent blood loss or transfusion can alter A1C results due to changes in red blood cell age and lifespan, necessitating alternative diagnostic methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Recent blood transfusion alters red blood cell composition and invalidates A1C as a reliable glycemic indicator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5fc9e82121669cb9d4aff08c8c9019</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647313</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Erythropoietin Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Erythropoietin Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">treatment</data>
  <data key="d2">Erythropoietin therapy affects red blood cell production and can interfere with A1C test accuracy, requiring reliance on plasma glucose criteria for diabetes diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythropoietin therapy stimulates red blood cell production, affecting A1C levels and its correlation with blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythropoietin therapy affects red blood cell production and can interfere with A1C test accuracy, requiring reliance on plasma glucose criteria for diabetes diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythropoietin therapy stimulates red blood cell production, affecting A1C levels and its correlation with blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5fc9e82121669cb9d4aff08c8c9019</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647313</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Postpartum State">
  <data key="d0">Postpartum State</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">The postpartum state is a physiological condition where A1C is less reliable than direct blood glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The postpartum state is a physiological condition where A1C is less reliable than direct blood glucose measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647419</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Iron-Deficient Anemia">
  <data key="d0">Iron-Deficient Anemia</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Iron-deficient anemia is a condition where A1C levels may not accurately reflect glycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron-deficient anemia is a condition where A1C levels may not accurately reflect glycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20b3e88dda40e2d303af38aea0d19b86</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
