</node>
<node id="Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1 is a specific issue of the journal published in January 2023 containing clinical guidelines and research on diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1 is a specific issue of the journal published in January 2023 containing clinical guidelines and research on diabetes care.</data>
