</node>
<node id="European Cystic Fibrosis Society Patient Registry">
  <data key="d0">European Cystic Fibrosis Society Patient Registry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Cystic Fibrosis Society Patient Registry reported increasing prevalence of cystic fibrosis–related diabetes with age and other risk factors such as genotype and decreased lung function.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Cystic Fibrosis Society Patient Registry reported increasing prevalence of cystic fibrosis–related diabetes with age and other risk factors such as genotype and decreased lung function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c53f409a49620f4d40ad687bd0c0df19</data>
