  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Random Blood Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Random blood glucose is a testing method mentioned in the context of screening, though not recommended as the primary method for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Random blood glucose testing was used in a study of dental patients in India to identify cases of prediabetes and diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Random blood glucose is a testing method mentioned in the context of screening, though not recommended as the primary method for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Random blood glucose testing was used in a study of dental patients in India to identify cases of prediabetes and diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c53f409a49620f4d40ad687bd0c0df19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9c311fc732ddd262c56ddc696da954</data>
