</node>
<node id="Recommendation 2.16">
  <data key="d0">Recommendation 2.16</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommendation 2.16 states that annual screening for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes using an oral glucose tolerance test should begin by age 10 in all people with cystic fibrosis not previously diagnosed.&lt;SEP&gt;Recommendation 2.16 states that annual screening for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes with an oral glucose tolerance test should begin by age 10 in all people with cystic fibrosis not previously diagnosed.&lt;SEP&gt;Recommendation 2.16 states that annual screening for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes using an oral glucose tolerance test should begin by age 10 in all people with cystic fibrosis not previously diagnosed.&lt;SEP&gt;Recommendation 2.16 states that annual screening for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes with an oral glucose tolerance test should begin by age 10 in all people with cystic fibrosis not previously diagnosed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c53f409a49620f4d40ad687bd0c0df19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9c311fc732ddd262c56ddc696da954</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647322</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recommendation 2.17">
  <data key="d0">Recommendation 2.17</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommendation 2.17 specifies that A1C is not recommended as a screening test for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes and that insulin therapy should be used to achieve individualized glycemic goals, with annual monitoring for diabetes complications beginning five years after diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Recommendation 2.17 specifies that A1C is not recommended as a screening test for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes and that insulin therapy should be used to achieve individualized glycemic goals, with annual monitoring for diabetes complications beginning five years after diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c53f409a49620f4d40ad687bd0c0df19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647322</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
