<node id="Screening For Gestational Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Screening For Gestational Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Screening for gestational diabetes involves diagnostic tests to identify glucose intolerance during pregnancy, using criteria such as one-step or two-step testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Screening for gestational diabetes involves diagnostic tests to identify glucose intolerance during pregnancy, using criteria such as one-step or two-step testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647389</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="One-Step Testing">
  <data key="d0">One-Step Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">One-step testing is a diagnostic approach for gestational diabetes that uses a single oral glucose tolerance test to confirm the condition.&lt;SEP&gt;One-step testing is a diagnostic approach for gestational diabetes that uses a single oral glucose tolerance test to confirm the condition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647389</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Two-Step Testing">
  <data key="d0">Two-Step Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-step testing is a diagnostic method for gestational diabetes involving an initial glucose challenge test followed by a confirmatory glucose tolerance test.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-step testing is a diagnostic method for gestational diabetes involving an initial glucose challenge test followed by a confirmatory glucose tolerance test.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647389</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycosylated Haemoglobin">
  <data key="d0">Glycosylated Haemoglobin</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycosylated haemoglobin (HbA1c) is a blood test used to assess average blood glucose levels and has been evaluated for screening gestational diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycosylated haemoglobin (HbA1c) is a blood test used to assess average blood glucose levels and has been evaluated for screening gestational diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647389</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treatment Of Gestational Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Treatment Of Gestational Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Treatment of gestational diabetes includes dietary management, glucose monitoring, and insulin therapy to improve maternal and fetal outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment of gestational diabetes includes dietary management, glucose monitoring, and insulin therapy to improve maternal and fetal outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647389</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes In America">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes In America</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes in America is a comprehensive publication by the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases that provides data and analysis on diabetes and related conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes in America is a comprehensive publication by the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases that provides data and analysis on diabetes and related conditions.</data>
