<node id="Challenges In The Classification And Management Of Asian Youth-Onset Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Challenges In The Classification And Management Of Asian Youth-Onset Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This is a research study discussing challenges in classifying and managing diabetes in young Asian populations, published in PLoS One in 2019.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c156c40ae38c1b220a3c59d658c17171</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
