  <data key="d0">Definition, Classification And Diagnosis Of Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This is a research article published in Exp Clin Endocrinol Diabetes in 2019, discussing the definition, classification, and diagnosis of diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c156c40ae38c1b220a3c59d658c17171</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
