</node>
<node id="Endocrine Reviews">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine Reviews</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrine Reviews is a journal publishing review articles on endocrine syndromes, including ketosis-prone diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Reviews is a scientific journal that published a review on ketosis-prone diabetes mellitus in 2008.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Reviews publishes comprehensive reviews on endocrine syndromes, including ketosis-prone diabetes mellitus.</data>
