<node id="Consortium for the Study of Chronic Pancreatitis, Diabetes, and Pancreatic Cancer">
  <data key="d0">Consortium for the Study of Chronic Pancreatitis, Diabetes, and Pancreatic Cancer</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Consortium for the Study of Chronic Pancreatitis, Diabetes, and Pancreatic Cancer (CPDPC) is a research group focused on understanding the links between chronic pancreatitis, diabetes, and pancreatic cancer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776646972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Type 3c Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Type 3c Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 3c Diabetes Mellitus, also known as pancreatogenic diabetes, is caused by diseases of the exocrine pancreas such as chronic pancreatitis or pancreatic cancer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776646972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chronic Pancreatitis">
  <data key="d0">Chronic Pancreatitis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chronic pancreatitis is a long-standing inflammation of the pancreas that can lead to type 3c diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-term inflammatory disease of the pancreas that can lead to type 3c diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f780163f31c33c2bd7449fb5a87b42ee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647324</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pancreatic Cancer">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic Cancer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic cancer is a malignant condition of the pancreas that can result in type 3c diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;A malignant condition of the pancreas associated with diabetes and pancreatogenic diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f780163f31c33c2bd7449fb5a87b42ee</data>
