<node id="Clinical Approach to Detection of Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Approach to Detection of Lipodystrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The clinical approach to the detection of lipodystrophy involves physical examination, metabolic evaluation, and recognition of characteristic features.</data>
