  <data key="d0">Clinical Features of Acquired Partial Lipodystrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical features of acquired partial lipodystrophy include loss of subcutaneous fat, metabolic abnormalities, and autoimmune associations.</data>
