<node id="Body Composition Study by Dual-Energy X-Ray Absorptiometry">
  <data key="d0">Body Composition Study by Dual-Energy X-Ray Absorptiometry</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Body composition study by dual-energy x-ray absorptiometry (DXA) is a technique used to assess fat, lean, and bone mass in patients with lipodystrophy.</data>
