<node id="Adult-Onset Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Adult-Onset Type 1 Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adult-onset type 1 diabetes is a form of autoimmune diabetes that develops in adulthood, often with distinct clinical features from childhood-onset type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccde7bd12284b1c344a961b0f935b651</data>
