  <data key="d0">18–50 Years</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">18–50 years is the age range of adults studied for identifying type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb204c2d596853e5abff6c8dd0938ff</data>
