  <data key="d0">Figure 2.1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 2.1 is a visual representation of the ADA risk test, referenced as part of the diabetes risk assessment material.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 2.1 is a visual representation of the ADA risk test used to assess the risk of prediabetes and type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a51a13b6846af5dd45aca8b13432e7fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4f56a727625747d95bd88ea9712defc</data>
