<node id="National Diabetes Data Group">
  <data key="d0">National Diabetes Data Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Diabetes Data Group established a set of higher diagnostic thresholds for the 3-hour 100-g OGTT used in the two-step approach to diagnose GDM.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Diabetes Data Group established early classification and diagnostic criteria for diabetes and glucose intolerance.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Diabetes Data Group (NDDG) previously recommended intermediate glucose measurements during OGTT but later abandoned them due to impracticality and focus on the 2-hour measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Diabetes Data Group (NDDG) previously recommended intermediate glucose measurements during OGTT but later abandoned them due to impracticality and focus on the 2-hour measurement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7869f89a9c58ace31efe679a36aab7cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564f10440969233a515af4974c158c4b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diagnosing Gestational Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Diagnosing Gestational Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diagnosing gestational diabetes refers to the clinical process of identifying glucose intolerance during pregnancy using standardized criteria and tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776647400</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Institute Of Diabetes And Digestive And Kidney Diseases">
  <data key="d0">National Institute Of Diabetes And Digestive And Kidney Diseases</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases is the publisher of the "Diabetes in America" report and supports research on diabetes and related conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45a8ca206e61b47964f899c929fbafb3</data>
