  <data key="d0">Autoantibody Risk Score</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The autoantibody risk score is a method used to predict type 1 diabetes by incorporating multiple autoantibody levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The autoantibody risk score is a method used to predict the likelihood of developing type 1 diabetes based on multiple autoantibody levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-05070e0755e36e3375d401400cf75fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a109575f50250430ade32316446ee9</data>
