  <data key="d0">Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism publishes clinical research on endocrine disorders, including autoimmune polyendocrinopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism published studies on glycemic predictors and HbA1c levels in relation to diabetes and pregnancy outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fab467dd1cac7fbb17a945a0aa8240f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0510d1781e9c07bebd7a7422d453cbf2</data>
