</node>
<node id="PLoS One">
  <data key="d0">PLoS One</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PLoS One is a journal that published a cross-sectional study on the influence of hemoglobinopathies and glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency on diabetes diagnosis using HbA1c among Tanzanian adults.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is an open-access journal that published a systematic review and meta-analysis on the effectiveness of pre-pregnancy care for women with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is an open-access scientific journal that published a meta-analysis on diagnostic accuracy for diabetes and prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is an open-access scientific journal that published a meta-analysis on diagnostic accuracy for diabetes and prediabetes.</data>
