  <data key="d2">Colorado is a U.S. state where a study on diabetic ketoacidosis at diagnosis of type 1 diabetes in children was conducted between 2010 and 2017.&lt;SEP&gt;Colorado is a U.S. state where a large-scale screening program for type 1 diabetes was evaluated for cost and cost-effectiveness.</data>
