  <data key="d0">SEARCH for Diabetes in Youth Study</data>
  <data key="d1">study</data>
  <data key="d2">The SEARCH for Diabetes in Youth Study is a research initiative that found an increasing prevalence of diabetic ketoacidosis at diagnosis among youth with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The SEARCH for Diabetes in Youth Study investigates the prevalence and trends of diabetes among children and adolescents in the United States.</data>
