  <data key="d2">The Finnish Diabetes Prevention Study Group conducted a study showing that lifestyle changes can prevent type 2 diabetes in individuals with impaired glucose tolerance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Finnish Diabetes Prevention Study Group conducted research on preventing type 2 diabetes through lifestyle changes in individuals with impaired glucose tolerance.</data>
