  <data key="d2">Int J Environ Res Public Health is a journal that published a study on hemoglobin A1c levels associated with age and gender in Taiwanese adults without prior diabetes diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Int J Environ Res Public Health is a journal publishing research on public health, including diabetes diagnosis in population studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Int J Environ Res Public Health is a scientific journal that published research on diabetes in populations.&lt;SEP&gt;Int J Environ Res Public Health is a journal publishing research on public health, including diabetes diagnosis in population studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Int J Environ Res Public Health is a scientific journal that published research on diabetes in populations.</data>
