  <data key="d2">Future classification schemes for diabetes are expected to center on the pathophysiology of beta-cell dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;β-cell dysfunction refers to impaired insulin secretion, detectable via one-hour plasma glucose levels in metabolic studies.&lt;SEP&gt;β-cell dysfunction refers to impaired insulin secretion, detectable via one-hour plasma glucose levels in metabolic studies.</data>
