  <data key="d0">New England Journal of Medicine</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The New England Journal of Medicine is a leading medical journal that published research on teplizumab and type 1 diabetes prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;The New England Journal of Medicine is a leading medical journal that published research on teplizumab and type 1 diabetes prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;The New England Journal of Medicine is a leading medical journal that published research on teplizumab and type 1 diabetes prevention.</data>
