  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose intolerance is a metabolic state characterized by elevated blood glucose levels after glucose challenge, typically detected by TTGO-2h.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose intolerance is a metabolic state characterized by elevated blood glucose levels after glucose challenge, typically detected by TTGO-2h.</data>
