  <data key="d2">Glicemia ao Acaso is a random blood glucose test used for diagnosing Diabetes Mellitus when symptoms are present.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia ao Acaso is a random blood glucose test used for diagnosing Diabetes Mellitus when symptoms are present.</data>
