  <data key="d2">Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral (TTGO) is a diagnostic method involving glucose ingestion and subsequent blood glucose measurements at 1 and 2 hours.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral (TTGO) is a diagnostic method involving glucose ingestion and subsequent blood glucose measurements at 1 and 2 hours.</data>
