  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hiperglicemia Intermediária is a prediabetic state defined by the International Diabetes Federation, characterized by mild hyperglycemia not meeting full diabetes criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Hiperglicemia Intermediária is a prediabetic state defined by the International Diabetes Federation, characterized by mild hyperglycemia not meeting full diabetes criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Hiperglicemia Intermediária is a prediabetic state defined by the International Diabetes Federation, characterized by mild hyperglycemia not meeting full diabetes criteria.</data>
