</node>
<node id="Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities">
  <data key="d0">Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities (ARIC) study followed 12,268 participants over 25 years to evaluate diabetes incidence and found that combined abnormal fasting glucose and HbA1c had high specificity and predictive value for clinical outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities (ARIC) study followed 12,268 participants over 25 years to evaluate diabetes incidence and found that combined abnormal fasting glucose and HbA1c had high specificity and predictive value for clinical outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-564f10440969233a515af4974c158c4b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
