<node id="Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus refers to the clinical guidelines and diagnostic criteria for identifying diabetes mellitus, as discussed in the Brazilian Diabetes Society guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus refers to the section or chapter title on the diagnosis of diabetes mellitus in the Brazilian Diabetes Society guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus refers to the clinical guidelines and diagnostic criteria for identifying diabetes mellitus, as discussed in the Brazilian Diabetes Society guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus refers to the section or chapter title on the diagnosis of diabetes mellitus in the Brazilian Diabetes Society guidelines.</data>
