<node id="Type 2 Diabetes Screening">
  <data key="d0">Type 2 Diabetes Screening</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 2 Diabetes Screening is recommended in children and adolescents with overweight or obesity and additional risk factors, starting at age 10 or after puberty onset.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 2 Diabetes Screening is recommended in children and adolescents with overweight or obesity and additional risk factors, starting at age 10 or after puberty onset.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 2 Diabetes Screening is recommended in children and adolescents with overweight or obesity and additional risk factors, starting at age 10 or after puberty onset.</data>
