<node id="HbA1c Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">HbA1c Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">HbA1c Monitoring is used to detect glucocorticoid-induced diabetes by tracking long-term blood glucose levels, with HbA1c ≥ 6% indicating higher risk.&lt;SEP&gt;HbA1c Monitoring is used to detect glucocorticoid-induced diabetes by tracking long-term blood glucose levels, with HbA1c ≥ 6% indicating higher risk.&lt;SEP&gt;HbA1c Monitoring is used to detect glucocorticoid-induced diabetes by tracking long-term blood glucose levels, with HbA1c ≥ 6% indicating higher risk.</data>
