</node>
<node id="Prevalence Of Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Prevalence Of Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The prevalence of type 2 diabetes in youth increased from 0.34 per 1,000 in 2001 to 0.46 per 1,000 in 2009 in the U.S., with higher rates among Hispanic, Black, and Native American populations.&lt;SEP&gt;The prevalence of type 2 diabetes in youth increased from 0.34 per 1,000 in 2001 to 0.46 per 1,000 in 2009 in the U.S., with higher rates among Hispanic, Black, and Native American populations.&lt;SEP&gt;The prevalence of type 2 diabetes in youth increased from 0.34 per 1,000 in 2001 to 0.46 per 1,000 in 2009 in the U.S., with higher rates among Hispanic, Black, and Native American populations.</data>
