  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Overweight and obesity in children and adolescents are key risk factors for early-onset type 2 diabetes, especially when combined with other risk factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight and obesity in children and adolescents are key risk factors for early-onset type 2 diabetes, especially when combined with other risk factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight and obesity in children and adolescents are key risk factors for early-onset type 2 diabetes, especially when combined with other risk factors.</data>
