  <data key="d0">Níveis Glicêmicos</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Níveis Glicêmicos refer to blood glucose measurements, including fasting glucose and post-load glucose, used in assessing diabetes risk and complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Níveis Glicêmicos refer to blood glucose measurements, including fasting glucose and post-load glucose, used in assessing diabetes risk and complications.</data>
