</node>
<node id="Limiar Diagnóstico">
  <data key="d0">Limiar Diagnóstico</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limiar Diagnóstico refers to the cutoff values used to distinguish individuals at higher risk of diabetes complications from those at lower risk, varying across studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Limiar Diagnóstico refers to the cutoff values used to distinguish individuals at higher risk of diabetes complications from those at lower risk, varying across studies.</data>
