  <data key="d0">Estudo Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration is a research initiative that analyzed data from 121 prospective studies involving 1.27 million adults to assess cardiovascular complications related to glycemic levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration is a research initiative that analyzed data from 121 prospective studies involving 1.27 million adults to assess cardiovascular complications related to glycemic levels.</data>
