</node>
<node id="Doença Coronariana">
  <data key="d0">Doença Coronariana</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Doença Coronariana is a cardiovascular condition whose risk is significantly increased in individuals with fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dl or diagnosed diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Doença Coronariana is a cardiovascular condition whose risk is significantly increased in individuals with fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dl or diagnosed diabetes mellitus.</data>
