</node>
<node id="Morte Vascular">
  <data key="d0">Morte Vascular</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Morte Vascular refers to deaths caused by vascular diseases, with risk doubled in individuals with diagnosed diabetes or fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dl.&lt;SEP&gt;Morte Vascular refers to deaths caused by vascular diseases, with risk doubled in individuals with diagnosed diabetes or fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dl.</data>
