</node>
<node id="Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral-2h">
  <data key="d0">Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral-2h</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral-2h (TTGO-2h) is a diagnostic test measuring glucose levels two hours after glucose ingestion, used as a gold standard for diabetes diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste de Tolerância à Glicose Oral-2h (TTGO-2h) is a diagnostic test measuring glucose levels two hours after glucose ingestion, used as a gold standard for diabetes diagnosis.</data>
