<node id="Endocrinopathies">
  <data key="d0">Endocrinopathies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are linked to secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are associated with secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are linked to secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are associated with secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are linked to secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrinopathies are disorders of the endocrine system that are associated with secondary diabetes and warrant diabetes screening.</data>
