  <data key="d0">Pancreatic Diseases</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic Diseases are conditions affecting the pancreas that can lead to secondary diabetes and are indications for diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic diseases are conditions that can lead to secondary diabetes and are an indication for diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic Diseases are conditions affecting the pancreas that can lead to secondary diabetes and are indications for diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic diseases are conditions that can lead to secondary diabetes and are an indication for diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic Diseases are conditions affecting the pancreas that can lead to secondary diabetes and are indications for diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic diseases are conditions that can lead to secondary diabetes and are an indication for diabetes screening.</data>
