<node id="Fatty Liver Disease">
  <data key="d0">Fatty Liver Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fatty liver disease, also known as hepatic steatosis, is a condition linked to diabetes and justifies screening for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fatty liver disease, also known as hepatic steatosis, is a condition linked to diabetes and justifies screening for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fatty liver disease, also known as hepatic steatosis, is a condition linked to diabetes and justifies screening for diabetes.</data>
