<node id="Screening For Diabetes Mellitus Type 2">
  <data key="d0">Screening For Diabetes Mellitus Type 2</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Screening For Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 involves periodic testing using HbA1c, GJ, or TTGO to detect pre-diabetes or early diabetes in at-risk individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Screening For Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 involves periodic testing using HbA1c, GJ, or TTGO to detect pre-diabetes or early diabetes in at-risk individuals.</data>
