<node id="Metabolic Steatotic Liver Disease">
  <data key="d0">Metabolic Steatotic Liver Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolic Steatotic Liver Disease is a liver condition associated with insulin resistance and increased risk of diabetes, indicating need for screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic Steatotic Liver Disease is a liver condition associated with insulin resistance and increased risk of diabetes, indicating need for screening.</data>
