  <data key="d0">Antiretroviral Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antiretroviral Agents are medications used in HIV treatment that may contribute to metabolic disturbances and increased diabetes risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Antiretroviral Agents are medications used in HIV treatment that may contribute to metabolic disturbances and increased diabetes risk.</data>
