  <data key="d0">6-Month Screening Interval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">6-Month Screening Interval is a recommended frequency for re-evaluation in individuals with borderline test results or single diagnostic criteria for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;6-Month Screening Interval is a recommended frequency for re-evaluation in individuals with borderline test results or single diagnostic criteria for diabetes.</data>
