<node id="12-Month Screening Interval">
  <data key="d0">12-Month Screening Interval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">12-Month Screening Interval is an annual screening frequency recommended for individuals with pre-diabetes or high-risk profiles such as elevated FINDRISC or multiple risk factors.&lt;SEP&gt;12-Month Screening Interval is an annual screening frequency recommended for individuals with pre-diabetes or high-risk profiles such as elevated FINDRISC or multiple risk factors.</data>
