<node id="36-Month Screening Interval">
  <data key="d0">36-Month Screening Interval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">36-Month Screening Interval is a triennial screening frequency recommended for low-risk individuals with normal test results and low FINDRISC scores.&lt;SEP&gt;36-Month Screening Interval is a triennial screening frequency recommended for low-risk individuals with normal test results and low FINDRISC scores.</data>
