  <data key="d0">1-Hour Post-OgTT Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">1-hour post-OGTT glucose is a metabolic marker shown to improve early prediction of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;1-hour post-OGTT glucose is a metabolic marker shown to improve early prediction of type 2 diabetes.</data>
