  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">OGTT, or oral glucose tolerance test, is a diagnostic method used to assess glucose metabolism and diabetes risk.&lt;SEP&gt;OGTT, or oral glucose tolerance test, is a diagnostic method used to assess glucose metabolism and diabetes risk.</data>
