<node id="β-Cells">
  <data key="d0">β-Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">β-Cells are pancreatic cells responsible for insulin production, whose function deteriorates rapidly in early-onset diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;β-Cells are pancreatic cells responsible for insulin production, whose function deteriorates rapidly in early-onset diabetes.</data>
