<node id="Breakthrough T1D">
  <data key="d0">Breakthrough T1D</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Breakthrough T1D, formerly known as Juvenile Diabetes Research Foundation (JDRF), is an organization that supports research and guidelines for the prevention and management of Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Breakthrough T1D, formerly known as Juvenile Diabetes Research Foundation (JDRF), is an organization that supports research and guidelines for the prevention and management of Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
