  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Herold et al. refers to Dr. Kevan Herold and colleagues who conducted clinical research demonstrating the efficacy of teplizumab in delaying Type 1 Diabetes onset.&lt;SEP&gt;Herold et al. refers to Dr. Kevan Herold and colleagues who conducted clinical research demonstrating the efficacy of teplizumab in delaying Type 1 Diabetes onset.</data>
