<node id="Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 Screening">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 Screening</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 screening is recommended in asymptomatic children and adolescents who are overweight or obese, aged ≥10 years or post-puberty, and have additional risk factors such as family history, acanthosis nigricans, hypertension, dyslipidemia, or polycystic ovary syndrome.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 screening is recommended in asymptomatic children and adolescents who are overweight or obese, aged ≥10 years or post-puberty, and have additional risk factors such as family history, acanthosis nigricans, hypertension, dyslipidemia, or polycystic ovary syndrome.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-309ce40527b1cc8f260e96e195742001</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
