  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Family History Of Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Family History Of Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Family history of Type 2 Diabetes in first- or second-degree relatives is a significant genetic risk factor for developing the disease in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;Family history of Type 2 Diabetes in first- or second-degree relatives is a significant genetic risk factor for developing the disease in children and adolescents.</data>
