</node>
<node id="Simultaneous Measurement">
  <data key="d0">Simultaneous Measurement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Simultaneous measurement refers to the concurrent testing of GJ and HbA1c from a single fasting blood sample for efficient diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Simultaneous measurement refers to the concurrent testing of GJ and HbA1c from a single fasting blood sample for efficient diabetes screening.</data>
