<node id="Tabela 2">
  <data key="d0">Tabela 2</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 2 provides guidelines for initial screening of type 2 diabetes in asymptomatic individuals in Brazil, specifying testing protocols based on financial and technical availability.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 2 provides guidelines for initial screening of type 2 diabetes in asymptomatic individuals in Brazil, specifying testing protocols based on financial and technical availability.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 2 classifies the clinical status of elderly patients into categories such as healthy, compromised, and severely compromised, based on comorbidities and functional status.</data>
