<node id="One-Hour Plasma Glucose">
  <data key="d0">One-Hour Plasma Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One-hour plasma glucose is a metabolic marker used to assess dysglycemia and predict the risk of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;One-hour plasma glucose is a metabolic marker used to assess dysglycemia and predict the risk of type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2977bb9a41689e74de2c536343624744</data>
