  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Management of Hyperglycemia in Type 2 Diabetes is a position statement providing patient-centered guidelines co-authored by the ADA and EASD.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a patient-centered approach to managing type 2 diabetes, issued jointly by the ADA and European Association.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df3628fc721a312bfbaace1de3a4d877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054</data>
