<node id="Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes refers to the glycemic control targets recommended for diabetes patients, particularly in older adults, based on individual health status.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes refers to treatment goals for diabetes as outlined in the Brazilian Diabetes Society's official guideline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-292560db65a76615eea6b62c57efdd3d</data>
