  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comorbidades Limitantes">
  <data key="d0">Comorbidades Limitantes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Comorbidades Limitantes are chronic conditions such as advanced cancer, cardiovascular disease, and advanced diabetic kidney disease that restrict life expectancy and influence treatment targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neoplasia Avançada">
  <data key="d0">Neoplasia Avançada</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neoplasia Avançada is an advanced cancer condition that limits life expectancy and affects individualized diabetes treatment goals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Doença Renal do Diabetes Avançada">
  <data key="d0">Doença Renal do Diabetes Avançada</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Doença Renal do Diabetes Avançada is a severe complication of diabetes that impacts treatment decisions and glycemic targets in older adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Síndrome de Fragilidade">
  <data key="d0">Síndrome de Fragilidade</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Síndrome de Fragilidade is a clinical state in elderly patients associated with increased vulnerability, influencing the need for less stringent diabetes control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tratamento Intensivo da Glicemia">
  <data key="d0">Tratamento Intensivo da Glicemia</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Tratamento Intensivo da Glicemia refers to aggressive blood glucose control strategies that have been linked to higher hypoglycemia and mortality risks in elderly patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estudo ACCORD">
  <data key="d0">Estudo ACCORD</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo ACCORD is a randomized trial assessing cardiovascular risk control in diabetes, which found increased all-cause mortality with intensive treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo ACCORD is a major clinical trial that investigated intensive glucose control in patients with type 2 diabetes and showed increased mortality in the intensive treatment group.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estudo ADVANCE">
  <data key="d0">Estudo ADVANCE</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo ADVANCE is a randomized clinical trial evaluating intensive glycemic control in type 2 diabetes patients, particularly those over 60 or with longer disease duration.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo ADVANCE is a large clinical trial involving elderly diabetic patients that demonstrated higher hypoglycemia rates with intensive glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estudo VADT">
  <data key="d0">Estudo VADT</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo VADT is a diabetes trial conducted in veterans, evaluating cardiovascular outcomes under intensive vs. conventional glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo VADT is a clinical trial focused on veterans with diabetes, showing risks associated with intensive glucose management in older adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meta-Análise">
  <data key="d0">Meta-Análise</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Meta-análise combines data from UKPDS, ACCORD, ADVANCE, and VADT, showing modest reductions in major cardiovascular events with HbA1c reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Meta-Análise refers to a statistical method combining results from multiple studies, showing that better HbA1c control reduces cardiovascular risk without increasing mortality when successfully achieved.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1776689289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
