<edge source="Garrafa Plástica Dura" target="Unidade de Saúde">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A garrafa plástica dura cheia de agulhas deve ser levada à unidade de saúde para descarte correto.</data>
  <data key="d9">coleta especial,descarte final</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637858</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Garrafa Plástica Dura" target="Água Sanitária">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A garrafa de água sanitária pode ser reutilizada como recipiente para o descarte seguro de agulhas usadas.</data>
  <data key="d9">recipiente,reutilização</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637859</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Garrafa Plástica Dura" target="Amaciante">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A garrafa de amaciante pode ser reutilizada como recipiente para o descarte seguro de agulhas usadas.</data>
  <data key="d9">recipiente,reutilização</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637860</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Unidade de Saúde" target="Descarte de Agulhas">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Used needles must be disposed of in a rigid container and delivered to a healthcare unit for safe handling.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety protocol,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638168</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Tissue">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin must be injected into the subcutaneous tissue to ensure proper absorption and avoid complications such as hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must be injected into the subcutaneous tissue to ensure proper absorption and avoid complications like hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,delivery accuracy,injection site</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639103</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Skin Fold">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Forming a skin fold during insulin injection helps ensure the needle reaches subcutaneous tissue and not muscle.</data>
  <data key="d9">proper administration,technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637742</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Insulin Reflux">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin reflux can occur after injection and is prevented by keeping the needle in place for several seconds post-injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintaining the needle in the subcutaneous tissue for several seconds after injection prevents insulin reflux.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication,prevention,prevention method</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639187</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Syringe">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A syringe is used to administer insulin, requiring the plunger to remain pressed during needle withdrawal to ensure full dose delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A syringe is used for insulin injection and requires proper preparation, including air injection and air removal, to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,administration tool,dosing accuracy,technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638391</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Brazilian Diabetes Society">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Brazilian Diabetes Society provides evidence-based guidelines on safe and effective insulin injection techniques.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical recommendation,guideline issuer</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637744</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Alcohol 70%">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Alcohol 70% is applied to the injection site before insulin administration to disinfect the skin and must be allowed to dry completely.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol 70% is used to clean the injection site and vial stopper before insulin injection to maintain hygiene.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of alcohol 70% to clean the skin before insulin injection is a standard practice to prevent infection and ensure a sterile application site.</data>
  <data key="d9">antisepsis,hygiene,infection prevention,site preparation,skin preparation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639177</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pens provide a practical and modern alternative to syringes for insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pen is a device used to administer insulin, requiring specific steps like holding it in place for 10 seconds after injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pen is a commonly used device for insulin injection, offering convenience and accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pen is used for insulin injection, requiring the injection button to be held for at least 10 seconds to ensure full dose delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,delivery device,delivery method,device use,ease of use,modern alternative</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639173</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Insulin Injection Angle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The angle of the needle during insulin injection must be appropriate to ensure insulin reaches subcutaneous fat and not muscle.</data>
  <data key="d9">correct delivery,needle placement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638170</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Prega">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Subcutaneous prega is used during insulin injection to prevent intramuscular delivery, especially in children and thin individuals.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638314</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="4 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 4 mm needle is recommended for insulin injection in children, thin adults, and pregnant women to ensure safe subcutaneous delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The 4 mm needle is considered safe and well-tolerated for insulin injection in all individuals, with minimal insulin leakage.</data>
  <data key="d9">device recommendation,needle selection,safety,tolerance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="8 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An 8 mm needle increases the risk of muscle injection during insulin administration if a subcutaneous prega is not used.&lt;SEP&gt;The 8 mm needle is not recommended for children and adolescents due to the risk of intramuscular insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">device risk,intramuscular injection,needle selection,risk mitigation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639092</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="45° Injection Angle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 45° injection angle is advised during insulin injection in pregnancy to accommodate stretched abdominal skin.</data>
  <data key="d9">angle adjustment,pregnancy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638316</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="90° Injection Angle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 90° injection angle is typically used for insulin injection when using appropriate needle lengths and sufficient subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d9">needle length,standard technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638317</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Injection Sites">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper insulin injection requires selecting safe and accessible body sites such as arms, thighs, buttocks, and abdomen.</data>
  <data key="d9">accessibility,site selection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638318</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Needle Reuse">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reusing needles during insulin injection increases the risk of infection and lipohipertrofia.&lt;SEP&gt;Reusing insulin needles is an unsafe practice that increases the risk of infection, pain, and inaccurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">improper practice,infection risk,safety risk,skin damage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639176</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Sharps Disposal">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Used insulin needles must be disposed of in a rigid container to ensure safety and prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638319</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Skin Care">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper skin care, including cleaning and drying, is essential before insulin injection to prevent complications.</data>
  <data key="d9">hygiene,preparation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638321</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin should not be injected into areas with lipodystrophy to prevent ineffective absorption and further tissue damage.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication,site avoidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638332</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Redness Or Inflammation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin injection should be avoided in areas showing redness or inflammation to prevent worsening of skin conditions.</data>
  <data key="d9">infection sign,site avoidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638332</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Swelling">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Swelling indicates an unsuitable site for insulin injection and must be avoided to ensure safe administration.</data>
  <data key="d9">site contraindication,skin condition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638333</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Lipoatrophy">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipo-hypertrophy can develop from repeated insulin injections in the same location, emphasizing the need for site rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipoatrophy occurs at insulin injection sites and involves progressive loss of subcutaneous fat, forming visible skin depressions.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections in the same location can lead to lipoatrophy, which can be prevented by rotating injection sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections in the same location can lead to lipoatrophy, which can be prevented by rotating injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication,complication prevention,injection risk,injection site care,site rotation,tissue loss</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776642061</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Fat">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin must be injected into subcutaneous fat to ensure correct absorption and avoid entering muscle tissue.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection site,proper delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638388</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Needle Angle">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The correct needle angle is essential during insulin injection to ensure the dose is delivered into subcutaneous fat.&lt;SEP&gt;The angle of needle insertion during insulin injection is determined by patient age, needle length, and subcutaneous tissue thickness to avoid intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">accuracy,anatomical consideration,injection technique,technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639185</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Pregnant Women">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pregnant women must consult their doctor about insulin injection sites, especially avoiding the abdomen in the third trimester.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety,special consideration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638391</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="5 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 5 mm needle is appropriate for all individuals and generally does not require a skin fold during insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">ease of use,needle selection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="6 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 6 mm needle requires a subcutaneous skin fold and specific insertion angles to prevent intramuscular insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">needle selection,technique requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639091</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="12 To 13 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 12 to 13 mm needle poses a high risk of intramuscular injection in all individuals and requires careful technique.</data>
  <data key="d9">high risk,needle selection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639093</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Skin Fold">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous skin fold is used during insulin injection to ensure proper delivery and avoid intramuscular administration.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639093</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Insertion Angle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insertion angle is critical during insulin injection to prevent intramuscular delivery, varying by needle length and patient characteristics.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,precision</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639094</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="High-Flow Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">High-flow needles improve the insulin injection experience by increasing flow, reducing force and time, and enhancing patient confidence.</data>
  <data key="d9">device enhancement,efficiency</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639095</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Table 2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Table 2 outlines evidence-based recommendations for safe and effective insulin injection techniques using various needle lengths.</data>
  <data key="d9">best practices,guideline reference</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639096</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Lipohypertrophy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipohypertrophy develops at sites of repeated insulin injections due to frequent use of the same areas.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication,tissue change</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639098</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Fold">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous fold must be maintained throughout the insulin injection to ensure proper delivery into subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639100</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When switching from lipohypertrophic to healthy tissue, insulin doses may need reduction, and glucose monitoring should be intensified to guide medical decisions.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical monitoring,dose adjustment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639101</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin must be administered via subcutaneous injection into recommended body areas for effective absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,proper technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639162</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="i-Port">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The i-Port is used to reduce pain and discomfort during insulin injections by allowing multiple doses through a single insertion.</data>
  <data key="d9">comfort improvement,injection aid</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639174</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Pain Management in Insulin Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Effective pain management strategies improve patient comfort and increase adherence to insulin injection regimens.</data>
  <data key="d9">adherence support,patient comfort</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639175</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Injection Site">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin should be injected into approved subcutaneous sites such as the abdomen, thigh, or upper arm for optimal absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;The choice of injection site, such as the abdomen, affects insulin absorption and technique, especially in pregnant women.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration location,anatomical variation,recommended area</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639177</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Subcutaneous Pinch">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous pinch is used during insulin injection to prevent intramuscular delivery and reduce patient discomfort.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,safety measure</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639184</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Needle Hold Time">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Maintaining the needle in the subcutaneous tissue for at least 5 to 10 seconds after insulin injection ensures full dose delivery and prevents insulin reflux.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose accuracy,injection protocol</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639188</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Needle Gauge">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Thicker needles (lower gauge) deliver insulin faster, while thinner needles (higher gauge) may reduce injection pain.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection speed,pain reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643726</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection" target="Needle Length">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Shorter needle lengths (4–5 mm) reduce the risk of intramuscular injection and lipohypertrophy.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection safety,site complication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643726</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="American Diabetes Association" target="Insulin Injection Site Rotation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The American Diabetes Association provides official recommendations on structured insulin injection site rotation to optimize diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical guidelines,health recommendations</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638173</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="American Diabetes Association" target="Injection Site Rotation">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The American Diabetes Association recommends rotating injection sites within a body area for one week before switching regions.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Diabetes Association recommends rotating injection sites weekly by exhausting all quadrants in one region before switching.</data>
  <data key="d9">guideline,recommendation</data>
