  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Diabetes Mellitus Type 2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The efficacy of insulin pens was primarily evaluated in adult patients with type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">patient population,treatment efficacy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637715</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Patient Preference">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Studies show a tendency for patients to prefer insulin pens over syringes, though based on non-validated tools.</data>
  <data key="d9">device acceptance,user satisfaction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637716</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Quality Of Life">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pen use showed improvements in certain SF-36 sub-scales, indicating better quality of life.</data>
  <data key="d9">patient-reported outcome,well-being</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637717</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Insulin Syringe">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Both insulin pens and syringes allow precise insulin dosing, with pens and smaller syringes (30U or 50U) preferred for low or finely adjusted doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens are associated with better adherence, persistence, and clinical outcomes compared to syringes.</data>
  <data key="d9">device comparison,dosing precision,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637720</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="R2 Recommendation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The R2 recommendation endorses the use of insulin pens based on improved HbA1c outcomes and reduced hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical evidence,guideline recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637721</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Flow Test">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The flow test ensures that the insulin pen delivers insulin properly by clearing air and verifying unobstructed flow.&lt;SEP&gt;Performing a flow test before injection helps ensure the full registered dose is delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;The flow test on the insulin pen confirms that insulin is properly dispensed before setting the full dose.</data>
  <data key="d9">device function,device maintenance,device preparation,dosage verification,dose accuracy,functionality check</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637866</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Manufacturer Instructions">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Patients are advised to read manufacturer instructions for correct use of insulin pens, including dose setting and injection technique.</data>
  <data key="d9">device usage,operational guidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
