<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Needle">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A new needle is attached to the insulin pen before each use to ensure sterility and proper delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A needle is attached to the insulin pen for subcutaneous insulin delivery and should not be reused.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is screwed onto the insulin pen for injection and must be discarded after use.</data>
