</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Disposable Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Disposable insulin pens are pre-filled and discarded after use, offering convenience for patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A disposable insulin pen is a type of insulin pen that comes pre-filled and is discarded after use.</data>
  <data key="d9">convenience,device type</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643723</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Reusable Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reusable insulin pens require insulin cartridges and must be matched with the same manufacturer's refills.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable insulin pen is a type of insulin pen that uses replaceable cartridges and may include memory functions.</data>
  <data key="d9">device type,refill use,reusability</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
