  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Needle Reuse">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pen needles should not be reused more than three times to avoid complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Reusing insulin pen needles beyond three applications increases the risk of infection, pain, and improper insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">device maintenance,infection risk,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
