<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Insulin">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pens are used for convenient and accurate insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pen is used to deliver accurate doses of insulin and should not be refrigerated to avoid damaging the mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens are used to administer insulin doses conveniently and accurately, especially in clinical and home settings.</data>
