</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Syringe">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Compared to syringes, insulin pens offer greater convenience, portability, and access to shorter needles.</data>
  <data key="d9">convenience,device comparison</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639093</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Sistema Único de Saúde">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In 2019, Sistema Único de Saúde began dispensing disposable insulin pens, improving access to insulin therapy in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d9">healthcare access,public distribution</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639093</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="High-Flow Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pen supports high-flow needles with extra-thin walls, improving injection efficiency and user experience.</data>
  <data key="d9">device compatibility,performance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639096</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pens allow precise dosing of rapid-acting insulin, including half-unit increments, improving treatment accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose accuracy,ease of use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639104</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Insulin Injection Procedure">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pen is an alternative device used in the insulin injection procedure, offering ease of use and dose accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,medical device</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639124</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Insulin Flow Test">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin flow test ensures the pen is functioning correctly by expelling a small amount of insulin before injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">device verification,dosage accuracy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639125</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pen" target="Manufacturer's Instruction Manual">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The manufacturer's instruction manual provides essential information for the correct use of the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d9">device operation,user guidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
