</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Insulin Injection Procedure">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The syringe is used in the insulin injection procedure to accurately measure and deliver the prescribed insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The syringe is used to carry out the insulin injection procedure by drawing and delivering the correct dose.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,administration tool,dosage measurement,medical device</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
