  <data key="d12">1776638700</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Insulin Mixture">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Only syringes with fixed needles should be used for mixing insulins.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration tool,fixed needle requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638701</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="U40 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">U40 insulin must be used with appropriately calibrated syringes to ensure correct dosage delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing accuracy,equipment compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639105</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="U200 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">U200 insulin requires specific syringes designed for high-concentration insulin to prevent dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing accuracy,equipment compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639106</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="U500 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">U500 insulin must be administered using compatible syringes to ensure precise and safe dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing accuracy,equipment compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639106</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Syringe Waste">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Syringes are intended for single use and must be discarded after one application to maintain hygiene and safety.</data>
  <data key="d9">disposal practice,single use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639107</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The needle is attached to the syringe to enable subcutaneous insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection tool,medical equipment assembly</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639124</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Using a syringe graduated in milliliters for insulin can result in dosing errors, such as administering 0.68 mL instead of 6.8 units, leading to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing error,medication preparation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639157</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Syringe" target="Intramuscular Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Using a 13 mm needle with a syringe for insulin increases the risk of intramuscular injection, especially in individuals with less subcutaneous fat, leading to faster absorption and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">incorrect administration,needle length risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639158</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rotating injection sites is recommended to prevent lipodystrophy caused by repeated insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper injection site rotation is essential to prevent lipodystrophy, which can impair insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication prevention,injection practice,prevention,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639177</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Glycemic Variability">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper rotation of injection sites helps reduce glycemic variability by promoting consistent insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption consistency,treatment optimization</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637723</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Brazilian Diabetes Society">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Brazilian Diabetes Society recommends rotating insulin injection sites to improve treatment outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical guideline,recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637723</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Glycemic Variation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Changing the location of insulin injections can lead to glycemic variation, requiring intensified blood glucose monitoring and possible adjustment of medical prescription.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical effect,monitoring need</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637744</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Lipohypertrophy">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rotating injection sites helps prevent lipohypertrophy, a common complication of repeated injections in the same area.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper and consistent rotation of injection sites helps prevent lipohypertrophy and supports subcutaneous tissue health.</data>
  <data key="d9">complication prevention,management,prevention,treatment adherence</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5</data>
