  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is typically administered via subcutaneous injection to ensure gradual and effective absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is administered via subcutaneous injection, requiring proper technique to ensure accurate dosing and avoid complications.</data>
