<edge source="Insulin" target="Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipodystrophy is a skin condition that develops at insulin injection sites due to repeated use.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy at injection sites can result from insulin use and may affect how insulin is absorbed.</data>
