</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diabetes mellitus is characterized by the body's inability to produce or properly use insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes mellitus occurs when the body fails to produce or properly use insulin, disrupting glucose regulation.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease mechanism,hormonal regulation</data>
