<edge source="Insulin" target="Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper insulin administration is necessary to regulate blood glucose levels and maintain diabetes control.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin enables glucose to move from the bloodstream into cells to be used for energy.</data>
