<edge source="Insulin" target="Lipohipertrofia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Repeated insulin injections in the same location can cause lipohipertrofia, which disrupts insulin absorption and makes blood glucose control more difficult.</data>
