  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Unopened insulin must be stored in a refrigerator between 2 °C and 8 °C to remain effective.&lt;SEP&gt;Unopened insulin must be stored in a refrigerator between 2 °C and 8 °C to remain effective.</data>
