  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper insulin preparation involves rolling cloudy insulin, disinfecting the vial, drawing air and insulin, and removing air bubbles from the syringe.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper insulin preparation must be rigorously inspected before each injection to ensure safe and effective delivery.</data>
