<edge source="Insulin" target="Heparin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin and heparin are often stored near each other, increasing the risk of mix-ups due to similar packaging.</data>
  <data key="d9">medication confusion,storage proximity</data>
