</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Vaccine">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin and vaccines are sometimes stored in the same refrigerator compartment, posing risks if not properly labeled and segregated.</data>
  <data key="d9">refrigeration sharing,storage conflict</data>
