</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Subcutaneous Route">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous route is the primary method for insulin delivery, allowing controlled absorption through capillary networks.</data>
  <data key="d9">gradual absorption,standard administration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639112</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Intramuscular Route">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The intramuscular route is used in emergencies for faster insulin action but increases the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">emergency use,rapid absorption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639117</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Intravenous Route">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The intravenous route is used in ICU settings under strict monitoring and is limited to rapid-acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">direct delivery,intensive care</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639118</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Intradermal Route">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The intradermal route results in delayed insulin absorption and potential dose loss, leading to hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">incorrect administration,slow absorption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639119</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Insulin Appearance">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Checking insulin appearance before use helps identify physical changes indicating spoilage or improper storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The appearance of insulin must be inspected before use; if it is cloudy (when it should not be), contains particles, or has changed color, it should not be used.</data>
  <data key="d9">degradation sign,quality check,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639248</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Safe Insulin Practices">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Adhering to safe insulin practices minimizes risks during preparation, storage, and administration.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical safety,error prevention</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639151</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Patient Education">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Patient education includes demonstrating insulin techniques and requiring patients or caregivers to repeat the process to evaluate understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;Educating patients and parents is essential for proper insulin use, including avoiding massage after injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">caregiver instruction,knowledge assessment,self-management,treatment adherence</data>
