</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Institute for Safe Medication Practices">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Institute for Safe Medication Practices classifies insulin as a high-alert medication due to the potential for serious harm if misused.</data>
