  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pancreatic extract being studied by Banting and Best is the substance later known as insulin, referred to tentatively as "Isletin" during the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The pancreatic extract being studied by Banting and Best is the substance later known as insulin, referred to tentatively as "Isletin" during the experiments.</data>
