  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is the key hormone involved in regulating blood sugar and is central to the treatment of pancreatic diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is the key hormone involved in regulating blood sugar and is central to the treatment of pancreatic diabetes.</data>
