  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">People with cystic fibrosis–related diabetes should be treated with insulin to achieve individualized glycemic goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is the primary treatment for Cystic Fibrosis–Related Diabetes, used to induce an anabolic state and promote weight gain.</data>
