<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CGM helps detect and prevent hypoglycemia by providing real-time glucose readings and alarms.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM helps prevent hypoglycemia by providing real-time alerts and trend data, allowing timely interventions.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring reduces the frequency and severity of hypoglycemic events in patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM is particularly useful for patients with asymptomatic hypoglycemia, allowing alarms to be set for glucose thresholds.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical application,clinical benefit,patient safety,risk detection,risk prevention,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce5b147555a2c6ba2644e98fb3d31f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a08dc7008091e5ab01812c301e0aab1</data>
