<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Some CGM systems are integrated with insulin pumps like Medtronic MiniMed to support automated insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pumps can be used with continuous glucose monitoring devices to track blood glucose levels and adjust insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Some CGM systems, like Medtronic MiniMed, are used in conjunction with insulin pumps to support automated insulin delivery.</data>
