  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CGM reduces the need for traditional glucose monitoring methods like frequent finger pricks.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM reduces or replaces the need for traditional finger-prick glucose testing in many diabetes management scenarios.</data>
