  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CGM is safe and effective for children, though consistent daily use may be difficult to maintain.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM is safe and effective for children, though daily adherence may be challenging despite benefits in glucose control.</data>
