</edge>
<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Glycemic Variability">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Continuous glucose monitoring provides data to evaluate glycemic variability, which is not adequately reflected by HbA1c alone.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitoring is a primary method for calculating glycemic variability.</data>
