<edge source="FreeStyle Libre" target="Calibration">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The FreeStyle Libre does not require calibration with finger-prick tests, enhancing user convenience.&lt;SEP&gt;FreeStyle Libre does not require calibration with finger-prick tests, enhancing ease of use and adherence.&lt;SEP&gt;The FreeStyle Libre does not require calibration during its 14-day sensor lifespan, unlike other CGM systems.</data>
