<edge source="Caneta Recarregável" target="Refil">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The rechargeable insulin pen requires a 3 mL insulin refill cartridge, which must be replaced when empty.&lt;SEP&gt;A caneta recarregável deve usar refis do mesmo fabricante para garantir aplicação correta da dose de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d9">cartridge compatibility,compatibility,refillable system,usage requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebdb9452013f0e340884677832714553</data>
