<edge source="Insulin Storage" target="In-Use Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In-use insulin can be kept at room temperature for up to 30 days, away from heat and light.&lt;SEP&gt;In-Use Insulin can be stored at room temperature up to 30°C for 4 to 8 weeks after opening.</data>
