<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Insulin Aspart">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin aspart is used in patients with type 1 diabetes and is considered safe for both mother and fetus during pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin aspart is used as a treatment for managing blood glucose levels in patients with type 1 diabetes.</data>
