</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="TEDDY Study">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The TEDDY study tracks children to understand environmental and immunological factors leading to type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The TEDDY study demonstrated that 21% of children with at least one autoantibody at age 3 developed type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease development,disease onset,longitudinal research</data>
