</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The presence of multiple autoantibodies such as those against GAD, insulin, IA-2, and zinc transporter 8 is used to screen for and define early stages of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">autoimmune markers,disease detection</data>
