<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="IPEX Syndrome">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Type 1 diabetes can occur as part of IPEX syndrome, a systemic autoimmune disorder caused by mutations in the FOXP3 gene.&lt;SEP&gt;IPEX syndrome includes type 1 diabetes as one of its endocrine manifestations due to genetic immune dysregulation.</data>
