  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Diabetic Ketoacidosis">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diabetic ketoacidosis is a common and serious initial presentation of type 1 diabetes, especially in children.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic ketoacidosis is a common and life-threatening complication at the onset of type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic ketoacidosis is a frequent initial presentation of type 1 diabetes, especially in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic ketoacidosis frequently occurs at the time of diagnosis of type 1 diabetes in children and adults.</data>
  <data key="d9">acute complication,acute presentation,clinical manifestation,clinical presentation,diagnostic complication,disease complication</data>
