</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Islet Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The presence of two or more islet autoantibodies is a strong predictor for the development of clinical type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The presence of islet autoantibodies is a key biomarker for the development and progression of type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet autoantibodies are used to predict the onset of type 1 diabetes in at-risk individuals.</data>
  <data key="d9">biomarker,diagnostic marker,disease prediction,disease progression</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c47356c03c704ef89b9f41bbd939bc8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05070e0755e36e3375d401400cf75fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0510d1781e9c07bebd7a7422d453cbf2</data>
