</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="B-Cell–Centric Classification Schema">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The b-cell–centric classification schema proposes redefining diabetes, including type 1 diabetes, based on beta-cell dysfunction and disease progression.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease classification,pathophysiological framework</data>
