</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="C-Peptide">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Low or undetectable C-peptide levels indicate loss of endogenous beta-cell function in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;C-peptide levels are used to monitor residual insulin production in individuals with type 1 diabetes.</data>
