  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Adolescents are prescribed rapid-acting insulin in odd and small doses, necessitating accurate injection tools.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing requirements,medical treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639101</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="4 mm Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 4 mm needle is appropriate for adolescents, providing a safe, less painful insulin injection with minimal risk of muscle penetration.</data>
  <data key="d9">reduced pain,safe injection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639103</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="Type 2 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Due to insufficient data, there is not enough evidence to recommend insulin pumps for adolescents with type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">data paucity,evidence limitation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f357ebc59eb6ed3dd2035a13da0df52f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643834</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="4 mm Needle" target="Moscow Clinical Trial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In the Moscow clinical trial, group 1 received 4 mm needles for each insulin injection as part of the structured training intervention.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical intervention,medical device</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637748</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="4 mm Needle" target="Lo Presti et al. Study">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Lo Presti et al. study supports the use of 4 mm needles in children and adolescents based on measured skin thickness.</data>
  <data key="d9">evidence-based recommendation,pediatric use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639103</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="4 mm Needle" target="Hirsch et al. Study">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Hirsch et al. study evaluated the safety and effectiveness of 4 mm needles in insulin injection, contributing to clinical guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical evaluation,safety assessment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639104</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="5 mm Needle" target="Adults">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 5 mm needle is safe and well-tolerated in adults, suitable for subcutaneous insulin delivery across various body types.</data>
  <data key="d9">high tolerance,safe injection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639103</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="6 mm Needle" target="Fixed-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 6 mm needle is part of fixed-needle syringes and is preferred for being less painful and safer.</data>
  <data key="d9">needle size,optimal choice</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638124</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="6 mm Needle" target="Syringe With Fixed Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 6 mm needle, commonly used with fixed-needle syringes, is safer and less painful, reducing the risk of intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">needle length,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638339</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="6 mm Needle" target="Adults">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 6 mm needle is recommended for all adults, as it safely delivers insulin into subcutaneous tissue without reaching muscle.</data>
  <data key="d9">safe injection,universal use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639104</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="6 mm Needle" target="Gibney et al. Study">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Gibney et al. study provides evidence that 6 mm needles are appropriate for all adults due to consistent dermal thickness.</data>
  <data key="d9">adult use,evidence-based recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639104</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Skin Fold" target="Insulin Injection Technique">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Skin fold is used in insulin injection technique to prevent intramuscular delivery, especially with needles 6 mm or longer.&lt;SEP&gt;Creating a skin fold during injection helps ensure insulin is delivered into subcutaneous fat, especially in lean individuals.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection accuracy,injection safety,intramuscular prevention,tissue targeting</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638165</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Skin Fold" target="Tabela 1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Tabela 1 indicates when a skin fold is required or dispensable based on needle length and patient age or body composition.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,safety protocol</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637748</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Fixed-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fixed-needle syringes are recommended over removable-needle types to reduce dead space and improve dose precision.</data>
  <data key="d9">device recommendation,dosing accuracy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637715</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U100 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Syringes must be graduated in international units to match U100 insulin concentration and prevent dosing errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin syringes are calibrated for U100 insulin to ensure accurate dosing in international units.</data>
  <data key="d9">compatibility,dose accuracy,dose measurement,unit compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637716</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="R2 Recommendation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The R2 recommendation compares insulin pens favorably against syringes in clinical outcomes and patient adherence.</data>
  <data key="d9">device efficacy,guideline comparison</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637717</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Air Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Air must be injected into the insulin vial before drawing insulin to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing accuracy,preparation step</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638164</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Air Removal">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Air must be removed from the insulin syringe before injection to ensure the correct insulin dose is delivered.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing accuracy,injection preparation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638165</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Mixing Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Mixing rapid- and intermediate-acting insulin in a syringe requires correct sequence and a fixed-needle syringe to prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,contamination prevention</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Used Syringe Disposal">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Used insulin syringes must be discarded in a designated sharps container to prevent injury.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety practice,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638167</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Preparation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin syringe is used during insulin preparation to accurately measure and draw insulin from the vial.</data>
  <data key="d9">drug measurement,medical tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638707</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Fixed Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin syringes with fixed needles eliminate dead space, ensuring more accurate delivery of the intended dose.</data>
  <data key="d9">accuracy,device design</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639097</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Removable Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin syringes with removable needles may retain insulin in the dead space, increasing the risk of dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d9">device limitation,dosing inaccuracy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639099</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Syringe Graduation Scale">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The syringe's graduation scale must match the prescribed insulin dose to ensure correct measurement, whether even or odd.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose accuracy,measurement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639129</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The rubber stopper of the insulin vial must be disinfected with 70% alcohol before the syringe needle penetrates it.</data>
  <data key="d9">preparation step,sterility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639130</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Air Injection into Vial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Air is injected into the insulin vial using the syringe to prevent vacuum formation and ease insulin aspiration.</data>
  <data key="d9">aspiration facilitation,pressure equalization</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639131</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rapid-acting insulin can be combined with intermediate-acting insulin in the same insulin syringe for immediate or subsequent use.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,medication compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639187</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Intermediate-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed with rapid-acting insulin or its analogs in the same syringe under proper conditions.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,medication compatibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639188</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Application Devices">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin syringe is a type of insulin application device used for accurate subcutaneous delivery of insulin doses.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration tool,medical device</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639644</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Syringe Graduation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Syringe graduation defines the measurement scale on insulin syringes, enabling precise dosing in whole or fractional units.</data>
  <data key="d9">calibration,measurement scale</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639646</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U-100 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin syringes are marked for U-100 insulin to ensure accurate dosing of this concentration.</data>
  <data key="d9">device compatibility,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643722</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U-80 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Specialized insulin syringes with U-80 markings are used for the older U-80 insulin concentration.</data>
  <data key="d9">device compatibility,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643722</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U-40 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin syringes with U-40 markings are used for older insulin concentrations and veterinary insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">insulin delivery,veterinary use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643723</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U-500 Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">U-500 syringes are specifically designed for the administration of U-500 insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">high-concentration delivery,specialized device</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b94e98f4cb6f97fceae5e6d8c30c871b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776643724</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fixed-Needle Syringe" target="Insulin Mixing">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fixed-needle syringes are required for mixing two types of insulin in a single injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,treatment flexibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637716</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fixed-Needle Syringe" target="R3 Recommendation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The R3 recommendation promotes fixed-needle syringes to enhance dose accuracy and reduce dead space.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing precision,guideline recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637717</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fixed-Needle Syringe" target="U100 Syringe">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fixed-needle syringes are a recommended type of U100 syringe due to no dead space and precise dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">device type,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
