<edge source="Fixed-Needle Syringe" target="Insulin Dose Accuracy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fixed-needle syringes are recommended for insulin preparation because they reduce dead space and improve dose accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing precision,safety recommendation</data>
