<edge source="Removable-Needle Syringe" target="Dead Space">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Removable-needle syringes have dead space, which traps insulin and leads to inaccurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;The removable-needle syringe has dead space that retains up to 10 units of insulin, causing waste and potential dosing inaccuracies.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing error,medication waste,product waste</data>
