</edge>
<edge source="Removable-Needle Syringe" target="Intramuscular Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 13 mm needle of the removable-needle syringe poses a high risk of intramuscular insulin delivery, which can lead to hypoglycemia.</data>
