<edge source="Intermediate-Acting Insulin" target="Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed with rapid-acting insulin for immediate or delayed use under proper conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid-acting and intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed in the same syringe if the correct order is followed to maintain efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,combination use,insulin compatibility,mixing protocol</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
