<edge source="Intermediate-Acting Insulin" target="Basal Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intermediate-acting insulin is used as part of basal insulin therapy to manage blood sugar between meals and during sleep.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermediate-acting insulin is used as part of basal insulin therapy to manage blood sugar between meals and during sleep.</data>
