</edge>
<edge source="Intermediate-Acting Insulin" target="Mixed Insulins">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intermediate-acting insulin is combined with short- or rapid-acting insulin in mixed insulins to provide both immediate and extended glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d9">formulation,insulin combination</data>
