</edge>
<edge source="Rapid-Acting Insulin" target="Bolus Insulin">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rapid-acting insulin is used as bolus insulin before meals to control postprandial blood glucose spikes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid-acting insulin is used as bolus insulin before meals to control post-meal blood sugar spikes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid-Acting Insulin is used as part of Bolus Insulin to manage blood glucose spikes after meals.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid-acting insulin is used as bolus insulin before meals to control post-meal blood sugar spikes.</data>
  <data key="d9">fast action,functional role,insulin therapy,mealtime dosing,mealtime use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d0d8750807baddcd948055c83422234</data>
