  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Rapid-Acting Insulin" target="100-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 100-unit syringe is graduated in 2-unit increments, making it impossible to accurately measure odd doses of rapid-acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing limitation,measurement inaccuracy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
