  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Rapid-Acting Insulin" target="Mealtime Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rapid-acting insulin is used as mealtime insulin due to its quick onset and short duration, effectively managing post-meal glucose spikes.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose control,onset and duration</data>
