<edge source="Insulin Homogenization" target="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">NPH insulin must be properly homogenized before use to ensure uniform concentration and clinical effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Neutral Protamine Hagedorn insulin must be homogenized before use to maintain potency and clinical predictability.</data>
