<edge source="Insulin Preparation" target="Hand Hygiene">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Washing and drying hands is a required step before beginning insulin preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing and drying hands is a required step before beginning insulin preparation to maintain aseptic conditions.</data>
