<edge source="Lipohipertrofia" target="Rotation Of Injection Sites">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Proper rotation of insulin injection sites helps prevent lipohipertrofia by avoiding repeated trauma to the same skin area.</data>
  <data key="d9">prevention strategy,risk reduction</data>
