  <data key="d12">1776637728</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Diabetes Type 2">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin therapy may be needed in diabetes type 2 when oral medications are insufficient or blood glucose levels are too high.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin therapy is a necessary and integral part of diabetes type 2 management, not a punishment or failure of care.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin therapy is a natural progression in the management of Diabetes Type 2, not a punishment, and should be introduced as part of integrated and stigma-free care.</data>
  <data key="d9">blood sugar control,disease management,medical management,treatment option,treatment progression</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639156</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Gestational Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is a safe and effective treatment for managing blood sugar in gestational diabetes and in pregnant individuals with pre-existing diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">pregnancy management,treatment safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638335</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Syringe and Vial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The syringe and vial method is a conventional way to deliver insulin, requiring careful preparation and dosage accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,traditional use</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638340</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Insulin Pump (CSII)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump provides continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion, allowing precise and adjustable insulin delivery throughout the day.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,continuous delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638341</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Blood Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Blood glucose monitoring is essential for determining the correct insulin dose and adjusting therapy based on sugar levels.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosage calculation,treatment adjustment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638342</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Healthcare Professional">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Healthcare professionals are responsible for adjusting insulin doses and teaching patients how to monitor glucose and calculate insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare professionals must be trained and equipped to educate insulin users on safe and effective treatment practices.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose adjustment,supervision,training,treatment guidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639172</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Illness">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">During illness, the body may require more insulin temporarily due to increased blood sugar from stress and inflammation.</data>
  <data key="d9">metabolic stress,temporary need</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638344</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Post-Surgical Condition">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin therapy may be needed temporarily after surgery to maintain stable blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose control,temporary need</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638344</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Test Frequency">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The frequency of glucose testing depends on the type of insulin regimen, with more intensive therapies requiring more frequent checks.</data>
  <data key="d9">monitoring requirement,treatment intensity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638369</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Glycemic Control">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin therapy via injections or pump is used for strict glycemic control during pregnancy.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose regulation,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638372</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Diabetes Education">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diabetes education is essential to ensure safe and effective insulin therapy, helping patients manage their condition correctly.</data>
  <data key="d9">patient training,self-management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639160</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Insulin Dose Splitting">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Splitting high insulin doses into two injections improves absorption and reduces discomfort during therapy.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption optimization,dose management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639171</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="New Insulin Delivery Recommendations">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The New Insulin Delivery Recommendations study provides evidence-based guidelines for safe insulin preparation and administration.</data>
  <data key="d9">best practices,clinical guidelines</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639172</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Lipodystrophies">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin therapy is used to manage diabetes in lipodystrophy patients, often requiring high doses due to insulin resistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">metabolic management,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d000f0bd5254e1a2df1aba208ecc4170</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776640899</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pump therapy is a form of insulin therapy that improves metabolic control and reduces glucotoxicity and lipotoxicity.</data>
  <data key="d9">delivery method,treatment modality</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d000f0bd5254e1a2df1aba208ecc4170</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776640900</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Metreleptin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The need for insulin therapy significantly decreases after initiating metreleptin, with some patients discontinuing insulin altogether.</data>
