<edge source="Type 2 Diabetes" target="Insulin Resistance">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Type 2 diabetes is primarily caused by insulin resistance, where cells fail to respond to insulin effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin resistance frequently coexists with beta-cell dysfunction in the development of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin resistance is a key underlying factor in the development of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin resistance is a core mechanism underlying the development of type 2 diabetes.</data>
