<edge source="Type 2 Diabetes" target="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pump therapy in type 2 diabetes is under discussion, with some evidence supporting its use in specific cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump therapy can be offered to youth and adults with type 2 diabetes who are on multiple daily injections and meet usage criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump therapy can be offered to youth and adults with type 2 diabetes who are on multiple daily injections and capable of using the device safely.</data>
