<edge source="Insulin Injection Technique" target="Injection Angle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Injection angle, either 90° or 45°, is determined by needle length and patient anatomy to ensure subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration precision,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637748</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection Technique" target="Insulin Refill">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique includes keeping the injector button pressed until the needle is fully withdrawn to prevent blood reflux into the insulin refill.</data>
  <data key="d9">backflow prevention,device integrity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639128</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection Technique" target="Insulin Reservoir">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique requires full needle withdrawal while maintaining pressure to avoid blood entering the insulin reservoir.</data>
  <data key="d9">backflow prevention,device integrity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639128</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Injection Technique" target="Extra-Thin Wall Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Using extra-thin wall needles is recommended to reduce insulin loss during injection, especially for high doses.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection efficiency,volume control</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639129</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Angle" target="Tabela 1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Tabela 1 defines the appropriate injection angles (90° or 45°) depending on needle length and patient characteristics to avoid intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration guidance,risk prevention</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776637750</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Angle" target="Needle Sizes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The injection angle (45° or 90°) depends on the needle size and patient age, ensuring proper subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration technique,patient adaptation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638212</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Angle" target="Needle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The angle of needle insertion (45° or 90°) depends on needle length and patient age to ensure proper subcutaneous delivery and avoid intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection technique,patient safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776638263</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
