</edge>
<edge source="Syringes" target="Proper Disposal">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Syringes must be disposed of properly in sharps containers to prevent injury and contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringes must be disposed of properly in sharps containers to prevent injury and contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringes must be disposed of properly in sharps containers to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
