</edge>
<edge source="Needles" target="Proper Disposal">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Needles must be discarded in puncture-resistant containers to ensure safe disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Needles must be discarded in puncture-resistant containers to ensure safe disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Needles must be discarded in puncture-resistant containers to ensure safe disposal.</data>
