<edge source="Insulin Pens" target="Lente Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lente insulin requires the pen to be moved slowly 20 times before use to ensure proper mixing.&lt;SEP&gt;Lente insulin (NPH) is used with insulin pens and must be discarded after 30 days of opening.</data>
