</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pens" target="Rapid Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rapid insulin types like Humulin R and Novolin R are administered via insulin pens and remain effective for 30 days after opening.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,shelf life</data>
