  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ultralente insulins such as Lantus®, Levemir®, and Tresiba® are delivered via insulin pens with varying shelf lives after opening.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,duration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
