  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ultrarrápida insulins like Humalog®, Novorapid®, and Apidra® are used with insulin pens and last 30 days after opening.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration method,duration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
