<edge source="Insulin Transport" target="Thermal Bag">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A thermal bag is used to transport insulin safely, ensuring it does not come into direct contact with ice or freezing elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should be transported in a thermal bag with gel packs to maintain temperatures between 2°C and 8°C.</data>
  <data key="d9">safe handling,safe transit,temperature control</data>
