  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Arm">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The arm is a moderate-speed site for insulin absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;The arm is a secondary injection site with absorption rate slower than the abdomen but faster than the thigh or buttocks.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption speed,injection site,moderate absorption,secondary site</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639110</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Thigh">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The thigh has a slower insulin absorption rate than the abdomen and arms.&lt;SEP&gt;The thigh has a slower insulin absorption rate, which may delay glucose-lowering effects.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption speed,delayed effect,injection site,slower absorption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639111</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Physical Exercise">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Exercise enhances insulin absorption due to increased blood flow, raising the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">hypoglycemia risk,increased absorption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639116</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="High Ambient Temperature">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">High temperatures increase insulin absorption rate by boosting circulation at the injection site.</data>
  <data key="d9">accelerated absorption,thermal effect</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639117</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Fever">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fever accelerates insulin absorption through elevated body temperature and blood flow.</data>
  <data key="d9">faster action,metabolic increase</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639117</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Hot Bath">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Taking a hot bath after insulin injection can speed up absorption and increase hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">heat exposure,rapid uptake</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639118</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Hot Compress">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Applying a hot compress to the injection site accelerates insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">enhanced absorption,localized heating</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639119</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Massage">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Massaging the injection site can increase insulin absorption and should be avoided to prevent unintended hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">faster uptake,mechanical stimulation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639120</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Cold Compress">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Using a cold compress slows insulin absorption by reducing local blood flow.</data>
  <data key="d9">cooling effect,delayed absorption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639121</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Cold Bath">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A cold bath decreases insulin absorption rate, potentially leading to hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">cold exposure,reduced uptake</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639121</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Dehydration">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Dehydration reduces insulin absorption by limiting tissue perfusion and diffusion.</data>
  <data key="d9">fluid deficit,impaired delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776639122</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Used Needle" target="Proper Container">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Used needles must be placed in a designated sharps container to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
