<edge source="Diabetes Education" target="Elliott P. Joslin">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Elliott P. Joslin promoted diabetes education and helped train nurses to teach patients about insulin use and lifestyle management.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin emphasized patient education and pioneered home-based diabetes training after insulin's discovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin emphasized the importance of patient education in diabetes management and expanded the role of nurses in community education.</data>
  <data key="d9">advocacy,historical contribution,medical education,patient training</data>
