  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">After receiving the extract, Dog #35's blood sugar level dropped from .38 to .18, indicating the extract's effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;After receiving the extract, Dog #35's blood sugar level dropped from .38 to .18, indicating the extract's effectiveness.</data>
