  <data key="d8">Glicemia Plasmática de Jejum is a standard test for diagnosing diabetes mellitus in asymptomatic individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Plasmática de Jejum is a standard test for diagnosing diabetes mellitus in asymptomatic individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia Plasmática de Jejum is a standard test for diagnosing diabetes mellitus in asymptomatic individuals.</data>
