  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Teste de Sobrecarga de Glicose is used to diagnose diabetes mellitus by measuring glucose levels after ingestion of 75g of glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste de Sobrecarga de Glicose is used to diagnose diabetes mellitus by measuring glucose levels after ingestion of 75g of glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste de Sobrecarga de Glicose is used to diagnose diabetes mellitus by measuring glucose levels after ingestion of 75g of glucose.</data>
