  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Daily capillary glucose monitoring is a key method for managing diabetes mellitus and achieving stable glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily capillary glucose monitoring is a key method for managing diabetes mellitus and achieving stable glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily capillary glucose monitoring is a key method for managing diabetes mellitus and achieving stable glycemic control.</data>
