  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Brazilian Diabetes Society Guidelines provide evidence-based recommendations for diagnosing and classifying diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical guidance,diagnostic recommendations</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e575f95ec5a02f7900989e00da53749f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
