  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fasting glucose ≥126 mg/dl is a diagnostic criterion for diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting glucose is recommended as an initial test for screening type 2 diabetes.</data>
