  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The presence of metabolic dysfunction-associated steatotic liver disease is linked to the development of type 2 diabetes, and diabetes increases the risk of progression to severe liver disease.</data>
  <data key="d9">bidirectional risk,disease progression</data>
