<edge source="Diabetes Mellitus" target="Antipsychotics">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Antipsychotic medications like clozapine and olanzapine are associated with increased risk of type 2 diabetes through weight gain and insulin dysregulation.</data>
