<edge source="Insulin Resistance" target="HIV-Associated Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin resistance is a major metabolic consequence of HIV-associated lipodystrophy, driven by altered adipokine profiles and chronic inflammation.</data>
