  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Worsening insulin resistance leads to the progression of acanthosis nigricans in lipodystrophy patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Acanthosis Nigricans is a skin manifestation strongly associated with insulin resistance.</data>
