<edge source="Insulin Resistance" target="Overweight">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Excess weight, including overweight, causes a degree of insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Overweight individuals may have insulin resistance even without meeting obesity criteria.</data>
