  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Obesity contributes to insulin resistance, a key factor in the development of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Excess body weight, including obesity, contributes to insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Obesity contributes to insulin resistance, a key driver in the development of DM2 in youth.</data>
