<edge source="Sensor De Glicose" target="Pele">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">O sensor de glicose é colado na pele, geralmente no braço ou barriga, para funcionar corretamente.&lt;SEP&gt;The sensor de glicose is attached to the skin, typically on the arm or abdomen, for continuous glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d9">adhesion,device placement,monitoring method</data>
