<edge source="Sensor De Glicose" target="Transmissor">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">O sensor converte os níveis de glicose em um sinal elétrico que é enviado ao transmissor.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor works with a transmitter to send glucose readings to a monitoring device.&lt;SEP&gt;The sensor de glicose sends glucose data to the transmissor, which relays it to a reader or smartphone.</data>
