<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Diabetes Control And Complications Trial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Diabetes Control and Complications Trial used insulin pumps in its studies during the 1970s to evaluate their effectiveness in diabetes management.</data>
