<edge source="Subcutaneous Pinch" target="Hemoglobin A1c Levels">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The use of subcutaneous pinch during insulin injection is associated with improved glycemic control, as reflected in reduced hemoglobin A1c levels.</data>
