<edge source="Insulin Pump Therapy" target="Older Adults With Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Older adults with type 1 diabetes benefit from ongoing insulin pump therapy, and access should be maintained regardless of age.</data>
