  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diabetes Care published multiple studies evaluating the safety, effectiveness, and discontinuation of insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical evidence,research publication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cdbe9f47931df265e815faee2c67f81b</data>
