</edge>
<edge source="Metabolic Syndrome" target="Partial Lipodystrophies">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Partial lipodystrophies are often associated with metabolic syndrome, including diabetes and severe hypertriglyceridemia, even in the absence of obesity.</data>
