<edge source="Partial Lipodystrophies" target="Family History">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Family history, including consanguinity, is crucial for diagnosing partial lipodystrophies to identify genetic patterns and hereditary causes.</data>
  <data key="d9">consanguinity,genetic inheritance</data>
