</edge>
<edge source="Partial Lipodystrophies" target="Generalized Lipodystrophies">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Generalized and partial lipodystrophies are distinct clinical forms of the disorder, with different treatment recommendations.</data>
