  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Injecting insulin directly into lipohipertrofia lesions results in reduced and more variable insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">impaired absorption,treatment error</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-202f1dba3a8254f9d5867b459cdbcfa2</data>
