  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Intralesional Insulin Injection" target="Postprandial Glycemia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin injected into lipohypertrophic tissue causes a significant rise in postprandial glycemia, with increases of at least 26%.</data>
