<edge source="Lipodistrofia Generalizada" target="Hypertriglyceridemia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hypertriglyceridemia is a key metabolic feature of generalized lipodystrophy, often severe and present from infancy.</data>
  <data key="d9">laboratory finding,metabolic complication</data>
