</edge>
<edge source="Lipodistrofia Generalizada" target="Hipoleptinemia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The near absence of adipose tissue in generalized lipodystrophy leads to very low serum leptin levels, causing hypoleptinemia.</data>
