</edge>
<edge source="Lipodistrofia Generalizada" target="Bichat's Fat Pad">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The absence of Bichat's fat pad is a characteristic phenotypic change in generalized lipodystrophy.</data>
