  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">People with HIV should be screened for prediabetes due to increased risk associated with their condition and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals with HIV are at higher risk for prediabetes and diabetes, particularly due to antiretroviral therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals with HIV are at higher risk of developing prediabetes due to antiretroviral therapies.</data>
