  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CSII is considered an alternative to MDI when MDI is impractical, ineffective, or leads to poor glycemic outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion is compared to multiple daily injections, with studies showing better HbA1c reduction in poorly controlled type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;CSII is compared to MDI in pharmacoeconomic studies, showing higher costs but potential clinical benefits.</data>
