  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In clinical studies, insulin glargine U100 was administered in conjunction with insulin aspart as prandial insulin in a basal-bolus treatment approach.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal-bolus regimen,combination therapy</data>
