<edge source="Sensitivity Factor" target="Correction Bolus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Sensitivity Factor is used to compute the correction bolus by determining how much 1 unit of insulin lowers blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose calculation,glucose correction</data>
