  <data key="d12">1776641886</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Correction Bolus" target="Total Bolus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The total bolus is calculated by adding the correction bolus (if needed) to the mealtime bolus.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose summation,pre-meal dosing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1223db4d3629243420a6e867a9ba6988</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776641881</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mealtime Bolus" target="Total Bolus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The total bolus includes the mealtime bolus, which covers carbohydrate intake during a meal.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose summation,pre-meal dosing</data>
