<edge source="Defining Moments Canada" target="Insulin100">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Defining Moments Canada is the organization behind the Insulin100 project, an initiative dedicated to documenting, commemorating, and educating the public about the discovery and development of insulin. Through this project, Defining Moments Canada has created and manages an online resource titled "Insulin100: The Discovery and Development," which serves as a comprehensive educational platform highlighting the historical milestones and significance of insulin. The initiative emphasizes key events and figures involved in insulin's discovery, aiming to preserve and promote public understanding of this pivotal medical breakthrough.

The Insulin100 project functions both as a historical archive and a commemorative effort, reflecting Defining Moments Canada's mission to spotlight transformative moments in Canadian and global history. By synthesizing historical narratives, scientific developments, and educational content, the initiative ensures that the legacy of insulin’s discovery is accessible to a broad audience. Multiple descriptions consistently affirm Defining Moments Canada's central role in originating and overseeing the project, underscoring its commitment to public history and science education through the Insulin100 initiative.</data>
  <data key="d9">digital documentation,historical commemoration,historical documentation,project creation,project sponsorship,public education</data>
