  <data key="d8">Dog #410 is the first dog to receive an injection of the pancreatic extract, showing a marked physiological effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #410 died after receiving the pancreatic extract and falling into a diabetic coma, indicating a negative experimental result.</data>
