</edge>
<edge source="Pancreatic Diabetes" target="Trauma">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Trauma to the pancreas is a recognized cause of pancreatic diabetes due to damage to insulin-secreting tissue.&gt;</data>
