</edge>
<edge source="Hba1c" target="Hiv Infection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In HIV-infected individuals, HbA1c may underestimate true glycemia, affecting the accuracy of diabetes and prediabetes diagnosis.</data>
