</edge>
<edge source="Hba1c" target="Mortality Risk">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HbA1c levels below 6% or above 8.5%, as well as high variability over time, are predictors of increased mortality risk in elderly diabetic patients.</data>
