</edge>
<edge source="C-Peptide" target="Nmol/L">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C-peptide concentrations can be expressed in nmol/L, and online tools facilitate conversion from conventional units.</data>
  <data key="d9">measurement,unit conversion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-00f6ea581f76ddc15bc463d1eccc4496</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647014</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C-Peptide" target="Ng/Ml">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C-peptide levels are commonly reported in ng/mL, which can be converted to SI units such as pmol/L.</data>
  <data key="d9">measurement,unit conversion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-00f6ea581f76ddc15bc463d1eccc4496</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647015</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C-Peptide" target="Ng/Dl">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C-peptide values in ng/dL are equivalent to ng/100mL and are used in certain clinical reporting systems.</data>
  <data key="d9">measurement,unit conversion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-00f6ea581f76ddc15bc463d1eccc4496</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647016</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C-Peptide" target="Ng/100Ml">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ng/100mL is a unit for C-peptide that is numerically equivalent to ng/dL and used in some diagnostic contexts.</data>
  <data key="d9">measurement,unit conversion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-00f6ea581f76ddc15bc463d1eccc4496</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647016</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C-Peptide" target="Ng%">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ng% is a unit expression for C-peptide levels, representing concentration per 100 mL of blood, used in select clinical reports.</data>
  <data key="d9">measurement,unit conversion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-00f6ea581f76ddc15bc463d1eccc4496</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
