  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Gestational Diabetes Mellitus" target="Two-Step Approach">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The two-step approach is an alternative method for diagnosing GDM, involving an initial 50-g screen followed by a 100-g OGTT.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic strategy,screening process</data>
