  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The HAPO Study provided critical evidence linking hyperglycemia during pregnancy to adverse outcomes, influencing diagnostic thresholds for gestational diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical evidence,research impact</data>
