<edge source="Altered Tissue Oxygenation" target="Blood Glucose Testing">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Altered tissue oxygenation can impact glucose readings, especially in oxygen-dependent devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Altered tissue oxygenation can impact glucose readings, especially in oxygen-dependent devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Altered tissue oxygenation can impact glucose readings, especially in oxygen-dependent devices.</data>
