</edge>
<edge source="Poor Perfusion At Test Site" target="Blood Glucose Testing">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Poor perfusion at the test site can result in unreliable glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Poor perfusion at the test site can result in unreliable glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Poor perfusion at the test site can result in unreliable glucose measurements.</data>
