</edge>
<edge source="Paracetamol" target="Blood Glucose Testing">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Paracetamol may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Paracetamol may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Paracetamol may interfere with certain glucose monitoring devices, especially those using specific enzyme systems.</data>
  <data key="d9">false reading,interfering substance</data>
