  <data key="d12">1776688863</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Maltose" target="Glucose Oxidase Devices">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Glucose oxidase-based devices are not affected by maltose, making them resistant to this interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase devices are not affected by maltose, unlike GDH-PQQ based systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase-based devices are not affected by maltose, making them resistant to this interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase devices are not affected by maltose, unlike GDH-PQQ based systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase-based devices are not affected by maltose, making them resistant to this interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose oxidase devices are not affected by maltose, unlike GDH-PQQ based systems.</data>
  <data key="d9">interference avoidance,no interference,technology difference,technology resistance</data>
