  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Control solution should be used when unexpected glucose results occur repeatedly.&lt;SEP&gt;Control solution should be used when unexpected glucose results occur repeatedly.&lt;SEP&gt;Control solution should be used when unexpected glucose results occur repeatedly.</data>
