  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">After a glucometer is dropped or damaged, a control solution test is recommended to ensure proper function.&lt;SEP&gt;After a glucometer is dropped or damaged, a control solution test is recommended to ensure proper function.&lt;SEP&gt;After a glucometer is dropped or damaged, a control solution test is recommended to ensure proper function.</data>
