<edge source="Impaired Glucose Tolerance" target="Type 2 Diabetes Prevention">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Interventions for preventing type 2 diabetes have primarily shown efficacy in individuals with impaired glucose tolerance, with or without elevated fasting glucose.</data>
