<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Staging" target="Stage 1 Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Stage 1 of type 1 diabetes is defined by autoimmunity and normoglycemia, with multiple islet autoantibodies present but no glucose abnormalities.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease progression,presymptomatic detection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-85b36fc8288de16b0682d3530712dcb4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647610</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Staging" target="Stage 2 Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Stage 2 involves both autoimmunity and dysglycemia, including impaired fasting glucose and/or impaired glucose tolerance.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease progression,dysglycemia onset</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-85b36fc8288de16b0682d3530712dcb4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647610</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Staging" target="Stage 3 Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Stage 3 is characterized by overt hyperglycemia and symptoms, meeting standard diagnostic criteria for diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical diagnosis,symptom onset</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-85b36fc8288de16b0682d3530712dcb4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647611</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Staging" target="Table 2.1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Table 2.1 presents the staging framework for type 1 diabetes, detailing autoimmunity, glycemic status, and diagnostic markers for each stage.</data>
  <data key="d9">data representation,diagnostic framework</data>
