</edge>
<edge source="IPEX Syndrome" target="Forkhead Box Protein 3">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The dysfunction of forkhead box protein 3 due to FOXP3 gene mutation leads to IPEX syndrome.</data>
