</edge>
<edge source="Oral Glucose Tolerance Test" target="A1C Test">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The A1C test may be used alongside or instead of the oral glucose tolerance test for diagnosing diabetes and detecting prediabetes.</data>
