</edge>
<edge source="Oral Glucose Tolerance Test" target="Cystic Fibrosis–Related Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Oral Glucose Tolerance Test is the recommended screening method for diagnosing cystic fibrosis–related diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Annual screening for cystic fibrosis–related diabetes should be conducted using the oral glucose tolerance test beginning at age 10.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnosis,diagnostic protocol,screening method</data>
