<edge source="Oral Glucose Tolerance Test" target="Screening for Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The oral glucose tolerance test is used to identify dysglycemia and is evaluated for sensitivity and specificity in diabetes screening.</data>
