<edge source="Checkpoint Inhibitors" target="Immunotherapy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Checkpoint inhibitors are a form of immunotherapy that can induce or worsen autoimmune diabetes by disrupting immune tolerance.</data>
