  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="IADPSG Criteria" target="One-Step Strategy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The IADPSG criteria define the one-step strategy and have been adopted internationally as the preferred method for diagnosing GDM.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic framework,international adoption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7869f89a9c58ace31efe679a36aab7cf</data>
