  <data key="d12">1776647727</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="IADPSG Criteria" target="Two-Step Approach">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pregnancies diagnosed with GDM under IADPSG criteria but not under the two-step approach have comparable outcomes to those diagnosed by the two-step method.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic sensitivity,outcome equivalence</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7869f89a9c58ace31efe679a36aab7cf</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647734</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Lifestyle Therapy" target="Mild GDM">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Most individuals with mild GDM can be effectively managed using lifestyle therapy alone.</data>
  <data key="d9">disease management,treatment approach</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-357f19fa58c4dd99dcd7b47a984b4383</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647689</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="IADPSG" target="One-Step Method">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The one-step method applies IADPSG criteria for diagnosing GDM without prior screening.</data>
  <data key="d9">criteria application,diagnostic alignment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d936160aac8a6b8ba40b196280422fe5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
