<edge source="MODY" target="GCK">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Mutations in the GCK gene are a known cause of MODY, a monogenic form of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;GCK mutations cause GCK-MODY, a form of MODY that typically does not require glucose-lowering therapy.</data>
