<edge source="MODY" target="HNF1A">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Mutations in the HNF1A gene are a common cause of MODY and contribute to its clinical presentation.&lt;SEP&gt;HNF1A mutations cause HNF1A-MODY, a subtype of MODY treatable with sulfonylureas.</data>
  <data key="d9">gene-disease association,genetic cause,mutation,sulfonylurea therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ad3acc8463b5ff47461b1c16ae2559cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-311745e1d3e05390ed93d1e683c07243</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647807</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY" target="HNF4A">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">De novo mutations in the HNF4A gene may be more frequent in MODY than previously assumed.&lt;SEP&gt;HNF4A mutations cause HNF4A-MODY, a form of MODY responsive to sulfonylureas.</data>
  <data key="d9">de novo mutation,gene-disease association,genetic cause,sulfonylurea response</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ad3acc8463b5ff47461b1c16ae2559cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-311745e1d3e05390ed93d1e683c07243</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647808</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY" target="MODY Probability Calculator">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The MODY probability calculator is used to estimate the likelihood of MODY in patients, particularly for identifying candidates for GCK and HNF1A genetic testing.</data>
  <data key="d9">risk assessment,screening</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ad3acc8463b5ff47461b1c16ae2559cb</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647233</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY" target="Genetic Testing">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing is recommended for individuals with atypical diabetes and a family history suggestive of autosomal dominant inheritance to diagnose MODY.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnosis,inheritance pattern</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-50c85dba4b510b2463c6766fd8a2dbf5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647678</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Lipoatrophic Diabetes" target="Diabetes Classification Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipoatrophic Diabetes is listed as a form of diabetes due to genetic defects in insulin action.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic defect,insulin resistance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647001</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pancreatogenic Diabetes" target="Diabetes Classification Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pancreatogenic Diabetes is recognized as resulting from conditions like pancreatitis, cystic fibrosis, and hemochromatosis.</data>
  <data key="d9">exocrine pancreas disease,secondary diabetes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647002</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Endocrinopathy-Associated Diabetes" target="Diabetes Classification Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Endocrinopathy-Associated Diabetes is linked to disorders such as acromegaly and Cushing's syndrome in the guideline.</data>
  <data key="d9">hormonal imbalance,secondary diabetes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647004</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Diabetes Classification Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Drug-Induced Diabetes is attributed to agents like glucocorticoids, pentamidine, and thiazides in the classification.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical induction,medication effect</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647004</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Vacor">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Vacor induces diabetes by chemically destroying pancreatic beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d9">beta cell toxicity,chemical induction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647005</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Pentamidine">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pentamidine can cause diabetes by damaging pancreatic beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d9">beta cell damage,drug side effect</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647006</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Nicotinic Acid">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Nicotinic Acid contributes to diabetes by increasing insulin resistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">insulin resistance,metabolic disruption</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Glucocorticoids">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Glucocorticoids induce diabetes by promoting insulin resistance and increasing glucose production.</data>
  <data key="d9">hyperglycemia,insulin resistance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Thyroid Hormone">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Excess Thyroid Hormone can lead to diabetes by accelerating metabolism and impairing glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose dysregulation,metabolic acceleration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Diazoxide">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diazoxide induces hyperglycemia by inhibiting insulin release from beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d9">hyperglycemia,insulin suppression</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647009</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Beta-Adrenergic Agonist">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Beta-Adrenergic Agonists raise blood glucose levels by stimulating glycogen breakdown.</data>
  <data key="d9">hyperglycemia,increased glycogenolysis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647012</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Thiazides">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Thiazides are associated with reduced insulin sensitivity and increased risk of diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">diuretic effect,impaired glucose tolerance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647012</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Phenytoin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phenytoin may interfere with insulin secretion, contributing to diabetes development.</data>
  <data key="d9">altered insulin secretion,drug-induced diabetes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647013</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Drug-Induced Diabetes" target="Interferon Gamma">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Interferon Gamma can trigger autoimmune diabetes by promoting immune attack on beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d9">autoimmune activation,beta cell destruction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647014</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infection-Related Diabetes" target="Diabetes Classification Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Infection-Related Diabetes is associated with congenital rubella and cytomegalovirus as noted in the guideline.</data>
  <data key="d9">secondary diabetes,viral cause</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647005</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infection-Related Diabetes" target="Congenital Rubella">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Congenital Rubella infection can lead to diabetes by damaging pancreatic beta cells during fetal development.</data>
  <data key="d9">beta cell damage,viral etiology</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647009</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infection-Related Diabetes" target="Cytomegalovirus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Cytomegalovirus infection is linked to diabetes through direct or indirect effects on pancreatic function.</data>
  <data key="d9">pancreatic involvement,viral infection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5847db7a558804738e20dca9fd8d746</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647010</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
