</edge>
<edge source="Diabetes Mitocondrial" target="Mutação M.3243 A&gt;G">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The m.3243 A&gt;G mutation in mitochondrial DNA is the primary genetic cause of mitochondrial diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic cause,molecular basis</data>
