</edge>
<edge source="Metformina" target="Rastreamento Para Diabetes Mellitus Tipo 2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Metformin is used as part of the intervention for individuals identified through diabetes screening to prevent or manage Type 2 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">pharmacological intervention,treatment strategy</data>
