</edge>
<edge source="Diabetes Tipo 2 Propenso À Cetose" target="Peptídeo C">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In ketosis-prone type 2 diabetes, detectable or normal levels of C-peptide after resolution of ketoacidosis indicate residual beta-cell function and support the diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d9">beta-cell function,diagnostic criterion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-fe02e01a76e16ee223061696b4bcb10b</data>
