</edge>
<edge source="Diabetes Tipo 2 Propenso À Cetose" target="Autoanticorpos Associados Ao DM">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The absence of autoantibodies in patients with ketoacidosis at diagnosis helps differentiate ketosis-prone type 2 diabetes from type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">autoimmunity exclusion,diagnostic criterion</data>
