  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-GCK" target="GCK">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MODY-GCK is caused by mutations in the GCK gene, which leads to mild, non-progressive hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic cause,mutation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647122</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-HNF1A" target="HNF1A">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MODY-HNF1A is caused by mutations in the HNF1A gene and is characterized by early-onset hyperglycemia and glycosuria.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic cause,mutation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647122</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-HNF1A" target="HNF">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HNF (Hepatocyte Nuclear Factor) is the protein family to which HNF1A belongs, linking it to MODY-HNF1A.</data>
  <data key="d9">gene classification,transcription factor</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647124</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-HNF4A" target="HNF4A">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MODY-HNF4A results from mutations in the HNF4A gene and is associated with good response to sulfonylureas.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic cause,mutation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647122</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-HNF1B" target="HNF1B">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MODY-HNF1B is caused by mutations in the HNF1B gene and is associated with urogenital malformations and renal cysts.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic cause,mutation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647123</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MODY-HNF1B" target="HNF">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HNF (Hepatocyte Nuclear Factor) includes HNF1B, whose mutations cause MODY-HNF1B and associated urogenital and renal abnormalities.</data>
  <data key="d9">gene classification,transcription factor</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-cd082b3c0d74b1afd1fdd6eb23b6afd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647125</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Clinical Diagnosis Uncertainty">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing improves diabetes classification accuracy but is less accessible than autoantibody testing.</data>
  <data key="d9">biomarker integration,classification improvement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647110</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Sulfonylurea">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing can identify mutations that allow switching treatment from insulin to sulfonylurea in about 90% of KATP channel mutation cases.</data>
  <data key="d9">precision medicine,treatment selection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b31a7157123c058dcd7f3c29001cd7f8</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647126</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Diabetes Mellitus Neonatal">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing is recommended after excluding other causes and can confirm neonatal diabetes in over 80% of cases.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic confirmation,treatment guidance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b31a7157123c058dcd7f3c29001cd7f8</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647127</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Wolfram Syndrome">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing in suspected Wolfram syndrome confirms diagnosis and enables early management of associated comorbidities.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic confirmation,early intervention</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b31a7157123c058dcd7f3c29001cd7f8</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647142</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Brazilian Diabetes Society Guideline">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Brazilian Diabetes Society Guideline recommends genetic testing for neonatal diabetes and syndromic forms like Wolfram syndrome.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical recommendation,diagnostic protocol</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b31a7157123c058dcd7f3c29001cd7f8</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647143</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Genetic Testing" target="Maturity-Onset Diabetes of the Young">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Genetic testing is warranted for individuals with MODY to confirm diagnosis and guide treatment decisions.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical implication,diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2773e1fe0d693b781b10643e037fc085</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
