<edge source="Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes" target="Tabela 2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes includes Tabela 2 as a structured summary of screening recommendations for type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">guideline content,structured recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8c3c6ce19ad6bc3cc3df22e5e10b0702</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689107</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes" target="TTGO-1h">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes recommends the use of TTGO-1h for diabetes screening in high-risk individuals with normal fasting glucose and HbA1c.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical recommendation,screening guideline</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-fb6ee71a842cf35dd741ee96a80c624b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689131</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes" target="FINDRISC">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The guideline uses FINDRISC scores to determine whether additional testing like TTGO-1h is recommended for diabetes screening.</data>
  <data key="d9">risk assessment,screening protocol</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-fb6ee71a842cf35dd741ee96a80c624b</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689132</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Anti-Insulin" target="Exogenous Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">After initiation of exogenous insulin, patients may develop antibodies that interfere with anti-insulin autoantibody testing.</data>
  <data key="d9">antibody development,test interference</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647109</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Anti-Insulin" target="Insulin Therapy Initiation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Initiation of insulin therapy leads to development of antibodies against exogenous insulin, which can interfere with anti-insulin autoantibody assays.</data>
  <data key="d9">test interference,timing consideration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647110</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Exogenous Insulin" target="Anti-Insulin Antibody Test">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The anti-insulin antibody test may be compromised due to interference from exogenous insulin used in therapy.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic limitation,test interference</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-45f87c8aceb9340a61d8283da6282edc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647234</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Carr et al." target="Guideline for Diabetes Classification">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Carr et al.'s study on clinical models combining age, BMI, and autoantibodies informed the Brazilian Diabetes Society's classification guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d9">evidence source,research contribution</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647109</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Carr et al." target="Random C-Peptide">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Carr et al. validated the use of C-peptide in diabetes classification through a clinical case-control study correlated with pancreatic histopathology.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical correlation,research validation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-45f87c8aceb9340a61d8283da6282edc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647237</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Lynam et al." target="Guideline for Diabetes Classification">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lynam et al.'s cohort study demonstrated improved diabetes classification with biomarkers, supporting guideline recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d9">biomarker validation,evidence source</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8631f035300b1b65337131c6c6079b19</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647110</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Diagnosis of Diabetes" target="Adult-Onset Autoimmune Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Adult-onset autoimmune diabetes is often misdiagnosed as type 2 diabetes, requiring specific diagnostic tools.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical challenge,misdiagnosis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1fb7f10473b84f2de23852febe7ef317</data>
