<edge source="Random C-Peptide" target="Jones et al.">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Jones et al. proposed a cutoff of 0.6 ng/ml or 0.2 nmol/l for random C-peptide to distinguish absolute insulin deficiency in type 1 diabetes from other types.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d9">cutoff proposal,research contribution</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-45f87c8aceb9340a61d8283da6282edc</data>
