  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The International AIDS Society-USA panel's recommendations on managing metabolic complications in HIV therapy were published in the Journal of Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndromes.</data>
  <data key="d9">medical guidelines,publication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-15a18ecfcb20fceb4fd80ab22186964e</data>
