</edge>
<edge source="Fr1da" target="Screening Program">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fr1da is a European screening program that conducts autoantibody testing in children to identify those at risk for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">autoantibody testing,program implementation</data>
