</edge>
<edge source="DCCT Assay" target="A1C Test">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The A1C test must be standardized to the DCCT assay to ensure accurate and reliable results for diabetes diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d9">methodological accuracy,standardization</data>
