  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="ARV-Associated Hyperglycemia" target="Antihyperglycemic Agents">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In some cases, antihyperglycemic agents are required to manage hyperglycemia even after adjusting ARV therapy.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose control,treatment necessity</data>
