  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Testing Interval" target="Screening">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The appropriate screening interval is unclear, but a 3-year interval aims to reduce false positives and ensure timely retesting.</data>
  <data key="d9">false result management,frequency recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb9c311fc732ddd262c56ddc696da954</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776647552</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Community Screening" target="Health Care Setting">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Community screening outside healthcare settings is generally not recommended due to lack of follow-up and treatment access.</data>
  <data key="d9">follow-up access,screening environment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eb9c311fc732ddd262c56ddc696da954</data>
