  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="CVD Events" target="Intensive Multifactorial Intervention">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Although intensive treatment improved risk factors, it did not significantly reduce the incidence of first CVD events.</data>
  <data key="d9">outcome,prevention</data>
