  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Intensive Multifactorial Intervention" target="European Randomized Controlled Trial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The European randomized controlled trial evaluated the impact of intensive multifactorial intervention compared to routine care after diabetes screening.</data>
