<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Stage 1" target="Autoantibody Screening">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Autoantibody screening can identify individuals in type 1 diabetes stage 1 by detecting two or more positive autoantibodies in the absence of glycemic changes.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic method,early detection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7dad8318811ce10b7f639b13057d611f</data>
