</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes Stage 2" target="Autoantibody Screening">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Autoantibody screening can identify individuals in type 1 diabetes stage 2 by detecting two or more positive autoantibodies along with mild dysglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic method,early detection</data>
