</edge>
<edge source="TTGO 1h" target="San Antonio Heart Study">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The San Antonio Heart Study demonstrated that TTGO-1h was a stronger predictor of future type 2 diabetes than TTGO-2h or fasting glucose.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d9">longitudinal evidence,risk prediction</data>
