</edge>
<edge source="Mulheres Grávidas Com Diabetes" target="1h Após Refeição">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pregnant women with diabetes are advised to measure glucose one hour after meals to maintain glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose monitoring,postprandial control</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776648290</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mulheres Grávidas Com Diabetes" target="2h Após Refeição">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pregnant women with diabetes should check glucose levels two hours after meals as part of routine monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose monitoring,postprandial control</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1776648291</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Profissionais de Saúde" target="Pessoas com Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Profissionais de saúde têm a responsabilidade de ensinar pessoas com diabetes a interpretar os dados de glicemia para avaliar a eficácia da terapia e tomar decisões clínicas.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical guidance,education</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c8b4d53f9928520ac64a197b59db6862</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Glicemia_SBD.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776688885</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pessoas com Diabetes" target="Rede de Apoio">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A rede de apoio auxilia as pessoas com diabetes no manejo da doença, incluindo o registro e interpretação dos valores de glicemia e decisões terapêuticas.</data>
  <data key="d9">shared responsibility,support system</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c8b4d53f9928520ac64a197b59db6862</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Glicemia_SBD.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776688889</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Medições de Glicemia" target="Computador">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">As medições de glicemia podem ser transferidas diretamente para um computador com programas informatizados, permitindo acesso em rede ou impressão dos dados.</data>
  <data key="d9">data transfer,digital access</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c8b4d53f9928520ac64a197b59db6862</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Glicemia_SBD.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776688890</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ttgo 1h" target="Pre Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The TTGO-1h test with a threshold of ≥155 mg/dL is recommended for detecting prediabetes and predicting future diabetes risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">early detection,risk prediction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689066</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R1 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and outlines the primary diagnostic criteria for diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic criteria,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689069</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R2 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and specifies the use of random plasma glucose for diagnosis in symptomatic individuals.</data>
  <data key="d9">recommendation inclusion,symptom-based diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689070</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R3">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R3 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and allows diagnosis of diabetes when both fasting glucose and HbA1c thresholds are met in the same sample.</data>
  <data key="d9">dual criterion diagnosis,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689071</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R4">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R4 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and recommends TTGO-1h over TTGO-2h for diagnosing type 2 diabetes and prediabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">recommendation inclusion,test preference</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689072</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R5">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R5 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and defines the glucose thresholds for TTGO-1h in diagnosing diabetes and detecting prediabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">diagnostic cutoffs,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689073</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R6">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R6 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and defines the population groups recommended for type 2 diabetes screening.</data>
  <data key="d9">recommendation inclusion,screening indication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689073</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R7">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R7 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and recommends fasting glucose and/or HbA1c as first-line tests for screening.</data>
  <data key="d9">initial screening test,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689074</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R8">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R8 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and recommends TTGO-1h for further evaluation in individuals with prediabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">follow-up testing,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689075</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R9">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R9 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and recommends TTGO-1h to complement screening in high-risk individuals with normal initial results.</data>
  <data key="d9">complementary testing,recommendation inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689076</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tabela de Recomendações" target="R10">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R10 is listed in the Tabela de Recomendações and advises against additional testing in low-risk individuals with normal screening results.</data>
  <data key="d9">recommendation inclusion,test limitation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea289ce35cdd947df9d56e9e4b5c8566</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689077</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="R1" target="HbA1c %">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R1 recommends maintaining HbA1c below 7.0% to prevent microvascular complications in diabetes, as long as it does not lead to frequent or severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">microvascular complication prevention,treatment goal</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0a582234d1973113fc899208b5457f47</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1776689396</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="R3" target="Nível B">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">R3 is supported by Nível B evidence, indicating moderate-quality data from clinical studies.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical guideline,evidence quality</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
