<edge source="Estudo ACCORD" target="Meta-Análise">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The meta-analysis combined ACCORD results with other trials to evaluate the impact of intensive glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Later analysis of ACCORD and meta-analyses indicated cardiovascular benefits in patients who successfully achieved intensive HbA1c targets.</data>
  <data key="d9">cardiovascular benefit,data integration,evidence synthesis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d8434e93fae47721617db0727fcd99b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
