  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The meta-analysis incorporated ADVANCE trial data to analyze cardiovascular risk reduction associated with HbA1c lowering.</data>
  <data key="d9">data integration,evidence synthesis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d39cd334b01ad820816bf3cb108c0e27</data>
