<edge source="The Lancet Diabetes &amp; Endocrinology" target="Farbes A">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Farbes A published a study on HbA1c variability and mortality in older diabetic patients in The Lancet Diabetes &amp; Endocrinology.</data>
  <data key="d9">publication,research dissemination</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7203a21c31cbdae88ee8bc33914cd054</data>
